  <div class="gs-scroll">
    <button class="div-draw" id="ta-ask-now">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 01-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 01-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 01-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 01-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 014.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 013.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 018 8v.5z"/></svg>
      让TA现在问一次
    </button>
    <button class="div-draw" id="ta-ask-survey-open" style="margin-top:10px">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 11l3 3L20 6"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11"/></svg>
      设置批量提问问卷
    </button>
    <div class="set-group glass">
      <div class="gs-row"><span>TA 偶尔向你提问</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ta-ask-enable"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>使用系统预设问题</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ta-ask-default" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>回应接聊天字卡/词典（文字+单选）</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ta-ask-chatcard"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>触发概率</span><input type="range" id="ta-ask-prob" min="1" max="100" step="1" class="tc-range"><span class="tc-prob-val" id="ta-ask-prob-val">5%</span></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>自动弹窗概率</span><input type="range" id="ta-ask-popup" min="0" max="100" step="1" class="tc-range"><span class="tc-prob-val" id="ta-ask-popup-val">70%</span></div>
      <div class="gs-row" style="cursor:pointer"><span>问卷答题结束时间</span><button type="button" id="ta-ask-deadline" class="tc-input deadline-btn" style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:170px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px">未设置</button><button type="button" id="ta-ask-deadline-clear" style="flex:none;margin-left:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e5e5e5);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#999)">清除</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-tabs" id="ta-ask-tabs" style="padding:6px 12px 8px">
      <button class="cc-tab sel" data-tab="sys">系统预设</button>
      <button class="cc-tab" data-tab="mine">我的添加</button>
    </div>
    <div class="tc-search-wrap" style="padding:0 12px 8px">
      <input type="text" id="ta-ask-search" class="tc-input" placeholder="搜索问题…" style="width:100%">
    </div>
    <div id="ta-ask-sys-panel">
      <div id="ta-ask-sys-cats"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="ta-ask-mine-panel" hidden>
      <div class="set-group glass">
        <div class="cal-card-title" style="padding:14px 14px 0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:4px"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg>批量导入问题</div>
        <div class="tc-addform">
          <select id="ta-ask-batch-cat" class="tc-input">
            <option value="daily">日常询问</option>
            <option value="care">关心询问</option>
            <option value="interact">互动询问</option>
            <option value="world">两个世界</option>
          </select>
          <div class="dec-inp-wrap" style="flex:1 0 100%"><textarea id="ta-ask-batch" class="tc-input" rows="6" placeholder="每行一个问题，如：&#10;你吃饭了吗？&#10;现在在做什么？&#10;&#10;单选题格式：第一行【问题】，下面每行一个选项，如：&#10;【今晚想吃什么？】&#10;火锅&#10;烧烤&#10;寿司"></textarea><button type="button" class="dec-inp-clear" data-clear="ta-ask-batch" aria-label="清空" title="清空">✕</button></div>
          <button class="ta-add-btn" style="width:100%" id="ta-ask-batch-add">批量导入到所选分类</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="ta-ask-mine-cats"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dc-credit">单选题、多选题功能参考：小红书 @FelixFelicis（9416318007）的「帮我决定」「多人决定」</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 批量提问问卷（独立页面：用户批量出题 · 联系人作答交卷） -->
<div class="page" id="page-ta-ask-survey" hidden>
  <div class="chat-head">
    <span class="ch-back" id="ta-survey-back">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
    </span>
    <span class="ch-name">批量提问问卷</span>
  </div>
  <div class="gs-scroll">
    <div class="set-group glass" style="padding:14px">
      <div class="cal-card-title" style="padding:0 0 8px">问卷题目（批量设置）</div>
      <div class="dec-inp-wrap" style="flex:1 0 100%"><textarea id="ta-survey-text" class="tc-input" rows="12" placeholder="单选题：第一行【问题】，下面每行一个选项，如：&#10;【今晚想吃什么？】&#10;火锅&#10;烧烤&#10;寿司&#10;&#10;多选题：题干里写「（多选）」，也可写「（多选·最多2）」给这一题单独限个数，下面每行一个选项，如：&#10;【今晚想吃点什么？（多选·最多2）】&#10;火锅&#10;烧烤&#10;寿司&#10;&#10;文字题：第一行【问题】，下一行只写一个「一」，如：&#10;【今天过得怎么样？】&#10;一"></textarea><button type="button" class="dec-inp-clear" data-clear="ta-survey-text" aria-label="清空" title="清空">✕</button></div>
      <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#999);padding-top:8px;line-height:1.8">· 单选题：【问题】后每行一个选项（至少 2 个）<br>· 多选题：题干末尾写「（多选）」（【问题（多选）】），TA 一次答好几个，几个之间用「、」连着念；这几种题的「最多选几个」在下面那根杆子上调，个别题想另限就写成「（多选·最多2）」（2~6 有效，写了它这题按题上的数算、不看杆）<br>· 文字题：【问题】后一行只写「一」，TA 会用字卡作答（和正常聊天一样用自定义字卡 + 系统预设字卡；未成年人防护锁定系统预设字卡时，只用自定义字卡）<br>· 发出后 TA 开始作答：到交卷时间自动交卷，之前每 30 秒按「提前交卷概率」可能提前交卷<br>· 关闭「TA 的每条作答都发送到聊天消息」后，TA 只把答案写进聊天里的问卷卡片，不再把每题作答逐条发到聊天（单题默认会发，题多怕刷屏可关）</div>
    </div>
    <div class="set-group glass">
      <div class="gs-row" style="cursor:pointer"><span>交卷时间（到点TA自动交卷）</span><button type="button" id="ta-survey-deadline" class="tc-input deadline-btn" style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:170px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px">未设置</button><button type="button" id="ta-survey-deadline-clear" style="flex:none;margin-left:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e5e5e5);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#999)">清除</button></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>每30秒提前交卷概率</span><input type="range" id="ta-survey-prob" min="0" max="100" step="1" class="tc-range"><span class="tc-prob-val" id="ta-survey-prob-val">10%</span></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>多选题最多选几个</span><div class="stepper" id="ta-survey-mmax" data-min="2" data-max="6" data-step="1"><button type="button" class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ta-survey-mmax-val" readonly><button type="button" class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>TA 的每条作答都发送到聊天消息</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ta-survey-chat" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
    </div>
    <div class="set-group glass" style="padding:12px 14px">
      <div id="ta-survey-status" style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.8">尚未发出问卷</div>
    </div>
    <button class="ta-add-btn" style="width:100%" id="ta-survey-send">发出问卷给TA</button>
    <button class="ta-add-btn" style="width:100%;margin-top:10px" id="ta-survey-reset">撤回问卷（重置为草稿）</button>
    <div style="height:16px"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TA的小问题（选择题管理页，独立页面） -->
<div class="page" id="page-ta-choose" hidden>
  <div class="chat-head">
    <span class="ch-back" id="tc-choose-back">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
    </span>
    <span class="ch-name">TA的小问题</span>
  </div>
  <div class="gs-scroll">
    <button class="div-draw" id="tc-now">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l2.4 5 5.6.8-4 4 .9 5.6-4.9-2.6-4.9 2.6.9-5.6-4-4 5.6-.8z"/></svg>
      让TA现在问一次
    </button>
    <div class="set-group glass">
      <div class="gs-row"><span>TA 偶尔递选择题</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="tc-enable"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>使用系统预设问题</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="tc-default" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>触发概率</span><input type="range" id="tc-prob" min="1" max="100" step="1" class="tc-range"><span class="tc-prob-val" id="tc-prob-val">5%</span></div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>自动弹窗概率</span><input type="range" id="tc-popup" min="0" max="100" step="1" class="tc-range"><span class="tc-prob-val" id="tc-popup-val">70%</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-tabs" id="tc-tabs" style="padding:6px 12px 8px">
      <button class="cc-tab sel" data-tab="sys">系统预设</button>
      <button class="cc-tab" data-tab="mine">我的添加</button>
    </div>
