        <div class="set-row" id="row-battery-check">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M22 11v2"/><path d="M6 10v4"/><path d="M10 10v4"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">电量消耗自测<span class="sub">分段实测耗电快不快（前台/后台/未运行分开算，充电段剔除）；默认 1 小时档（15 分钟~过夜可选，短档只能看趋势），可去忙别的、回来出报告；中途想收工再点本行＝提前结束并出报告</span></div>
          <div class="arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></div>
        </div>
