          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 14.76V3.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-5 0v11.26a4.5 4.5 0 1 0 5 0z"/><path d="M12 9v6"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">发烫自测<span class="sub">10 秒~5 分钟测发烫降频（默认 3 分钟，可中途结束）：手机烫到被系统压慢时同样的活会越干越慢；网页读不到温度（系统没这个接口）</span></div>
          <div class="arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></div>
