            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复条数最少</span><div class="stepper" data-k="reply-min" data-min="1" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="reply-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复条数最多</span><div class="stepper" data-k="reply-max" data-min="1" data-max="20" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="reply-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub"><b>这两项＝你每发 1 条消息，TA 就跟着回你几条（在最少~最多之间随机）。</b>默认 1~2 ＝ 你发一句、TA 回一两句。<b>注意：这是「每条消息」的条数，不是 TA 一天最多发几条，所以不建议调大</b>——调到 5 ＝ TA 每次都一口气连发 5 条、直接刷屏；你连着发的每句话还会各自触发一批（调到 5、你连发 3 句 ＝ 最多收到 15 条）。嫌 TA 话多就把这两项都调成 1；想彻底只回一条，去下方「字卡与概率」组关掉「多字卡回复」（关闭后这里设几条都只回 1 条）。</div>
            <div class="gs-sub"><b>为什么有时收到的比上面设的还多</b>：这几类消息不占「回复条数」的名额、会额外多发——词典拼字的「多回复逐卡连发」（命中时一次连发数条，默认不受本上限截断，「词典拼字」组的「逐卡连发不受条数限制」默认开，手动关闭后才按本上限截断）、撤回补发、TA 的心情分享、红包/心意币/听歌邀请、TA 主动发送的消息（一次连发几条由下方「主动发送」组的「发送条数」单独控制）。所以把上面调到 N 只是限定「每发一条消息的基础回复」，不代表 TA 一天最多发 N 条。<b>想让上面这些一起被管住，打开本面板下方「总量限流」</b>（只有它能限住 TA 发消息的总量）。</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>已读不回概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="rn-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="rn-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">命中已读不回时，本次发送只显示回执、不再回复；但不会拦截之前发送已排入的回复</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>拍一拍概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="touch-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="touch-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>表情包概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="sticker-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="sticker-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>emoji 概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="emoji-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="emoji-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>图片概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="image-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="image-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>语音概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="voice-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="voice-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>颜文字附加概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="kaomoji-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="kaomoji-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>引用概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="quote-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="quote-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>撤回后补发消息</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="rc-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>撤回概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="rc-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="rc-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>撤回补发概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="rc-refix" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="rc-refix-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">撤回后补发总开关（默认开）。效果举例：TA 发「今晚一起去吃火锅好不好」→ 撤回了一半 → 按「撤回补发概率」再发一条新的（如「明天去逛街吧」）。把本开关关闭＝TA 撤回后什么都不再发；开着＝TA 撤回后有「撤回补发概率」的机会补一条新消息（这条不计入「回复条数」上限）</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">回复机制（默认＝mochi 原机制）</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>连发的算一轮（nova 式回复）</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="turn-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub"><b>默认关闭＝一切照旧</b>：你每发一条消息，TA 各排一批回你几条，并照常受下方「总量限流」计数。打开后换成<b>另一条路</b>：你连着说的那几句并成<b>一轮</b>，一轮只排一次队、骰子只掷一次（已读不回／拍一拍／回几条／引用都掷在这一轮上），回几条不再按你发了几句放大；你每多补一句，把到点往后推 1.5 秒、最多替你多等 8 秒。<b>每个联系人各排各的轮</b>，切去别的联系人发消息不会顶掉这一轮的定时器。已读不回那枚小字在起手 1~4 秒内就出现，不会等满「回复速度最长」才报。开着这一路时，下方「总量限流」<b>整条不再计数也不再拦——不只被动回复，TA 主动发送、心情分享、红包／心意币／礼物这些收件一并放行</b>（两条机制各管各的，不叠加）。<b>群聊另有一枚开关</b>：在下方「群聊回复」组里的「连发的算一轮（群聊）」，那一枚是全局的、对所有群聊生效——本开关只管单聊，按联系人各自存。改动即时保存、按联系人独立生效。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">总量限流（管住 TA 一共发多少条）</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA 消息限流</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="rl-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>限流窗口（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="rl-win" data-min="1" data-max="60" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="rl-win-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>窗口内最多条数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="rl-max" data-min="1" data-max="100" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="rl-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub"><b>默认关闭（关闭时一切照旧）。</b>打开后：任意「限流窗口」这段时间里，TA 最多发「窗口内最多条数」条消息，超出的那几条直接不再发出，窗口滑过去自动恢复。<b>这是唯一能管住总量的开关</b>——上面「回复条数」只管「你每发 1 条消息 TA 回几条」，管不住额外多发的那几类（词典拼字逐卡连发、撤回补发、TA 的心情分享、红包/心意币/听歌邀请、TA 主动发送）；本限流把它们<b>全部一起计数、一起拦</b>。四类例外：①<b>你当刻操作引发的记录</b>（帮我决定/多人决定的结果、游戏战绩、存钱罐结算、红包的领取与退回）不占额度也不会被拦；②<b>已读回执</b>同此；③<b>你刚说过话</b>——额度满时，你最近 1 分钟内发的那条消息仍保底换来 1 条回应（每一发至多一次，其余照拦），不会只剩一个「已读」。另有两处请知悉：<b>限流只管你当前打开的这个联系人</b>，其他桌面的来消息走跨桌面补投、写进各自的历史，不占这份额度；经期关心/经期预警、音乐互动的系统台词<b>计入额度、也会被拦</b>。④<b>TA 在身边的换位播报</b>——「TA 自动换位」到点那一发、你点【感知一下】催的那一发、以及你手动发出去的位置卡（含「问 TA 一声」TA 回的那张），都不占额度也不会被拦（你既然开了【换位发到聊天】，它就该落）；⑤<b>上方「连发的算一轮」（nova 式回复）打开时，本限流整条不计数也不拦</b>——两条机制各管各的。窗口最长 60 分钟、上限最低 1 条——配成 60 分钟/1 条就是「一小时只回你一句」，嫌太狠请把上限调高或把窗口调短。举例：窗口 5 分钟、上限 15 条＝TA 一口气发满 15 条后就先安静下来，直到最早那条满 5 分钟才继续。按联系人独立生效，改动即时保存。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">主动发送（联系人找你）</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动发送</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="as-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动发送概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="as-prob" data-min="1" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="as-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>发送间隔最短（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="as-min" data-min="1" data-max="600" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="as-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>发送间隔最长（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="as-max" data-min="1" data-max="60" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="as-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>发送条数最少</span><div class="stepper" data-k="as-count-min" data-min="1" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="as-count-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>发送条数最多</span><div class="stepper" data-k="as-count-max" data-min="1" data-max="20" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="as-count-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">主动发送是 TA 自己找你，与上方「回复条数」无关：一次连发几条由这两项控制（默认 1~2 条），主动消息也不计入「回复条数」上限</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>免打扰（弱化主动发送）</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dnd-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <!-- v3.6.x：主动发送标识——联系人主动找你的消息气泡左上角小标识（原为固定小爱心）
                 FIX 2026-09-18 #727 用户直派「联系人主动发送的消息，现在是小爱心的标识，
                 帮我新增，可以用别的标识和自定义标识」：内置五枚（爱心/星星/月亮/闪光/小爪）
                 可多选、只能开关不能删；点「＋」添加自定义标识（最长 4 字符、最多 8 个），
                 自定义点「×」删除；点亮 ≥2 枚时出现「抽取方式」行（随机/轮换）。
                 总开关关闭＝一枚都不显示（原「关掉爱心」语义）；池内全关兜底回爱心。
                 标识池状态由 reply-settings.js #727 段渲染（asb-chips），
                 渲染消费在 chat.js 主动发送标识分支（window.asBadgePool） -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动发送标识</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="as-badge"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>标识</span><div class="ppy-chips" id="asb-chips"><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="as-badge-heart">♥</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="as-badge-star">★</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="as-badge-moon">☾</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="as-badge-spark">✦</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="as-badge-paw">🐾</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" id="asb-add" title="添加自定义标识">＋</span></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row" id="asb-rand-row" hidden><span>抽取方式</span><span class="ppy-chips"><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-asbrand="1">每次随机</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-asbrand="0">按顺序轮换</span></span></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">联系人主动找你的消息，气泡左上角会显示这里的标识（原来固定是爱心）。点亮想要的标识（可多选）：只点亮一枚＝每条主动消息都用它；点亮多枚＝按下方「抽取方式」随机抽一枚或按顺序轮换。系统自带的五枚只能开关、不能删除；点「＋」可添加自己的标识（最长 4 个字符、最多 8 个，emoji 也可以），自定义标识点本体开关、点「×」删除。关掉上方「主动发送标识」总开关＝不再显示任何标识</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">让对方继续说</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>按正常回复时间</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-normal"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">（未开启设置时间的情况下是点击后联系人立即回复）</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>点顶部昵称触发</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-trigger-name"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>底部聊天栏按钮触发</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-trigger-bar"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">点顶部昵称/底部按钮会触发新一轮回复，条数仍按上面设置抽取，会叠在正常回复之外</div>
          </div>
          </div>
          <!-- 字卡与概率组：回复内容占比 / 系统预设字卡触发概率 / 多字卡回复 -->
          <div class="rps-panel" data-rps="cards" hidden>
          <div class="gs-title">回复内容（自定义 vs 默认聊天字卡）</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>自定义字卡占比</span><div class="stepper" data-k="csp-cust" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="csp-cust-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">TA 每条纯文字回复里，自定义字卡保留的比例（默认 50）：调高=大多数用你自己建的字卡，偶尔用预设默认聊天字卡；调低=更多用预设默认聊天字卡（见 字卡库→默认聊天字卡 页可逐张开关）；0=尽量用默认聊天字卡，100=全用自定义。默认的聊天字卡本身还受「默认聊天字卡」页的『聊天使用』概率控制。</div>
          </div>
          <!-- #518：系统预设字卡·聊天触发概率总览（总档 + 分类档）——用户点名「自定义字卡概率与系统预设字卡的概率…所有聊天字卡的概率需要有一个整体的分类tag可方便调整」。
               分类档全部复用各功能既有键（不新开键，同一语义只能有一个键）；非 dcf 行由 reply-settings.js #518 段绑定（id=dcp-<键>），
               dcf 19 类沿用 data-dcfkey 标记，由 default-cards.js 的 bindDcfProb/dcfRefreshUI 自动接管（跨页同键实时同步）。
               总档 dcp-all 走回复设置 data-k 体系（DEFAULTS + saveReplyCfg），生效缩放见 src/js/dcp-master.js 的 dcpEff。 -->
          <div class="gs-title">系统预设字卡 · 聊天触发概率</div>
          <div class="set-group glass" id="dcp-box">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>整体概率（总档）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="dcp-all" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-all-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">总档统一缩放下方所有系统预设字卡的聊天触发概率：100（默认）= 各类按自身设定值生效、行为完全不变；50 = 全部减半；0 = 聊天里所有系统预设字卡都不再触发。下方每行显示的是该类自己的设定值（不随总档改写），实际生效 = 设定值 × 总档 ÷ 100。想逐张开关某句话，去 字卡库→系统预设字卡 对应页。</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>默认聊天字卡 · 聊天使用</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-dc-overall-chat" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-dc-overall-chat-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>词典拼字</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-qs-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-qs-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天情绪字卡 · 情绪卡</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-mc-prob-mood" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-mc-prob-mood-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天情绪字卡 · 心意卡</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-mc-prob-heart" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-mc-prob-heart-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天情绪字卡 · 意图卡</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-mc-prob-intent" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-mc-prob-intent-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天回应字卡 · 整条替换</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-rcard-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-rcard-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天回应字卡 · 连接词追加</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-cf-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-cf-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的心情</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-tm-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-tm-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的询问</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-ta-ask-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-ta-ask-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的小问题</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-tc-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-tc-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的好奇</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-tcu-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-tcu-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的吐槽</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-tr-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-tr-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的查岗</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-ckq-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-ckq-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的邀请 · 猜拳</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-ai-rps-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-ai-rps-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的邀请 · 游戏</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-ai-game-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-ai-game-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的邀请 · 贴贴</span><div class="stepper" id="dcp-ai-cuddle-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcp-ai-cuddle-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">以上分类档行的键与各功能页/其他设置页是同一份（如「TA的查岗」= 回复设置→查岗 的「查岗概率」、情绪卡 = 字卡库→聊天情绪字卡 页那三行），改哪边都生效。TA的询问/小问题/好奇/吐槽四类是「在自身触发概率之上再乘总档」，各自的题库与弹窗等详细设置在 字卡库→系统预设字卡 对应页。</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>桌面今日情话 · 系统预设（开关型）</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dcp-tg-quote"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA在身边位置卡 · 系统预设（开关型）</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dcp-tg-loc"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">这两类只有「用不用系统预设」的开关、没有概率，不受总档缩放；关闭后分别只从你自己添加的情话/位置话术里出。</div>
            <div class="gs-row" id="dcp-fun-expander-row" style="cursor:pointer"><span>其他互动功能字卡（19 个分类 · 点此展开 / 收起）</span><span id="dcp-fun-expander-arrow">▾</span></div>
            <div id="dcp-fun-box" hidden>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>摸鱼字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-fish-rs" data-dcfkey="fish" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-fish-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>经期字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-period-rs" data-dcfkey="period" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-period-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>喝水字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-water-rs" data-dcfkey="water" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-water-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>存钱罐字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-piggy-rs" data-dcfkey="piggy" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-piggy-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>漂流瓶字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-drift-rs" data-dcfkey="drift" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-drift-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>互动回应字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-interact-rs" data-dcfkey="interact" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-interact-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>音乐字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-music-rs" data-dcfkey="music" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-music-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>跨桌面查岗字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-deskcheck-rs" data-dcfkey="deskcheck" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-deskcheck-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>番茄钟字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-pomo-rs" data-dcfkey="pomo" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-pomo-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的关心（经期）字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-care-rs" data-dcfkey="care" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-care-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>备忘提醒字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-memo-rs" data-dcfkey="memo" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-memo-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-row"><span>TA主动提问字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-ask-rs" data-dcfkey="ask" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-ask-rs-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
              <div class="gs-sub">与 字卡库→其他互动功能字卡 页是同一批键，两处实时同步；各项详细说明在那页的「功能说明」标签里。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">每条消息使用多字卡回复</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>多字卡回复</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="py-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>不重复发同一张字卡</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cc-norepeat"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>去重检测</span><button class="cc-nr-btn" id="cc-norepeat-diag-btn" type="button">检测一下</button></div>
            <div class="gs-sub" id="cc-norepeat-diag">点「检测一下」：看看最近 TA 回过的内容里有多少张卡会被避开（只统计主字卡，命中即跳过一次）。</div>
            <div class="gs-sub">不重复发同一张字卡：开启后，TA 发过的卡（最近 40 条回复内）不会再被抽到，包括被拼进多字卡回复里的那张；整体池子被剔空时会自动放行，不会卡住不说话。只影响 TA 抽卡，不改你的字卡库；群聊与信箱各走各自的抽取，不受本项影响。</div>
            <!-- v41：回复满意度（照言字卡 B2 搬过来）——我发文字后按概率落一行「TA · 对你这轮回复的满意度 N/10 · TA 挺满意」 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复满意度</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="rsat-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>满意度概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="rsat-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="rsat-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>试一次</span><button class="cc-nr-btn" id="rsat-try-btn" type="button">现在落一行</button></div>
            <div class="gs-sub" id="rsat-tip">点「现在落一行」：不掷概率，立刻在聊天里落一条样例，看看字数与档位合不合适。</div>
            <div class="gs-sub">回复满意度：你发出文字消息后，按上面的概率落一行居中的灰底小字——「名字 · 对你这轮回复的满意度 7/10 · TA 挺满意」。分数评的是你这句话（不是话题，也不是字卡），1~10 分四档：1-3 有点勉强、4-6 还行、7-8 挺满意、9-10 很喜欢。纯图、表情包、语音不触发；同一次对话里至少隔 45 秒才会再落一行，不会连刷。关掉开关或概率设 0 ＝ 完全不落。</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>触发概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="py-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="py-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最少条数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="py-min" data-min="1" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="py-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最多条数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="py-max" data-min="2" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="py-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <!-- #650 拼接随机标点：开启后每两条字卡的中间从「拼接符号」池随机抽一个相连
                 （空格/，/。/！/？/....../—— 可多选、每处独立随机）。默认＝七种全部点亮
                 （FIX 2026-09-17 #694 用户定稿「空格、。！？...... 全部开启，然后用户可以自己选择开启或关闭某个」；
                 FIX 2026-09-18 #712 用户直派「拼接符号新增一个：—— 默认开启」＋「系统自带的不变，
                 只能开关，但是用户可以自己添加」：点「＋」添加自定义符号、自定义 chip 点「×」删除）；
                 关闭＝只用空格（原样）。
                 FIX 2026-09-24 #1198 用户直派「多字卡回复和标点符号 需要新增联系人自己随机选择是否换行」
                 ＋「也需要增加信箱和朋友圈，也加上这个功能，也在回复设置里」：内置第八枚「换行」
                 （py-punct-nl，默认关＝存量设备零变化，点亮后抽到它才另起一行）；同一套符号池由
                 信箱（ml-punct-en）/朋友圈（fd-punct-en）共用，两者各带默认关的开关、互不叠聊天的闸门。
                 符号池状态由 reply-settings.js #650 段渲染（ppy-chips），join 逻辑在 chat.js pyJoinCards -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>拼接随机标点</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="py-punct-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>拼接符号</span><div class="ppy-chips" id="ppy-chips"><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="py-punct-space">空格</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="py-punct-dou">，</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="py-punct-per">。</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="py-punct-ex">！</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="py-punct-q">？</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="py-punct-el">......</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="py-punct-dash">——</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-k="py-punct-nl">换行</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" id="ppy-add" title="添加自定义拼接符号">＋</span></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">多条字卡回复总开关：关闭后每条消息只回一条、每条只用一张字卡——「颜文字附加概率」「连接词追加概率」「经期温柔前缀/后缀」也不再往同一条气泡里拼第二张字卡，气泡下不再出现「多字卡回复」标签（<b>#1236 起词典拼字也归本项管</b>——关掉它连「单气泡拼字／多回复逐卡连发」一并不触发；梦角自由造句各认自己的开关）；开启后回复拆成几条由上方「回复条数」控制、每条拼几张由下方「最少/最多条数」控制（词典拼字在「词典拼字」组另有自己的一对「每次拼字最少/最多张数」，默认跟随这两格、动过即单独设定）。<b>关掉本项后，气泡上残留的「多字卡回复／词典」类来源标签也不再显示</b>（#1236；数据不删，重新打开即恢复显示）</div>
            <div class="gs-sub">拼接随机标点：开启后每两条字卡的中间在「拼接符号」里随机抽一个相连（可多选，每处独立随机）。默认＝空格、，。！？......、—— 七种全部点亮（不想要的点一下取消、再点一下恢复）；只选「空格」＝原来的效果、只选标点＝不再有空格；关闭总开关＝固定只用空格。系统自带的符号只能开关、不能删除；点「＋」可添加自己的符号（最长 6 个字符、最多 8 个），自定义符号点本体开关、点「×」删除。符号至少保留一个；「词典拼字」的单气泡形态也用同一套符号池。关闭上方「多字卡回复」后本组一并失效：拼接随机标点不再生效、符号池回退空格<br><b>「换行」（默认关）</b>＝点亮后随机抽到它时，下一张字卡另起一行（抽到别的符号仍照常连在同一行里）。<b>这套符号池是三处共用</b>：聊天（上面的「拼接随机标点」）、信箱（回复设置 → 信箱 →「信件拼接随机标点」）、朋友圈（回复设置 → 朋友圈 →「朋友圈拼接随机标点」），后两者默认关，各自只由自家开关决定——上方聊天开关置灰不影响它们。表情包/图片这类卡片两侧永远用空格相接（标点或换行贴进图片网址尾部会让图显示不出来）</div>
          </div>
          </div>
          <!-- 拼字造句组：词典拼字 / 梦角自由造句 -->
          <div class="rps-panel" data-rps="craft" hidden>
          <div class="gs-title">词典拼字（语录字卡拼字）</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>词典拼字</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="qs-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>拼字概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="qs-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="qs-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <!-- #1451 拼字张数单开一对（用户点名）：语义与「多字卡回复」的最少/最多条数同款，
                 但各管各的——两枚都缺键＝跟随那一对（老存档零变化）；动过任一格即两枚一起落盘
                 成为单设。动「最少」自动把「最多」抬到不小于它、动「最多」自动把「最少」压到
                 不大于它（reply-settings.js writePairedRange 收口），两行数字当场互跟 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>每次拼字最少张数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="qs-min" data-min="2" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="qs-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>每次拼字最多张数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="qs-max" data-min="2" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="qs-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub" id="qs-range-readout"></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>混用自定义字卡</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="qs-cc"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>单气泡拼字</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="qs-one"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>多回复逐卡连发</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="qs-multi"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>逐卡连发不受条数限制</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="qs-noLimit"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <!-- #370：词典拼字链路自检——四道闸门（二级锁/词典聊天使用/拼字总开关与概率/抽卡池；#427 移除无 UI 的遗留 dc-cat-dict 闸）
                 任一被关都是零提示零 tag，这行把每道闸实时状态摆出来，任何机型一眼看到卡在哪 -->
            <div class="gs-sub" id="qs-diag" style="color:var(--muted,#888)">链路自检中…</div>
            <div class="gs-sub">开启后联系人回复按「拼字概率」随机变成拼字：从词典（系统预设字卡→词典，语录/词库/常用词全部分组都可抽，可逐张关闭）抽字卡整卡，效果举例：命中拼字时 TA 会连着发几条词典里的短句（如「想你了」「晚安哦」），像打字很快连着发消息一样。<br>发送形态：单气泡拼字为主，「多回复逐卡连发」开着时每次命中另按 20% 小概率变成逐条连发；「多回复逐卡连发」关＝不能连发（只发单气泡拼字）。<br>· 「单气泡拼字」＝几张字卡连着拼成【一条】消息发在一个气泡里（张数＝上方「每次拼字最少/最多张数」两格；卡与卡之间与「回复与主动」组的「拼接随机标点」共用一套符号池——默认空格/，/。/！/？/....../—— 随机抽，关闭＝只用空格，如「今天也要好好爱自己 晚安」），气泡下 tag 是「词典」（全是长句时）或「词典拼字」（含短卡时）；<br>· 「多回复逐卡连发」＝每张字卡单独一条气泡一条一条发出来，每条气泡下 tag 是「词典逐卡连发」；连发张数由本组「每次拼字最少/最多张数」控制（默认跟随上方「每条消息使用多字卡回复」的最少/最多条数，即 2~5 张，见上方实时读数行）；<br>· 「逐卡连发不受条数限制」默认开＝连发条数不受「回复条数最多」约束（想连发 5 条就发 5 条）；关闭＝连发条数按「回复条数最多」截断（默认最多 2 条）。<br>两个形态都受<b>聊天页「多字卡回复」总开关</b>约束（#1236）：它关闭时拼字整体不触发，两种形态一并不生效；两个形态开关都关时兜底发单气泡拼字。开启「混用自定义字卡」时你的字卡库文本也会进抽卡池（可能把你的普通字卡抽去拼字，默认开）。概率 0 = 不触发</div>
          </div>
          <!-- #513 梦角自由造句总开关与混合模式改为默认打开（用户点名「需要默认打开」）：
               DEFAULTS mjf-en/mjf-mix=1 + reply-settings migrateMjfOn 把存量 '0' 一次性收成 '1' -->
          <div class="gs-title">梦角自由造句（截字重造句）</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>梦角自由造句</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="mjf-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>触发概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="mjf-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mjf-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <!-- #413 语料来源三选（默认全开=可用全部字卡）+ 各源权重：按权重归一化抽源 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>语料·自定义字卡</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="mjf-src-cc"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>自定义字卡权重</span><div class="stepper" data-k="mjf-w-cc" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mjf-w-cc-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>语料·默认聊天字卡</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="mjf-src-def"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>默认字卡权重</span><div class="stepper" data-k="mjf-w-def" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mjf-w-def-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>语料·词典</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="mjf-src-dict"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>词典权重</span><div class="stepper" data-k="mjf-w-dict" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mjf-w-dict-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>造句手法（0语气词/1撤回/2换字卡）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="mjf-style" data-min="0" data-max="2" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mjf-style-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <!-- #414 混合模式：开启后每次造句三种手法随机掷一个，mjf-style 固定选择失效 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>混合模式（三手法随机）</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="mjf-mix"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <!-- FIX 2026-09-21 #953：造句句尾标点开关＋可改标点池（用户直派「使用标点符号也可以修改或关闭」）
                 FIX 2026-09-29 #1396 用户直派「梦角自由造句的可用标点那一栏（旧形态＝一个用空格来分隔的文本框）
                 与多字卡回复那套拼接符号不一样＝设计不完整」：文本框换成与 #650/#712 同款药丸 chips
                 （复用 .ppy-chips/.ppy-chip 一族样式，零新增 CSS）。候选按 data-p 记（真值在
                 reply-settings.js #1396 段的 POOL 表里），内置含「空格／换行」凑齐拼接符号那一套，另留句尾
                 专用的「~」「……」；点本体开关、自定义点「×」删除、点「＋」添加；池容器沿用 #953 那个 id，
                 哨兵不必换锚 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>句尾标点</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="mjf-punct"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row" id="mjf-punct-pool-row"><span>可用标点</span><div class="ppy-chips" id="mjf-punct-pool"><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="sp">空格</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="dou">，</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="per">。</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="ex">！</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="q">？</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="el">......</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="dash">——</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="nl">换行</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="tilde">~</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" data-p="ell">……</span><span class="tag ppy-chip" id="mjfp-add" title="添加自定义句尾标点" style="border-style:dashed">＋</span></div></div>
            <!-- #364 存库概率 / #622 单联系人也生效：0=全专属、100=全公用、其余按概率分流 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>存公用库概率（0=全专属/100=全公用）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="mjf-pub" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mjf-pub-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub"><b>是什么</b>：梦角（联系人）说话时按「触发概率」随机掷一次，命中就把一句语料<b>截字重造句</b>后当作 TA 的回复发出来（气泡下带「梦角自由造句」小标签）；命中时若同一条回复也掷中了词典拼字，拼字优先、本次造句让位（同一回复不叠加两种玩法）。概率 0＝不触发。<br>
<b>关掉总开关</b>（#1236）：不再造句，历史气泡下残留的「梦角自由造句」标签也一并不再显示（重新打开即恢复显示，消息本身与标签数据都不删）。<br>
<b>语料来自四类字卡</b>——造句就是在「自定义字卡＋默认聊天字卡＋词典」这三处字卡里选的（词典＝字卡库→词典，和默认聊天字卡同属系统预设），对应下方三个「语料·」开关，细分四类：<br>
· ①【自定义字卡·公用字卡】＋ ②【自定义字卡·专属字卡】——由「语料·自定义字卡」一个开关管两个作用域（公用全桌面共享、专属只在本联系人桌面）；字卡库→可自定义字卡 里两个作用域各自的【分组停用】都生效，改/删字卡实时跟新，抽语料时会跳过【其他互动功能字卡】类（鱼塘/吃喝/经期/花园/此间/房间/存钱罐/漂流瓶/互动回应/音乐/这里造的句子本身…）；<br>
· ③【系统预设·默认聊天字卡】——由「语料·默认聊天字卡」开关控制，取 字卡库→系统预设→默认聊天字卡 的四大基础分类（主字卡 / 颜文字 / emoji / 拍一拍）；颜文字与 emoji 基本不含 4 个以上汉字，实际不会成为源句，真正参与的是主字卡与拍一拍。该分类的开关（主字卡/颜文字/emoji/拍一拍）与逐张关闭都生效；<br>
· ④【系统预设·词典】——由「语料·词典」开关控制，取 字卡库→词典 的全部语录（词库里的 2~3 字词只用于切词、不作为源句）；词典的逐张关闭生效（关掉的语录不再被用）。<br>
· 二级密码锁锁定时：系统预设（③默认聊天字卡 / ④词典）不参与，①②自建字卡照常。<br>
<b>权重怎么算</b>：三个「权重」＝抽语料时各源的中签占比，按权重归一化（默认 50/25/25，不必凑够 100）；某个源权重调 0 或开关关掉＝该源不参与，三源全关＝不触发造句。<br>
<b>造句手法</b>（上方数字 0/1/2，效果举例，源句「今天也要好好爱自己，晚安哦」）：<br>
· 0 语气词式：截掉一个词补个语气词 →「今天也要好好想你了」，或句尾加语气字 →「…晚安哦呀」，也可能词间加逗号/空格、删句尾字；<br>
· 1 撤回式：像撤回消息一样把后半句撤回，留下的前缀就是新句子 →「今天也要好好爱自己」；<br>
· 2 换字卡内容式：截掉一个词、从上面的语料里挑一个词补上 →「今天也要好好看日落」。<br>
「混合模式」（#414，#513 起默认开）：开启后每次造句先在 0/1/2 三种手法里随机掷一个再出招，三种模式交替出现，上方「造句手法」的固定选择暂不生效；关闭即恢复单一手法（默认撤回式）。<br>
<b>句尾标点</b>（#953；池的形态 #1396 起与上方「拼接符号」同款）：造出的句子按「可用标点」里<b>点亮</b>的候选随机补一个句尾标点；某个句子本身结尾已经有标点就不重复补。<b>可用标点</b>＝一排药丸，点一下取消、再点一下点亮，至少保留一枚（一枚都不想要请关上方「句尾标点」开关）；系统自带的只能开关、不能删，点「＋」可添加自己的标点（最长 6 个字符、最多 8 个，自定义标点点本体开关、点「×」删除）。<b>候选与聊天上方那套「拼接符号」是同一套</b>：空格 / ， / 。 / ！ / ？ / <code>......</code> / —— / 换行（句尾位置抽到「空格」＝末尾留一格，看起来就是不补；抽到「换行」＝末尾另起一行），另外多两枚句尾常用的 <code>~</code> 与 <code>……</code>。<b>没点过 chip 时</b>沿用老默认池（。 / <code>~</code> / ！ / <code>……</code>，其中句号出现得最多）；<b>一旦点过任意一枚</b>就改按你点亮的那些<b>等概率</b>抽（句号不再偏多）。把「句尾标点」开关关掉＝不补任何标点，出句保持原样（如撤回式截断后的裸句）。<br>
<b>造出来的句子去哪了</b>：自动存进 字卡库→可自定义字卡→梦角自由造句（可查看/删除）。存哪个库由上方「存公用库概率」决定：0＝全进专属字卡、100＝全进公用字卡、其余按概率分流（默认 80＝80% 公用 / 20% 专属）；单联系人也照此生效（想全留本桌面就把概率设 0）。这些句子只作为 TA 的回复展示，不会再被拿去当语料（避免自我循环）。</div>
          </div>
          </div>
          </div>
        <div class="gs-panel" data-rpanel="group" hidden>
          <div class="gs-title">被动回复（群聊里每个联系人回你）</div>
          <div class="gs-sub">发送消息后每个联系人按概率回你；也可在群聊里 @ 指定成员（@ 的成员必定回复）</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>连发的算一轮（群聊）</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="gc-turn-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub"><b>默认关闭＝一切照旧</b>（你在群里每发一条，成员各排一批）。打开后：你连着发的那几条并成<b>一轮</b>，一轮只让成员们接一次话；每多补一句把这轮收口往后推 1.5 秒、最多 8 秒；@ 谁、引用什么都以这一轮最后那句为准。<b>每个群各排各的轮</b>，切到别的群不影响这个群排着的轮；成员各自多久回仍按上面「回复速度」抽，不额外加等待。<b>这一枚是全局的</b>（对所有群聊生效，不跟随单个联系人的「连发的算一轮」档位）。改动即时保存。</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>每个联系人回复概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复速度最短（秒）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-rs-min" data-min="1" data-max="60" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-rs-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复速度最长（秒）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-rs-max" data-min="2" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-rs-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复条数最少</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-reply-min" data-min="1" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-reply-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复条数最多</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-reply-max" data-min="1" data-max="20" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-reply-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-sub"><b>这两项＝你每发 1 条消息，群里每个回你的成员就各回你几条（在最少~最多之间随机）。</b>默认 1~2 条。<b>注意：这是「每条消息、每个成员」的条数，不是 TA 一天最多发几条，不建议调大</b>——成员是各算各的（调到 5、3 个人同时回你 ＝ 一屏 15 条），你连着发的每句话还各触发一批。嫌刷屏就把这两项都调成 1；关掉下面的「多字卡回复」总开关也能锁死一条（关闭后这里设几条都只回 1 条）。</div>
            <div class="gs-sub">本上限只管「每发一条消息触发的这批基础回复」，撤回后的补发不占名额、会额外多发，所以实际收到的可能比这里设的条数多。</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>拍一拍概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-touch-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-touch-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>表情包概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-sticker-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-sticker-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>emoji 概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-emoji-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-emoji-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>图片概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-image-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-image-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>语音概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-voice-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-voice-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>颜文字附加概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-kaomoji-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-kaomoji-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>引用概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-quote-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-quote-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>撤回概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-rc-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-rc-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>撤回补发概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-rc-refix" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-rc-refix-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">每条消息使用多字卡回复</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>多字卡回复</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="gc-py-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">总开关：关闭后每个成员每条消息只回一条、只用一张字卡（「颜文字附加概率」也不再往同一条气泡里拼第二张字卡）；开启后条数由上方「回复条数」与下方「最少/最多条数」控制</div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>触发概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-py-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-py-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最少条数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-py-min" data-min="1" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-py-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最多条数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="gc-py-max" data-min="2" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="gc-py-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-sub" style="padding:0 14px 14px">群聊设置全局生效（所有桌面/联系人共用），修改后直接生效</div>
        </div>
        <div class="gs-panel" data-rpanel="mail" hidden>
          <div class="gs-title">信件内容</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最少字卡条数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-min-cards" data-min="1" data-max="500" data-step="10"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-min-cards-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最多字卡条数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-max-cards" data-min="1" data-max="500" data-step="10"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-max-cards-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <!-- #1198 信件正文也走「拼接随机标点」：共用聊天那套符号池（含内置「换行」），自家开关默认关 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>信件拼接随机标点</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ml-punct-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">默认关＝一封信里各张字卡之间只用空格相连（老样子）。打开后每两条字卡中间随机抽一个连接符，抽到「换行」时下一张字卡另起一行，信纸会一段一段分开。符号用的是聊天那一套：回复设置 → 聊天 →「字卡与概率」→「拼接符号」（把「换行」点亮即可，只勾「换行」＋「空格」＝要么换行要么空一格）。表情/图片卡两侧仍固定用空格。本开关只看自己，与聊天页的「多字卡回复／拼接随机标点」互不影响；来信与 TA 的回信都用它</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">联系人主动写信</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>联系人主动写信</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ml-write-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>每天最多写信（封）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-write-daily-max" data-min="1" data-max="50" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-write-daily-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动写信概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-write-prob" data-min="1" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-write-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最短写信时间（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-write-min" data-min="1" data-max="1440" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-write-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最长写信时间（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-write-max" data-min="1" data-max="1440" data-step="60"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-write-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">联系人回信</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回信概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-reply-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-reply-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最短回信时间（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-reply-min" data-min="1" data-max="1440" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-reply-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最长回信时间（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ml-reply-max" data-min="1" data-max="1440" data-step="60"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ml-reply-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">写信内容类型</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>来信内容使用颜文字</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ml-kaomoji-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>来信内容使用 emoji</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ml-emoji-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>来信内容使用表情包</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ml-sticker-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
          </div>
          <!-- #645：每周摸鱼小结寄信开关——关闭后 TA 不再寄「本周摸鱼小结」（判定在 src/js/mail.js fishWeekReportFor） -->
          <div class="gs-title">每周摸鱼小结</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>摸鱼小结寄信</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ml-fish-week-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">开启后每周日 18 点后 TA 会把「本周摸鱼小结」寄进信箱（周一~周三会补上周的）；关闭后不再寄，主动来信/回信不受影响</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gs-panel" data-rpanel="feed" hidden>
          <!-- #534：内容类型总开关——与信箱页「写信内容类型」同款。关闭后该类型在朋友圈
               （TA 发动态 + TA 评论/回复）整体不出现，不论下方概率设为多少；修前只有
               「TA 发布内容类型」概率管得住动态，评论/回复的颜文字/emoji 是写死 15%，
               用户「把颜文字和表情包都禁了还是出现」。 -->
          <div class="gs-title">内容类型开关</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用颜文字</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="fd-kaomoji-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用 emoji</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="fd-emoji-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用表情包</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="fd-sticker-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用图片</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="fd-image-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">关闭后该类型不再出现在联系人动态与评论/回复里（不论下方概率设多少）</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">互动设置（我发布后）</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>点赞概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-like-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-like-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>点赞最快（秒）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-like-speed-min" data-min="1" data-max="120" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-like-speed-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>点赞最慢（秒）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-like-speed-max" data-min="1" data-max="300" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-like-speed-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>首次评论概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-comment-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-comment-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>评论最快（秒）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-comment-speed-min" data-min="1" data-max="120" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-comment-speed-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>评论最慢（秒）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-comment-speed-max" data-min="1" data-max="300" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-comment-speed-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复我的回复概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-reply-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-reply-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复最快（秒）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-reply-speed-min" data-min="1" data-max="120" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-reply-speed-min-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>回复最慢（秒）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-reply-speed-max" data-min="1" data-max="300" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-reply-speed-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>我点赞后 TA 回赞概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-likeback-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-likeback-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">回复内容设置</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>一条评论使用多个字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-card-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-card-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最多字卡数</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-max-cards" data-min="1" data-max="10" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-max-cards-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用表情包概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-image-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-image-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <!-- #1198 朋友圈也走「拼接随机标点」：共用聊天那套符号池（含内置「换行」），自家开关默认关 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>拼接随机标点</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="fd-punct-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-sub">默认关＝评论/回复与 TA 动态里的各张字卡之间只用空格相连（老样子）。打开后每两条字卡中间随机抽一个连接符，抽到「换行」时下一张字卡另起一行（评论会一条一段）。符号用的是聊天那一套：回复设置 → 聊天 →「字卡与概率」→「拼接符号」（把「换行」点亮即可）。表情包/图片卡两侧仍固定用空格（标点贴进图片网址尾部会让图显示不出来）。本开关只看自己，与聊天页的「多字卡回复／拼接随机标点」互不影响</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">TA 发朋友圈设置</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>联系人主动发朋友圈</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="fd-post-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动发朋友圈概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-post-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-post-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>每天最多发布（条）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-post-daily-max" data-min="1" data-max="20" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-post-daily-max-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>发布后冷却（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-post-cool" data-min="1" data-max="240" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-post-cool-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最短发布间隔（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-min-interval" data-min="1" data-max="60" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-min-interval-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最长发布间隔（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-max-interval" data-min="60" data-max="1440" data-step="60"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-max-interval-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最少使用字卡条</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-min-cards-post" data-min="1" data-max="15" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-min-cards-post-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>最多使用字卡条</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-max-cards-post" data-min="1" data-max="30" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-max-cards-post-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">TA 发布内容类型</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用颜文字概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-post-kaomoji" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-post-kaomoji-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用 emoji 概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-post-emoji" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-post-emoji-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用表情包概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-post-sticker" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-post-sticker-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>使用图片概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="fd-post-image" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fd-post-image-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-title">数据</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="set-row danger" id="feed-clear-all">
              <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2"/><path d="M19 6l-1 14a2 2 0 01-2 2H8a2 2 0 01-2-2L5 6"/><path d="M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg></div>
              <div class="txt">清除所有朋友圈数据</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.9.x：查岗——TA 主动查你的岗：随主动发送按概率发查岗问题卡（聊天互动卡 + 概率弹窗，作答后 TA 回应） -->
        <div class="gs-panel" data-rpanel="ck" hidden>
          <div class="gs-title">TA 主动查岗</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>TA 主动查岗</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ckq-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>查岗概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ckq-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ckq-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>自动弹窗概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ckq-popup-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ckq-popup-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>查岗冷却（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ckq-cool" data-min="0" data-max="240" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ckq-cool-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-sub" style="padding:0 14px 14px">TA 主动找你时按概率来查你的岗：聊天里出现查岗问题卡（单选点击作答、文字题输入作答），作答后 TA 会回应；概率命中时直接弹出回答弹窗。冷却内不重复查岗，需开启「主动发送」，各联系人独立保存。查岗题库可在 字卡库 →「TA的查岗」里逐条开关或自定义添加。想立刻来一次（不看概率与冷却）：聊天 →「更多功能 → TA的提问 → 查岗」</div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.9.x：其他——联系人主动邀请（猜拳/玩游戏），随 TA 主动找你的消息按概率触发 -->
        <div class="gs-panel" data-rpanel="other" hidden>
          <div class="gs-title">联系人主动邀请</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动邀请猜拳</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ai-rps-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>猜拳邀请概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ai-rps-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ai-rps-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动邀请玩游戏</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ai-game-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>游戏邀请概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ai-game-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ai-game-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动邀请贴贴</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ai-cuddle-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>贴贴邀请概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ai-cuddle-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ai-cuddle-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <!-- v3.15.x：TA 主动分享你自建的字卡——从字卡库（含公用）抽一张纯文本卡当 TA 的话发出来 -->
            <div class="gs-row"><span>主动分享你的字卡</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="ai-cc-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>分享字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ai-cc-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="1"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ai-cc-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-sub" style="padding:0 14px 14px">TA 主动找你的消息会按概率变成猜拳/游戏/贴贴邀请（游戏在 Pong、贪吃蛇中随机；贴贴同意后 TA 会回应一句），自动打开对应半框或回应，不想玩直接关掉即可；仅在你在聊天页时触发，需开启「主动发送」。邀请话术可在 字卡库 →「TA的邀请」里逐句开关或自定义添加；「分享你的字卡」从你在 字卡库 自建的纯文本卡（含公用）里随机抽一张当 TA 的悄悄话，冷却 90 分钟。想立刻要一次：聊天 →「更多功能 → TA的提问 → 邀请（猜拳等随机一种）/ 贴贴（一定是贴贴）」</div>
          <!-- v3.20.x：联系人跨桌面查岗 / 跨桌面来电——其他桌面的联系人按各自概率/冷却主动来查岗、来电 -->
          <div class="gs-title" style="margin-top:6px">联系人跨桌面查岗</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>跨桌面查岗概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ckq-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ckq-prob-val2" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>查岗冷却（分钟）</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ckq-cool" data-min="0" data-max="240" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="ckq-cool-val2" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-sub" style="padding:0 14px 2px">其他桌面的联系人会按各自概率（默认 2%，可在此逐联系人调整）主动来查你的岗，每个触发后 30 分钟内不重复。全局开关在 设置 →「开启 联系人跨桌面查岗」，回应字卡可在 字卡库 →「联系人跨桌面查岗」里逐张开关。想立刻来一次（不看概率与冷却）：聊天 →「更多功能 → TA的提问 → 跨桌面查岗」</div>
          <div class="gs-title" style="margin-top:10px">联系人跨桌面打电话</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>跨桌面来电概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="desk-call-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="desk-call-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-sub" style="padding:0 14px 2px">其他桌面的联系人会按各自概率（默认 2%，可在此逐联系人调整）主动给你来电，冷却与查岗一致 30 分钟。全局开关在 设置 →「开启 联系人跨桌面打电话」（默认关闭，需先到那里手动打开，这里调了概率也不会来电）</div>
          <!-- v3.26.x：摸鱼值 / 工作值累计总开关——桌面摸鱼小组件数值增长闸门（personalize.js addFish/addWork 消费） -->
          <div class="gs-title" style="margin-top:10px">摸鱼值 / 工作值</div>
          <div class="set-group glass">
            <div class="gs-row"><span>摸鱼值累计</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="fish-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
            <div class="gs-row"><span>工作值累计</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="work-en"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-sub" style="padding:0 14px 14px">桌面摸鱼小组件两组数值的增长总开关（默认开）。关闭「摸鱼值累计」后：TA 的自动摸鱼、你点摸鱼按钮、番茄钟补偿摸鱼、抓包奖励都不再涨摸鱼值；关闭「工作值累计」后：自动打工、专注期间的工作值等不再涨。已有数值保留不清零，重新打开即恢复累计，各联系人独立保存</div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.6.x：保存设置按钮——点击把当前所有概率/开关写入本地并提示 -->
        <button class="ta-add-btn gs-save-btn" id="reply-save-btn" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 10px">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:15px;height:15px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:4px"><path d="M19 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11l5 5v11a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/><path d="M17 21v-8H7v8M7 3v5h8"/></svg>保存设置
        </button>
        <!-- v3.26.x：保存全部桌面联系人设置——把当前回复设置同步写入全部桌面联系人（覆盖性操作，JS 侧二次确认） -->
        <button class="ta-add-btn gs-save-btn" id="reply-save-all-btn" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 18px">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:15px;height:15px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:4px"><path d="M19 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11l5 5v11a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/><path d="M17 21v-8H7v8M7 3v5h8"/></svg>保存全部桌面联系人设置
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 通话设置（独立页面） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-call-settings" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="cals-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">通话设置</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-scroll">
        <div class="gs-title">通话概率</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="gs-row"><span>来电概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="call-incoming" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="0.01"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="call-incoming-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          <div class="gs-row"><span>接听概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="call-pickup" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="call-pickup-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          <div class="gs-row"><span>忙线概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="call-busy" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="call-busy-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          <div class="gs-row"><span>拒接概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="call-reject" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="call-reject-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          <div class="gs-row"><span>通话中挂断概率</span><div class="stepper" data-k="call-hangup" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="0.01"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="call-hangup-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:0 16px 8px">【来电概率是怎么触发的】有 3 类「机会」，每来一次机会就单独掷一次骰子，命中就打来电话：① TA 每回复你一条消息，掷一次；② TA 每次主动给你发消息，掷一次；③ 应用开着时，后台每 1~2 分钟也会掷一次兜底。两次来电之间至少间隔 5 分钟，设 0 则从不主动来电。<br>【为什么设得不高却感觉来得挺勤】概率是「每次机会」单独算的，不是「每天总共」的概率——你聊天越勤，机会就越多，累积起来自然来电频繁。例如设 15%：和 TA 聊 20 句就有约 20 次掷骰机会，来电概率本身没坏，是机会次数多。想让来电变少，直接把数值调小即可，效果大约成比例：调小 10 倍，来电也约少 10 倍。<br>【嫌多又不想设 0】点数值框直接输入小数（如 0.05），不用狂按 +/−。来电概率支持 0.01 粒度，最低可设 0.01（0.05、0.1 等 0.0几 的数值都可以）——设 0.01 时平均每 100 次机会才来电 1 次，基本只是偶尔响一次。<br>【接听 / 忙线 / 拒接概率】你打给 TA 时用：按「忙线 → 拒接 → 接听」顺序判定，先命中哪个就是哪种结果；三项都没命中就是「未接通」。默认 15 / 15 / 70 恰好占满 100，不会有未接通；想偶尔出现未接通，把三项合计调到 100 以下。<br>【通话中挂断概率】接通满 3 分钟保护期后，每 60 秒按这个百分比掷一次，命中对方就主动挂断，通话越久累计越容易被挂。它是「每一分钟各掷一次」，不是「整通电话一共这么多」：默认 2% 意味着约每 50 次判定才命中 1 次（判定从第 3 分钟起、每分钟一次），也就是平均通话将近一小时才被挂断一次，接通后 10 分钟内被挂断的概率只有约 15%；觉得太少就把数值调大，效果约成正比（20% ≈ 每 5 次判定命中 1 次）。判定按墙钟走：息屏、切后台、刷新页面都不会让它停摆，回到这一页时若已跨过判定点就补掷一次（不按错过的分钟数成串补）。支持 0.01 粒度，最低可设 0.01；设 0（或开下方「禁止联系人挂断电话」）＝对方永不主动挂断。<br>【改数值】点数值框直接输入（手机会弹数字键盘），或按 +/− 微调；改完立即保存生效。以上概率均按联系人各自保存，互不影响。</div>
        <div class="gs-title">对方挂断</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="gs-row"><span>禁止联系人挂断电话</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="call-no-hangup"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:0 16px 8px">开启后无论挂断概率是多少，通话中对方都不会主动挂断（默认关闭，需手动开启）。注意这一行只管【当前桌面（这一位联系人）】，不是全站总开关：通话概率按联系人各自保存，某个联系人的桌面从没保存过挂断概率时会按默认 2% 计算——个别联系人「挂断几率明明设了 0 还是被挂断」就是这种情况，需要在每位联系人的桌面分别开。掷骰判定读的是【这通电话归属那位联系人】自己的设置：通话中切到其他桌面、或刷新后回到别的桌面，也不会改用你当前看着的那个桌面的数值。</div>
        <div class="gs-title">通话恢复</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="gs-row"><span>刷新后恢复通话</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="call-resume"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:0 16px 8px">开启后，通话接通中刷新页面或意外退出，重新打开时通话面板与计时从接通时刻继续，如同没断过；关闭则刷新算通话中断，主页通话记录里记一条红色「中断」条目。</div>
        <div class="gs-title">通话背景</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="set-row" id="call-bg-row">
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">通话背景图片</div>
            <div class="val" id="call-bg-val"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="set-row" id="call-bg-remove" hidden>
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M10 11v6M14 11v6"/><path d="M6 7l1 12a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-12"/><path d="M9 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">移除通话背景</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:0 16px 8px">【通话背景图片】作用于接通后的「通话小框」（底部那条悬浮通话条）。来电 / 去电弹出的方形通话弹窗默认也用它；一旦在下面「通话半框背景图片」单独设过，弹窗就只显示那一张。两者互不影响，都按联系人各自保存。</div>
        <!-- #641：通话半框（聊天页「更多功能→通话」的底部半屏面板）直达入口 + 来电/去电弹窗专属背景图片 -->
        <div class="gs-title">通话半框</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="set-row" id="call-half-open">
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="12" width="18" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M7 12V7a5 5 0 0110 0v5"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">打开通话半框</div>
            <div class="val">前往打开</div>
          </div>
          <div class="set-row" id="call-half-bg-row">
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">通话半框背景图片</div>
            <div class="val" id="call-half-bg-val"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="set-row" id="call-half-bg-remove" hidden>
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M10 11v6M14 11v6"/><path d="M6 7l1 12a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-12"/><path d="M9 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">移除通话半框背景</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:0 16px 8px">【通话半框背景图片】作用于「联系人打给你 / 你打给联系人」时弹出的那个方形通话弹窗（就是聊天「更多功能→通话」里「打开来电弹窗」预览的那个框）。没设过它时弹窗沿用上面的通话背景；设过就只显示它。通话小框不受影响，按联系人各自保存。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 音效设置（独立页面） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-sfx-settings" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="sfx-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">音效设置</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-scroll">
        <!-- #643：音效作用范围——全部桌面共用 / 各桌面各自（默认各自，保持原行为） -->
        <div class="gs-title">作用范围</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="gs-row"><span>所有桌面共用音效设置</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="sfx-unified"><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:0 16px 8px">关闭（默认）＝每个联系人桌面各自一套音效；开启＝全部桌面共用同一套。开启时会以【当前桌面】的设置作为共用设置（各桌面自己的设置保留，关掉开关即恢复各桌面独立）。</div>
        <!-- v3.26.x：音效设置页重设计——三类音效各一张独立卡片（头部=图标+名称+当前状态，中部=预设胶囊，底部=动态操作行） -->
        <div class="gs-title">联系人来电</div>
        <div class="set-group glass sfx-card">
          <div class="set-row" id="sfx-ring-row">
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 4.2a5.2 5.2 0 00-5.2 5.2c0 3.3-1.4 4.9-2.5 5.9a.85.85 0 00.6 1.4h14.2a.85.85 0 00.6-1.4c-1.1-1-2.5-2.6-2.5-5.9A5.2 5.2 0 0012 4.2z"/><path d="M10 18.8a2 2 0 004 0"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">来电铃声<span class="sub" id="sfx-ring-val"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sfx-presets" id="sfx-ring-presets"></div>
          <div class="sfx-tools" id="sfx-ring-tools"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="gs-title">联系人消息</div>
        <div class="set-group glass sfx-card">
          <div class="set-row" id="sfx-in-row">
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6.5 3.5h11a1 1 0 011 1v16l-6.5-4-6.5 4v-16a1 1 0 011-1z"/><path d="M7.8 9.2v5.6h2.4l3.9 3V6.2l-3.9 3z"/><path d="M15.8 9.7a3 3 0 010 4.6"/><path d="M17.5 7.8a5.2 5.2 0 010 8.4"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">TA 发来消息<span class="sub" id="sfx-in-val"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sfx-presets" id="sfx-in-presets"></div>
          <div class="sfx-tools" id="sfx-in-tools"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="gs-title">我的消息</div>
        <div class="set-group glass sfx-card">
          <div class="set-row" id="sfx-out-row">
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.5 3.5h-11a1 1 0 00-1 1v16l6.5-4 6.5 4v-16a1 1 0 00-1-1z"/><path d="M16.2 9.2v5.6h-2.4l-3.9 3V6.2l3.9 3z"/><path d="M8.2 9.7a3 3 0 000 4.6"/><path d="M6.5 7.8a5.2 5.2 0 000 8.4"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">我发送消息<span class="sub" id="sfx-out-val"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sfx-presets" id="sfx-out-presets"></div>
          <div class="sfx-tools" id="sfx-out-tools"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- #698d：群聊收发音效（全局一套，不随桌面/共用开关变化） -->
        <div class="gs-title">群聊消息</div>
        <div class="set-group glass sfx-card">
          <div class="set-row" id="sfx-gcin-row">
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H6a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">群聊收消息<span class="sub" id="sfx-gcin-val"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sfx-presets" id="sfx-gcin-presets"></div>
          <div class="sfx-tools" id="sfx-gcin-tools"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-group glass sfx-card">
          <div class="set-row" id="sfx-gcout-row">
            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H6a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></div>
            <div class="txt">群聊发消息<span class="sub" id="sfx-gcout-val"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sfx-presets" id="sfx-gcout-presets"></div>
          <div class="sfx-tools" id="sfx-gcout-tools"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:0 16px 8px">群聊音效为全部群聊通用的一套设置（不随联系人桌面变化）；未选择时群聊沿用上方「联系人消息」的设置。</div>
        <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:0 16px 8px">点击下方音效即可应用并试听；「静音」关闭该类音效。也可上传自定义音频（mp3 / wav / ogg / m4a），上传后可在底部试听或清除。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 聊天默认字卡（独立页面，可开关使用） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-default-cards" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="dc-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">聊天默认字卡</span>
      </div>
      <!-- #961 字卡库顶部标红提醒（与词典页同款）：默认聊天字卡与词典两池体量很大，不常用词典
           时建议关掉；文案与二级密码解锁成功弹窗共用 card-lock.js 的 window.mochiPresetSizeTip，
           由 default-cards.js 填充。静态空 div 留在模板里，改动只发生在文案侧。 -->
      <div class="dc-size-hint" id="dc-size-hint"></div>
      <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:8px 16px 0">说明：以下系统预设字卡为本站自搓字卡（AI 辅助设计），可逐张开启或关闭。</div>
      <div class="dc-toggle glass">
        <div class="dc-toggle-txt">
          <div class="dc-toggle-name">使用默认字卡</div>
          <div class="dc-toggle-sub">开启后，联系人回复会混入默认字卡</div>
        </div>
        <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dc-enabled"><span class="tk"></span></label>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.43.x：设置区顶部 tag 分类 + 点击展开——默认全部收起（首屏只留字卡列表），
           点 tag 展开对应设置（再点或切到别的 tag 收起）；分段控件样式，选中=白底浮起。
           默认全部收起，首屏只留字卡列表，避免四组设置全堆在页顶把列表顶出屏。 -->
      <div class="dc-set-tabs" id="dc-set-tabs">
        <button class="dc-set-tab" data-dcset="scene">场景开关<i class="dct-ar">▾</i></button>
        <button class="dc-set-tab" data-dcset="prob">使用概率<i class="dct-ar">▾</i></button>
        <button class="dc-set-tab" data-dcset="cat">分类设置<i class="dct-ar">▾</i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-set-panel" id="dc-set-scene" hidden>
      <div class="set-group glass" style="margin:8px 12px 0">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天使用</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dc-use-chat" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>信箱使用</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dc-use-mail" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>朋友圈使用</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dc-use-feed" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-set-panel" id="dc-set-prob" hidden>
      <div style="margin:12px 14px 4px;font-size:12px;color:#999;font-weight:600">使用概率（默认字卡在各场景出现的概率，0 即该场景不用默认字卡）</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" style="margin:0 12px">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天使用概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dc-overall-chat" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dc-overall-chat-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>写信使用概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dc-overall-mail" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dc-overall-mail-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>朋友圈使用概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dc-overall-feed" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dc-overall-feed-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.33.x：预设与自定义联动说明——整体使用概率 X% 即默认字卡占比，自定义字卡自动占 (100-X)%，
           两者相加为 100%；若无自定义字卡，自定义份额自然是空跑，不影响明面解释。 -->
      <div style="margin:8px 14px 2px;font-size:11px;color:#999;line-height:1.6">提示：使用概率与你自己设置的字卡是相对的，两者加起来为 100%——系统预设字卡设为 X% 时，自定义字卡即占 (100-X)% 的回复机会。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-set-panel" id="dc-set-cat" hidden>
      <div style="margin:12px 14px 4px;font-size:12px;color:#999;font-weight:600">分类使用（可单独开启/关闭）</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" style="margin:0 12px">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>主字卡</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dc-cat-main" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>颜文字</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dc-cat-kaomoji" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>emoji</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dc-cat-emoji" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>拍一拍</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dc-cat-touch" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.33.x：分类占比——默认字卡命中后，四大分类按此占比分配，四类合计 100%（权重按相对比例归一） -->
      <div style="margin:14px 14px 4px;font-size:12px;color:#999;font-weight:600">分类占比（默认字卡内部按此比例分配，四类合计 100%）</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" style="margin:0 12px">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>主字卡占比</span><div class="stepper" id="dc-prob-main" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dc-prob-main-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>颜文字占比</span><div class="stepper" id="dc-prob-kaomoji" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dc-prob-kaomoji-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>emoji 占比</span><div class="stepper" id="dc-prob-emoji" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dc-prob-emoji-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>拍一拍占比</span><div class="stepper" id="dc-prob-touch" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dc-prob-touch-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 词典已独立成大分类（li-dict-cards → page-dict-cards），不再在默认聊天字卡里重复出现 -->
      <div class="card-tabs" id="dc-tabs">
        <button class="cc-tab sel" data-type="main">主字卡</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="kaomoji">颜文字</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="emoji">emoji</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="touch">拍一拍</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cc-groups-bar" id="dc-groups-bar"></div>
      <!-- #317：词典自建词条行已移除（用户：词典是梦角用的语言资源，不该在预设字卡里手动存词条）——
           系统词典供「词典拼字」抽句与切词，按分组展示、可逐张开启/关闭即可 -->
      <div class="card-search glass">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input class="card-search-input" id="dc-search-input" placeholder="搜索默认字卡" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div class="card-list" id="dc-list">
        <!-- 默认字卡由 JS 按分类/分组渲染 -->
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 词典（独立分类，供词典拼字抽句/切词；内容=语录+词库+扩展常用词，可逐张开关、可新增自建） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-dict-cards" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="dict-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">聊天默认字卡·词典</span>
      </div>
      <!-- #961 词典页顶部标红提醒：词典是系统字卡里最大的一池，不常用词典拼字/拼句时建议关掉；
           与默认聊天字卡页同款（同一份文案，见 card-lock.js window.mochiPresetSizeTip）。 -->
      <div class="dc-size-hint" id="dict-size-hint"></div>
      <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:8px 16px 0">说明：系统词典供「词典拼字」抽卡，按分组展示，可逐张开启或关闭；语录与词库里的字卡都会进抽卡池。<br>联系人气泡左下角 tag 口径：一条消息里只装一张字卡＝「词典」；一条消息里拼进多张字卡、每张都超过 4 字（整句）＝「词典拼句」；多张里含 4 字以内短词＝「词典拼词」；一张卡一条气泡逐条连发时，除「词典」外另带「词典逐卡连发」标记玩法。</div>
      <!-- #390：二级锁与词典的关系提示——锁定=系统内置字卡整体停用（含词典），下方场景开关开着也无效；
           用户实报「词典开关都开了却没效果、不懂和开屏二级密码的关系」。默认隐藏，default-cards.js 按锁态渲染 -->
      <div class="dict-lock-hint" id="dict-lock-hint" hidden></div>
      <!-- v3.43.x：设置区顶部 tag 分类 + 点击展开（与聊天默认字卡页同款）——默认全部收起，
           首屏只留词典列表；点「场景开关 / 使用概率」展开对应设置。 -->
      <div class="dc-set-tabs" id="dict-set-tabs">
        <button class="dc-set-tab" data-dcset="use">场景开关<i class="dct-ar">▾</i></button>
        <button class="dc-set-tab" data-dcset="prob">使用概率<i class="dct-ar">▾</i></button>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.36.x：词典使用设置（与聊天默认字卡页同款交互）——场景开关 + 使用概率 + 一键全部关闭。
           存键 dict-use-chat/mail/feed（默认开）、dict-overall-chat/mail/feed（聊天默认 75，
           写信/朋友圈默认 30%）。聊天关=词典拼字整体停；写信/朋友圈开=词典语录按概率混入信件/动态文案。 -->
      <div class="dc-set-panel" id="dict-set-use" hidden>
      <div class="set-group glass" style="margin:8px 12px 0">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天使用</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dict-use-chat" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>写信使用</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dict-use-mail" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>朋友圈使用</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dict-use-feed" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin:8px 14px 0;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end">
        <button class="cc-tool" id="dict-use-closeall" style="padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px">使用的全部关闭</button>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-set-panel" id="dict-set-prob" hidden>
      <div style="margin:12px 14px 2px;font-size:12px;color:#999;font-weight:600">使用概率（词典内容在各场景出现的概率，0 即该场景不用词典）</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" style="margin:0 12px 10px">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>聊天使用概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dict-overall-chat" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dict-overall-chat-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>写信使用概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dict-overall-mail" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dict-overall-mail-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>朋友圈使用概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dict-overall-feed" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dict-overall-feed-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin:0 14px 8px;font-size:11px;color:#999;line-height:1.6">说明：聊天词典内容走「词典拼字」（此概率是其额外总闸，回复设置里的拼字开关/概率继续生效）；写信/朋友圈开启后，词典语录按概率混入信件与动态文案。开关按当前桌面联系人独立保存。</div>
      </div>
      <!-- #317：词典自建词条行已移除（用户：词典是梦角用的语言资源，不该在这里手动存词条） -->
      <div class="cc-groups-bar" id="d2-dict-groups-bar"></div>
      <div class="card-tabs" id="d2-dict-tabs" style="display:none"></div>
      <div class="card-search glass">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input class="card-search-input" id="d2-dict-search" placeholder="搜索词典字卡" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div class="card-list" id="d2-dict-list">
        <!-- 系统词典由 JS 按分组渲染 -->
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 其他互动功能字卡（独立页面，可开关；功能触发字卡不放进聊天默认字卡） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-fun-cards" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="fc-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">其他互动功能字卡</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:8px 16px 0">说明：以下为各功能（摸鱼 / 经期 / 喝水 / 存钱罐 / 漂流瓶 / 互动回应 / 番茄钟 / TA的关心 / 备忘提醒 / TA主动提问）触发时联系人会使用的自搓字卡或发进聊天的消息，非聊天通用字卡，可逐张开启或关闭。每一项右侧的「使用概率」为该功能触发的概率，可自由调整（0% 即不再出现）；每行都有「功能说明」可点开看触发详情。</div>
      <!-- v3.33.x：总开关——其他互动功能字卡可整体开启/关闭（dcf-enabled 键，默认开启）；
           关闭后各功能触发字卡都不再随机出现，各分类概率（底部 dcf-prob-*）仍可独立调整；
           不影响独立入口「联系人跨桌面查岗」。 -->
      <div class="set-group glass" style="margin:10px 12px 0">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>使用其他互动功能字卡</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="dcf-enabled" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.42.x #444：概率框移回页顶（用户报「概率位置太靠后看不到」）——默认折叠为一条展开栏，首屏仍是字卡列表；
           #239 的 fc 页整页滚动规则保证展开后列表不被 flex 压扁；展开状态按桌面持久化（dcf-prob-open）。 -->
      <div class="set-group glass" id="dcf-prob-expander" style="margin:10px 12px 0">
        <div class="gs-row" id="dcf-prob-expander-row" style="cursor:pointer"><span>各功能使用概率调节（点此展开 / 收起）</span><span id="dcf-prob-expander-arrow">▾</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="set-group glass" id="dcf-prob-box" hidden style="margin:0 12px 0">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>摸鱼字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-fish" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-fish-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>经期字卡概率（温柔前缀/动作/经期关心）</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-period" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-period-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>喝水字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-water" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-water-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>存钱罐字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-piggy" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-piggy-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>漂流瓶字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-drift" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-drift-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>互动回应字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-interact" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-interact-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>音乐字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-music" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-music-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <!-- v3.42.x #422：番茄钟完成消息——只读式「发到聊天」概率门控，无独立字卡池，
             不参与上方案引卡管理；0%=不进聊天，100%=原行为。功能说明标签由 default-cards.js 注入。 -->
        <div class="gs-row"><span>番茄钟完成发到聊天</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-pomo" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-pomo-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <!-- v3.42.x #422：TA的关心（经期）——在经期页「梦角关心」按钮之外追加一层概率门控，
             0%=不发关心，100%=只按经期页原节奏；「梦角关心」按钮本身不受本概率影响。 -->
        <div class="gs-row"><span>TA的关心（经期）</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-care" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-care-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.32.x：分类使用概率——每个功能分类的触发概率可显示可调（dcf-<分类> 键，默认=历史值）。
           FIX 2026-09-07 #239：13 行 stepper（~794px）直插头部时 .card-list{flex:1;overflow-y:auto}
           的 flex 最小尺寸因 overflow 非 visible 归 0，列表被压成 6px 且首屏完全在屏幕外。
           v3.42.x #444：概率框移回页顶但默认折叠（用户报「概率位置太靠后看不到」）——首屏仍是
           字卡列表，fc 页整页滚动规则（chat-pages.css #239）保证展开后列表不被 flex 压扁。 -->
      <div class="card-tabs" id="fc-tabs">
        <button class="cc-tab sel" data-type="fish">摸鱼</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="eat">吃饭</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="period">经期</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="piggy">存钱罐</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="drift">漂流瓶</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="interact">互动回应</button>
        <button class="cc-tab" data-type="music">音乐</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cc-groups-bar" id="fc-groups-bar"></div>
      <div class="card-search glass">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input class="card-search-input" id="fc-search-input" placeholder="搜索功能触发字卡" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div class="card-list" id="fc-list">
        <!-- 功能触发字卡由 JS 按分类/分组渲染 -->
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 联系人跨桌面查岗（独立页面，可开关使用） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-deskcheck" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="dk-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">联系人跨桌面查岗</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:8px 16px 0">说明：联系人跨桌面查岗分两种方向——「联系人对我查岗」是 TA 主动来查我、我回答后 TA 的回应；「联系人申请我对联系人查岗」是 TA 请我去查 TA、TA 被查时的回应。可逐张开启或关闭。</div>
      <!-- v3.32.x：查岗回应触发概率（dcf-deskcheck，默认 50%） -->
      <div class="set-group glass" id="dcf-prob-box-dk" style="margin:10px 12px 0">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>查岗回应概率</span><div class="stepper" id="dcf-prob-deskcheck" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="dcf-prob-deskcheck-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-tabs" id="dk-tabs">
        <button class="cc-tab sel" data-type="deskcheck">联系人跨桌面查岗</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cc-groups-bar" id="dk-groups-bar"></div>
      <div class="card-search glass">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input class="card-search-input" id="dk-search-input" placeholder="搜索查岗回应字卡" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div class="card-list" id="dk-list">
        <!-- 联系人跨桌面查岗回应字卡由 JS 渲染 -->
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 聊天情绪字卡（独立页面，可开关） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-mood-cards" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="mc-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">聊天情绪字卡</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-toggle glass">
        <div class="dc-toggle-txt">
          <div class="dc-toggle-name">使用情绪字卡</div>
          <div class="dc-toggle-sub">开启后，联系人回复会附带情绪字卡</div>
        </div>
        <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="mc-enabled"><span class="tk"></span></label>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.26.x #515：三类的触发概率显示 + 可调（用户报「聊天情绪字卡页没有显示触发的概率和
           可调整的按钮功能」）。存键 mc-prob-mood / mc-prob-heart / mc-prob-intent（per-cid），
           未设置时回退改版前写死的 70 / 40 / 40＝行为不变；情绪卡连续触发的原有衰减按比例缩放
           （基数 70% 时与旧行为逐档一致）。消费方 mood-reply-cards.js 的
           getMoodCard / getHeartCard / getIntentCard，接线见该文件。 -->
      <div class="set-group glass" id="mc-prob-box" style="margin:10px 12px 0">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>情绪字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="mc-prob-mood" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mc-prob-mood-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>心意字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="mc-prob-heart" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mc-prob-heart-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>交流意图字卡概率</span><div class="stepper" id="mc-prob-intent" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="mc-prob-intent-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.6.x #500：三类分栏（情绪 / 心意 / 交流意图）——三级链路整类与单张都要能关，
           此前只渲染情绪一类，心意与交流意图卡在字卡库里没有列表＝没有关闭入口 -->
      <div class="cc-groups-bar" id="mc-type-bar"></div>
      <div class="sm-set-hint" id="mc-type-hint" style="padding:2px 16px 4px">说明：联系人回复可能依次附带情绪 → 心意 → 交流意图三类字卡（各自独立概率，可在上方逐类调整），三类均可整类或逐张关闭。</div>
      <div class="sm-set-hint" id="mc-prob-hint" style="padding:0 16px 4px">「情绪字卡概率」为基础概率：连续触发时仍按原有衰减规则递减（相对基数第 1 次 100%、第 2 次约 86%、第 3 次约 64%、第 4 次约 43%、第 5 次起约 29%）；三类各自独立判定，一次回复可同时出现 1~3 类。想彻底关：把对应概率调到 0%，或关掉上方「使用情绪字卡」（三类一起停）。</div>
      <div class="gs-title" id="mc-group-title">情绪分组</div>
      <div class="cc-groups-bar" id="mc-groups-bar"></div>
      <div class="card-search glass" id="mc-search">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input class="card-search-input" id="mc-search-input" placeholder="搜索情绪字卡" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div class="card-list" id="mc-list">
        <!-- 情绪字卡按分组渲染 -->
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TA的心情（独立页面，可开关） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-ta-mood" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="tm-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">TA的心情</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-toggle glass">
        <div class="dc-toggle-txt">
          <div class="dc-toggle-name">使用心情分享</div>
          <div class="dc-toggle-sub">开启后，TA 在聊天中有概率主动分享自己的心情/近况</div>
        </div>
        <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="tm-enabled"><span class="tk"></span></label>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-row"><span>分享概率</span><div class="stepper" data-min="5" data-max="30" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="tm-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      <div class="sm-set-hint" style="padding:4px 16px 6px">触发后需间隔几条正常聊天才会再次分享；同类心情短时间不会连续出现。分享消息的来源小标有 10% 概率显示为「你的心情」——TA 有时发这张卡其实是想问你的心情，小标会随机变化。</div>
      <div class="gs-title">心情分组</div>
      <div class="cc-groups-bar" id="tm-groups-bar"></div>
      <div class="card-search glass" id="tm-search">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input class="card-search-input" id="tm-search-input" placeholder="搜索心情字卡" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div class="card-list" id="tm-list">
        <!-- 心情字卡按分组渲染 -->
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 聊天回应字卡（独立页面，可开关） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-reply-cards" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="rc-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">聊天回应字卡</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-toggle glass">
        <div class="dc-toggle-txt">
          <div class="dc-toggle-name">使用回应字卡</div>
          <div class="dc-toggle-sub">开启后，联系人回复有概率使用回应字卡</div>
        </div>
        <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="rc-enabled"><span class="tk"></span></label>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.26.x #515：回应字卡（逻辑连接词）两个消费点的概率显示 + 可调（用户报「聊天回应字卡页
           没有显示触发的概率和可调整的按钮功能」）：
           ①「回应字卡使用概率」＝整条回复被换成一整张回应字卡的概率（原 getReplyCard 里写死 30%，
             现读 rcard-prob，per-cid，未设置＝30% 行为不变）；
           ②「连接词追加概率」＝回复尾部再追加一条连接词的概率（原回复设置里无 UI 的 cf-prob，
             默认 20%），读写走 window.replyCfg / window.saveReplyCfg（与回复设置同一份 reply- 键），
             不新开键——避免同一语义两处各存一份。 -->
      <div class="set-group glass" id="rc-prob-box" style="margin:10px 12px 0">
        <div class="gs-row"><span>回应字卡使用概率</span><div class="stepper" id="rcard-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="rcard-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        <div class="gs-row"><span>连接词追加概率</span><div class="stepper" id="cf-prob" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="cf-prob-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sm-set-hint" id="rc-prob-hint" style="padding:2px 16px 4px">说明：本页字卡是「逻辑连接词」，TA 回话时有两种用法——①按「回应字卡使用概率」整条回复换成一张连接词字卡（默认 30%）；②按「连接词追加概率」在回复末尾再补一句连接词（默认 20%，与回复设置里的连接词概率是同一项，改任意一处都生效）。两个概率都调到 0% 等于不用回应字卡（也可直接用上方总开关）；「连接词追加」另受回复设置里的「多字卡回复」总开关约束——它关闭时这条不再追加（追加＝一条气泡两张字卡）。</div>
      <div class="gs-title">回应字卡分类</div>
      <div class="cc-groups-bar" id="rc-groups-bar"></div>
      <div class="card-search glass" id="rc-search">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input class="card-search-input" id="rc-search-input" placeholder="搜索回应字卡" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div class="card-list" id="rc-list">
        <!-- 回应字卡按分类渲染 -->
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 通用弹层（替代 prompt/confirm，IAB 不支持原生弹窗） -->
    <div class="modal-mask" id="modal-mask" hidden>
      <div class="modal">
        <div class="modal-title" id="modal-title">修改昵称</div>
        <div class="modal-static" id="modal-static" hidden></div>
        <input type="text" class="modal-input" id="modal-input" placeholder="输入内容">
        <textarea class="modal-textarea" id="modal-textarea" rows="3" placeholder="多行内容"></textarea>
        <div class="modal-swatches" id="modal-swatches" hidden></div>
        <div class="modal-pills" id="modal-pills" hidden></div>
        <div class="modal-slider" id="modal-slider" hidden>
          <div class="ms-head">
            <span class="ms-label" id="modal-slider-label"></span>
            <span class="ms-val" id="modal-slider-val"></span>
          </div>
          <input type="range" class="ms-range" id="modal-slider-range" min="0" max="30" step="1">
          <div class="ms-preview" id="modal-slider-preview" hidden>
            <div class="ms-ico" id="modal-slider-preview-ico"></div>
            <span class="ms-preview-txt">图标实时预览</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <input type="color" id="modal-color" value="#111111" hidden>
        <button class="modal-custom" id="modal-custom" hidden>自定义颜色</button>
        <select class="modal-select" id="modal-select" hidden></select>
        <div class="modal-group-chips" id="modal-group-chips" hidden></div>
        <button class="modal-file" id="modal-file" hidden>从文件导入</button>
        <div class="modal-btns">
          <!-- v3.25.x：导出按钮——诊断文本变长后部分手机剪贴板复制不全，下载文件兜底（opts.exportBtn）；#227 起 txt 改 docx（Word/WPS 直开） -->
          <!-- v3.26.x：补 type="button"——全站唯一漏写类型的按钮组；缺 type 默认是 submit，在个别 webview 里点【复制/导出/取消/确定】可能触发表单默认行为导致整页刷新（用户反馈） -->
          <!-- v3.27.x #794：第三自定义按钮位（opts.extraBtn）——诊断报告「一键修正」等"就地行动"场景；不传保持隐藏，对既有弹窗零影响 -->
          <button type="button" class="modal-btn copy" id="modal-extra" hidden>一键修正</button>
          <button type="button" class="modal-btn copy" id="modal-export" hidden>导出docx</button>
          <button type="button" class="modal-btn copy" id="modal-copy" hidden>复制</button>
          <button type="button" class="modal-btn cancel" id="modal-cancel">取消</button>
          <button type="button" class="modal-btn ok" id="modal-ok">确定</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- v3.33.x #523：交卷时间自绘选择器（替代原生 datetime-local）。静态锚点随 template 预先存在——
         动态 append 的输入框依赖 mobile-adapt 的 MutationObserver 转换，部分桌面预览/内核下会点不动，
         静态放置可走载入时的全量 ceConvert，确保数字框全端可聚焦可输入。 -->
    <div class="modal-mask" id="dl-picker-mask" hidden>
      <div class="modal">
        <div class="modal-title" id="dl-picker-title">设置时间</div>
        <div class="modal-static" id="dl-picker-cur">未设置</div>
        <div class="dl-picker-row">
          <span class="dl-picker-lbl">秒</span>
          <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" class="dl-picker-in" id="dl-picker-secs" placeholder="60">
        </div>
        <div class="modal-btns">
          <button type="button" class="modal-btn cancel" id="dl-picker-clear">清除</button>
          <button type="button" class="modal-btn cancel" id="dl-picker-cancel">取消</button>
          <button type="button" class="modal-btn ok" id="dl-picker-ok">确定</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 日历页（桌面点「日历」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-calendar" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="cal-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">日历</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <!-- 月历（上移：选日期 → 看详情） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" id="cal-grid-card">
          <div class="cal-month-head">
            <button class="cal-month-btn" id="cal-prev" title="上个月">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <span class="cal-month-txt" id="cal-month-txt">—</span>
            <button class="cal-month-btn" id="cal-next" title="下个月">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-grid" id="cal-grid"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 心情日记入口（#303：v3.27.x 由「聊天更多功能→工具」迁入桌面日历；点卡片直接进心情日记页，下方实时预览我/梦角今日心情） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass mood-entry-card" id="cal-mood-entry">
          <div class="mood-entry-head">
            <span class="cal-sec-title">心情日记 <span class="mood-entry-sub">每日心情 · 月度曲线</span></span>
            <span class="mood-entry-go">进入 ›</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mood-entry-row"><span class="mood-entry-k">我的心情</span><span class="mood-entry-v" id="mood-entry-mine">今天还没记心情</span></div>
          <div class="mood-entry-row"><span class="mood-entry-k" id="mood-entry-ta-label">梦角（心情日记）</span><span class="mood-entry-v" id="mood-entry-ta">今天还没有互动</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- TA 今天（合并：心情 + 正在 + 留言 + 情话） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" id="cal-ta-card">
          <div class="cal-date-head">
            <span class="cal-date-txt" id="cal-today-date"></span>
            <span class="cal-cat-tag" id="cal-mood-cat"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-mood-row">
            <span class="cal-mood-ico" id="cal-mood-ico"></span>
            <div>
              <div class="cal-mood-name" id="cal-mood-name">—</div>
              <div class="cal-mood-desc" id="cal-mood-desc"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-activity">
            <span class="cal-act-label">TA 正在</span>
            <span id="cal-activity">—</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-sec">
            <div class="cal-sec-title">留言</div>
            <div class="cal-sec-body" id="cal-message">今天也想对你说点什么...</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-sec">
            <div class="cal-sec-title">情话</div>
            <div class="cal-sec-body" id="cal-quote"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 我今天（合并：留言 + 备忘 + 心情 + 摸鱼/工作值） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" id="cal-me-card">
          <div class="cal-sec">
            <div class="cal-sec-head">
              <div class="cal-sec-title">我的留言</div>
              <button class="cal-edit-btn" id="cal-edit-btn">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4z"/></svg>
                编辑
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="cal-sec-body cal-mine" id="cal-my-message">今天想说点什么...</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-sec">
            <div class="cal-sec-title">备忘</div>
            <div class="cal-sec-body cal-mine" id="cal-memo"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-sec">
            <div class="cal-sec-title">心情</div>
            <div class="cal-sec-body cal-mine" id="cal-mood"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-sec">
            <div class="cal-sec-title">摸鱼 · 工作</div>
            <div class="cal-sec-body" id="cal-stats"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 空态（未来日期统一提示，不再各卡各说一遍） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass cal-empty" id="cal-empty-card" hidden>
          <div class="cal-empty-txt" id="cal-empty-txt">这一天还没有内容</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 经期记录页（桌面第三页点「经期记录」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-period" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="period-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">经期记录</span>
        <span class="period-cog" id="period-cog" title="周期设置"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/></svg></span>
      </div>
      <div class="period-scroll">
        <!-- 当前状态卡片 -->
        <div class="period-card glass" id="period-status-card">
          <div class="period-status-head">
            <span class="period-status-ico" id="period-status-ico"></span>
            <div>
              <div class="period-status-title" id="period-status-title">—</div>
              <div class="period-status-sub" id="period-status-sub">—</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="period-phase-bar" id="period-phase-bar"></div>
          <div class="period-action-row" id="period-action-row">
            <button class="period-btn primary" id="period-mark-start">标记今天开始</button>
            <button class="period-btn" id="period-mark-end">标记今天结束</button>
            <button class="period-btn" id="period-record-today">记录今天</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 本月日历 -->
        <div class="period-card glass">
          <div class="period-month-head">
            <button class="period-month-btn" id="period-prev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button>
            <span class="period-month-txt" id="period-month-txt">—</span>
            <button class="period-month-btn" id="period-next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></button>
          </div>
          <div class="period-legend">
            <span class="lg lg-period">经期</span>

            <span class="lg lg-predict">预测</span>
          </div>
          <div class="period-grid" id="period-grid"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 历史记录 -->
        <div class="period-card glass">
          <div class="period-card-title">历史记录</div>
          <div class="period-history" id="period-history"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>



    <!-- 占卜页（桌面点「占卜」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-divine" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="div-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">占卜</span>
      </div>
      <div class="div-scroll">
        <div class="div-setup">
          <div class="div-modes" id="div-modes">
            <button class="div-mode sel" data-mode="tarot">塔罗</button>
            <button class="div-mode" data-mode="lenormand">雷诺曼</button>
          </div>
          <div class="div-modes div-counts" id="div-counts">
            <button class="div-mode sel" data-count="3">3 张</button>
            <button class="div-mode" data-count="1">1 张</button>
            <button class="div-mode" data-count="7">7 张</button>
          </div>
          <!-- v3.26.x：占卜对象（可选全部桌面联系人，也可不选；选了对象结果存入主页「占卜记录」） -->
          <div class="div-modes div-targets" id="div-targets"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="div-card glass">
          <div class="dec-inp-wrap"><input type="text" class="div-input" id="div-question" placeholder="写下你的问题（可选）"><button class="dec-inp-clear" data-clear="div-question" aria-label="清空" title="清空">✕</button></div>
          <label class="div-switch-row">
            <span class="div-switch-t">抽完自动发到聊天</span>
            <span class="div-switch"><input type="checkbox" id="div-auto-send"><span class="div-switch-knob"></span></span>
          </label>
        </div>

        <button class="div-draw" id="div-draw">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg>
          抽牌
        </button>

        <div class="div-result" id="div-result">
          <div class="div-result-empty">点击上方按钮开始抽牌</div>
        </div>

        <div class="div-card glass" style="margin-top:14px">
          <div id="div-history"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 音乐页（音乐库 / 歌单 / 听歌记录，桌面第二页点「音乐」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-music" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="music-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">音乐</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sm-float-row">
        <span>悬浮播放小框</span>
        <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="music-float-en"><span class="tk"></span></label>
      </div>
      <div class="fav-tabs">
        <button class="fav-tab sel" data-mtab="lib">我的音乐库</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-mtab="pl">歌单</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-mtab="fav">我的收藏</button>
        <!-- v3.14.x：联系人的收藏——标题由 music-player.js syncTaFavTab() 按联系人昵称填充 -->
        <button class="fav-tab" data-mtab="favta">TA的收藏</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-mtab="his">梦角邀请听歌记录</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll sm-scroll">
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="lib">
          <div class="sm-tools">
            <button class="sm-tool" id="music-upload">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 16V4M7 9l5-5 5 5"/><path d="M4 17v2a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2v-2"/></svg>上传音乐
            </button>
            <button class="sm-tool" id="music-add-url">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 14a5 5 0 007.1 0l2.9-2.9a5 5 0 10-7.1-7.1L11 6"/><path d="M14 10a5 5 0 00-7.1 0L4 12.9a5 5 0 107.1 7.1L13 18"/></svg>链接添加
            </button>
            <button class="sm-tool" id="music-batch">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg>批量导入
            </button>
            <button class="sm-tool" id="music-batch-manage">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg>批量管理
            </button>
            <!-- v3.14.x：存量库清理——网易云会员/付费歌曲网页外链无法播放，批量检测并移除 -->
            <button class="sm-tool" id="music-vip-clean">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>清理会员歌曲
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="music-lib-filter" id="music-lib-filter"></div>
          <div id="music-lib-list"></div>
          <div class="ta-empty" id="music-lib-empty" hidden>还没有音乐，上传本地音乐，建立属于你们的声音陪伴空间（只支持本机音频文件、网易云链接 / 歌单、音频直链；QQ音乐等其他 App 的分享链接不能导入）</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="pl" hidden>
          <div id="music-pl-list"></div>
          <button class="mem-add" id="music-pl-create">＋ 新建歌单</button>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="fav" hidden>
          <div id="music-fav-list"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.14.x：联系人的收藏列表 -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="favta" hidden>
          <div id="music-fav-ta-list"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="his" hidden>
          <div id="music-his-list"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sm-player-bar" id="sm-player-bar" hidden>
        <div class="sm-pb-info">
          <div class="sm-pb-name" id="sm-pb-name">未在播放</div>
          <div class="sm-pb-artist" id="sm-pb-artist"></div>
          <div class="sm-pb-progress"><span id="sm-pb-cur">00:00</span><span id="sm-pb-dur">00:00</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sm-pb-ctrl">
          <button class="sm-pb-btn" id="sm-mode" title="播放模式">
            <svg id="sm-mode-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 1l4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 014-4h14"/><path d="M7 23l-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 01-4 4H3"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="sm-pb-btn" id="sm-prev" title="上一首">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 6h2v12H6zm3.5 6l8.5 6V6z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="sm-pb-play" id="sm-play" title="播放/暂停">
            <svg id="sm-play-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="sm-pb-btn" id="sm-next" title="下一首">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 18l8.5-6L6 6v12zM16 6v12h2V6h-2z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="sm-pb-btn" id="sm-pb-heart" title="收藏">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20.5S4.5 15.2 4.5 9.9A4.9 4.9 0 0112 7.1a4.9 4.9 0 017.5 2.8c0 5.3-7.5 10.6-7.5 10.6z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="sm-pb-btn" id="sm-queue" title="播放队列">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h9"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    
    </div>

    <div class="page" id="page-now" hidden>
      <div class="np-bg" id="np-bg"></div>
      <div class="np-root">
        <div class="np-top">
          <button class="np-close" id="npClose" aria-label="收起播放器">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 15l6-6 6 6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <b class="np-top-c" id="npTopC" hidden>歌词</b>
          <div class="np-top-r">
            <button class="np-tbtn np-dots" id="npMore" aria-label="更多">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.7"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.7"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.7"/></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="np-main" id="npMain">
          <div class="np-cap">正在播放</div>
          <!-- v89：封面页顶部功能条——v92n 起「收藏 / 歌词」固定到底部右下角（队列正上方），
               顶部条只保留「TA 也摘一句 / 封面」 -->
          <div class="np-cov-bar" id="npCovBar">
            <button class="np-lrc-chip" id="npLyricTaCov">TA 也摘一句</button>
          </div>
          <div class="np-cover" id="npCover"></div>
          <!-- 歌词区（内联在正在播放页里，打开时隐藏封面）：字号 小/中/大，当前行放大 -->
          <div class="np-lrc" id="npLrc" hidden>
            <div class="np-lrc-bar">
              <button class="np-lrc-chip" id="npLrcBack">歌词</button>
              <button class="np-lrc-chip" id="npLyricTa">TA 也摘一句</button>
              <div class="np-lrc-sizes" id="npLrcSizes">
                <button data-lsz="s">小</button><button data-lsz="m" class="on">中</button><button data-lsz="l">大</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="np-lrc-tip" id="npLrcTip">双击歌词可引用给他 · 上下滑动歌词可跳到那一句</div>
            <div class="np-lrc-body" id="npLrcBody"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="np-title" id="npTitle">未在播放</div>
          <div class="np-artist" id="npArtist">先去曲库挑一首</div>
          <div class="np-hr"></div>
          <div class="np-prog">
            <div class="np-rail" id="npRail">
              <div class="np-fill" id="npFill"></div>
              <div class="np-knob" id="npKnob"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="np-times"><span id="npCur">0:00</span><span id="npDur">-0:00</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="np-ctrl">
            <button class="np-cbtn" id="npPrev" aria-label="上一首">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 6h2v12H6zm3.5 6l8.5 6V6z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <button class="np-play" id="npPlay" aria-label="播放/暂停">
              <svg id="npPlayIco" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <button class="np-cbtn" id="npNext" aria-label="下一首">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 18l8.5-6L6 6v12zM16 6v12h2V6h-2z"/></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="np-subbar">
            <!-- v92n：收藏（💓图标）+ 歌词固定在此行右下角——正上方就是「队列」，两种视图都不动 -->
            <button class="np-subbtn np-favbtn" id="npFav" aria-label="收藏" title="收藏">
              <svg id="npFavIco" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20.5S4.5 15.2 4.5 9.9A4.9 4.9 0 0 1 12 7.1a4.9 4.9 0 0 1 7.5 2.8c0 5.3-7.5 10.6-7.5 10.6z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <button class="np-subbtn" id="npLyricBtn">歌词</button>
          </div>
          <div class="np-tools">
            <button class="np-tool" id="npMode">
              <svg id="npModeIco" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 1l4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 014-4h14"/><path d="M7 23l-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 01-4 4H3"/></svg>
              <span id="npModeTxt">单曲循环</span>
            </button>
            <button class="np-tool" id="npVol">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 9.5v5h3.2L12 18.5v-13L7.2 9.5H4z"/><path d="M15.5 9a4.2 4.2 0 010 6"/><path d="M18 6.5a7.6 7.6 0 010 11"/></svg>
              <span>音量</span>
            </button>
            <button class="np-tool" id="npTimer">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="8"/><path d="M12 9.5V13l2.4 1.6"/><path d="M9 2.5h6"/></svg>
              <span id="npTimerTxt">定时</span>
            </button>
            <button class="np-tool" id="npQueue">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h13"/></svg>
              <span>队列</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 歌词引用弹窗（双击任意一句歌词才弹出） -->
      <div class="np-modal" id="npQuotePop" hidden>
        <div class="np-modal-mask" data-qclose="1"></div>
        <div class="np-modal-card">
          <div class="np-modal-h">引用这一句</div>
          <div class="np-modal-quote" id="npQuoteTxt"></div>
          <div class="np-modal-btns">
            <button class="np-mb-pri" data-qact="me">引用给他</button>
            <button class="lite" data-qact="cancel">取消</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 「TA 也摘一句」概率面板 -->
      <div class="np-modal" id="npTaPop" hidden>
        <div class="np-modal-mask" data-tclose="1"></div>
        <div class="np-modal-card">
          <div class="np-modal-h">TA 也摘一句</div>
          <div class="np-modal-desc">开着的时候，TA 听歌会偶尔摘一句发给你，像随手递过来半句。</div>
          <div class="np-ta-chips" id="npTaChips">
            <button data-ta="off">关</button><button data-ta="low">少</button><button data-ta="mid" class="on">适中</button><button data-ta="high">勤</button>
          </div>
          <div class="np-modal-note" id="npTaNote">现在：每次听歌约 25% 会摘一句</div>
          <div class="np-modal-btns">
            <button class="np-mb-pri" data-tact="now">现在摘一句</button>
            <button class="lite" data-tact="close">收起</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 音量 -->
      <div class="np-pop" id="npVolPop" hidden>
        <div class="np-pop-h">音量<button class="np-pop-x" data-popclose="1" aria-label="关闭">×</button></div>
        <div class="np-pop-row">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 9.5v5h3.2L12 18.5v-13L7.2 9.5H4z"/><path d="M15.5 9a4.2 4.2 0 010 6"/></svg>
          <input type="range" id="npVolRange" min="0" max="100" value="100">
          <span id="npVolNum">100%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 定时 -->
      <div class="np-pop" id="npTimerPop" hidden>
        <div class="np-pop-h">定时关闭<button class="np-pop-x" data-popclose="1" aria-label="关闭">×</button></div>
        <div class="np-pop-btns">
          <button data-min="15">15 分钟</button>
          <button data-min="30">30 分钟</button>
          <button data-min="60">60 分钟</button>
          <button data-min="0">关闭定时</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page" id="page-cjian" hidden>
      <div class="yz-page">
        <div class="yz-top">
          <button class="yz-back" id="yzCjBack" aria-label="返回">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="yz-body" id="yzCjScroll">
          <div class="yz-cj-hero">
            <div class="yz-cj-name" id="yzCjShi">戌初</div>
            <div class="yz-cj-time" id="yzCjRange">19:00-21:59 · 现实此刻 19:14</div>
          </div>
          <div class="yz-cj-tabs" id="yzCjTabs">
            <button data-ctab="state" class="yz-cj-tab">状态</button>
            <button data-ctab="world" class="yz-cj-tab on">世界</button>
            <button data-ctab="log" class="yz-cj-tab">记录</button>
          </div>
          <div class="yz-card" id="yzSenseCard" hidden>
            <div class="yz-card-h"><b>感知卡</b><span class="yz-tag">把此刻发进聊天</span></div>
            <div class="yz-note" style="margin-bottom:10px">大约每 1.5–5 小时看一次机会，抽中就把这一位此刻的感知（六行：时辰、此刻、心情、想说的、TA 读到的你、读到的心动）发成一张卡落进聊天；连着三次没抽中，第四次必定发一张。夜深（23:00–07:00）这段时间一次机会都不掷，等白天回来接着掷。</div>
            <div class="yz-chips yz-sense-lv" id="yzSenseLv">
              <button class="yz-chip" data-slv="0">关</button>
              <button class="yz-chip" data-slv="1">少</button>
              <button class="yz-chip on" data-slv="2">适中</button>
              <button class="yz-chip" data-slv="3">勤</button>
            </div>
            <div class="yz-note" id="yzSenseNow">现在：每次机会 40% · 这一位一天约 3 张</div>
            <div class="yz-2btn"><button id="yzSenseSend">现在发一张</button></div>
            <div class="yz-note">只发这一位 · 随时可关</div>
          </div>
          <div id="yzCjBody"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="yz-foot">
          <button id="yzCjCopy" title="复制这一屏">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15V6a2 2 0 012-2h8"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button id="yzCjClock" title="刷新">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button id="yzCjFx" title="换一换">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l1.9 5.3L19 10l-5.1 1.7L12 17l-1.9-5.3L5 10l5.1-1.7z"/><path d="M18.5 15.5l.7 2 2 .7-2 .7-.7 2-.7-2-2-.7 2-.7z"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 聊天统计页（桌面第二页点「聊天统计」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-stats" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="stats-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">统计</span>
        <button id="stats-go-interact" type="button" style="margin-left:auto;flex:none;background:none;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.12);border-radius:99px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#666;font-family:inherit;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent">提问记录 ›</button>
      </div>
      <div class="fav-tabs">
        <button class="fav-tab sel" data-stab="record">相处记录</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-stab="chat">聊天记录</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-stab="cc">文字字卡</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-stab="expr">情绪表达</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-stpanel="record">
          <div style="text-align:center;padding:16px 0 8px">
            <div style="font-size:46px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)" id="st-days">—</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">相处天数</div>
          </div>
          <div id="st-record-cards"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-stpanel="chat" hidden>
          <div id="st-chat-content"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-stpanel="cc" hidden>
          <div id="st-cc-content"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-stpanel="expr" hidden>
          <div id="st-expr-content"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 小互动页（桌面第二页点「小互动」进入） -->
<div class="page" id="page-interact" hidden>
  <div class="chat-head">
    <span class="ch-back" id="interact-back">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
    </span>
    <span class="ch-name">提问记录</span>
    <button id="interact-go-stats" type="button" style="margin-left:auto;flex:none;background:none;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.12);border-radius:99px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#666;font-family:inherit;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent">‹ 统计</button>
  </div>
  <div class="fav-tabs">
    <button class="fav-tab sel" data-tab="ask">TA的询问</button>
    <button class="fav-tab" data-tab="choose">TA的小问题</button>
    <button class="fav-tab" data-tab="curious">TA的好奇</button>
    <button class="fav-tab" data-tab="roast">TA的吐槽</button>
    <button class="fav-tab" data-tab="invite">邀请/问问</button>
  </div>
  <div class="cal-scroll">
    <div class="cal-card glass" data-panel="ask">
      <div class="cal-card-title">TA的询问</div>
      <div id="ar-ask"></div>
      <button class="mem-add" id="ar-ask-clear">清空询问记录</button>
    </div>
    <div class="cal-card glass" data-panel="choose" hidden>
      <div class="cal-card-title">TA的小问题</div>
      <div id="ar-choose"></div>
      <button class="mem-add" id="ar-choose-clear">清空小问题记录</button>
    </div>
    <div class="cal-card glass" data-panel="curious" hidden>
      <div class="cal-card-title">TA的好奇</div>
      <div id="ar-curious"></div>
      <button class="mem-add" id="ar-curious-clear">清空好奇记录</button>
    </div>
    <div class="cal-card glass" data-panel="roast" hidden>
      <div class="cal-card-title">TA的吐槽</div>
      <div id="ar-roast"></div>
      <button class="mem-add" id="ar-roast-clear">清空吐槽记录</button>
    </div>
    <div class="cal-card glass" data-panel="invite" hidden>
      <div class="cal-card-title">邀请 / 问问 TA</div>
      <div id="ar-invite"></div>
      <button class="mem-add" id="ar-invite-clear">清空邀请/问问记录</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

    <!-- 主页（桌面点「主页」进入，展示最近动态：换头像 / 通话记录） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-home" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="home-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">主页</span>
        <!-- v3.26.x：游乐室入口从 tab 记录区移到标题栏常驻按钮——原先作 data-hpanel="*" 卡置顶各 tab，占满记录区首屏影响查看其他 tag -->
        <button class="arc-home-entry" id="home-arcade-entry" type="button">🎮 游乐室</button>
      </div>
      <div class="fav-tabs">
        <button class="fav-tab sel" data-htab="av">换头像记录</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="call">通话记录</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="fish">每日摸鱼值</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="work">每日打工值</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="catch">摸鱼抓包</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="coinearn">心意币赚钱记录</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="coinask">心意币申请记录</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="coinrp">心意币红包记录</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="care">TA的关心</button>
        <!-- #1435：查岗两类从「TA的关心」里搬出来各归一栏——对我查岗＝本桌面 TA 发的查岗卡（现算自聊天），
             跨桌面查岗＝其他桌面来查岗的每一次投递（含错过没点【确认】的那些，那些不进聊天只在这里留痕） -->
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="ck">联系人对我查岗</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="xck">联系人跨桌面查岗</button>
        <!-- #1435：贴贴邀请记录（此前只散在聊天气泡与弹窗里，主页查不到） -->
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="cuddle">邀请贴贴</button>
        <!-- v3.26.x：占卜记录（占卜页抽牌选了对象，牌面与解读存入该联系人桌面 records-divine） -->
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="divine">占卜记录</button>
        <!-- #1493：情话存档（quote-history 每天一条的整本，按月折叠＋单条删除） -->
        <button class="fav-tab" data-htab="quotes">情话存档</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="av">
          <div class="cal-card-title">换头像记录</div>
          <div id="home-av"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="call" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">通话记录</div>
          <div id="home-call"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="fish" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">每日摸鱼值记录</div>
          <div id="home-fish"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="work" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">每日打工值记录</div>
          <div id="home-work"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="catch" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">摸鱼抓包记录</div>
          <div id="home-catch"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.16.x：心意币流水（赚钱/申请），分列我和当前联系人的入账 -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="coinearn" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">心意币赚钱记录</div>
          <div id="home-coinearn"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="coinask" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">心意币申请记录</div>
          <div id="home-coinask"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.16.x：心意币红包记录（双向：我发 + 联系人发；红包即心意币） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="coinrp" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">心意币红包记录</div>
          <div id="home-coinrp"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.16.x：联系人的关心（查岗/经期/喝水/吃饭/番茄陪伴） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="care" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">TA 的关心记录</div>
          <div id="home-care"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- #1435：联系人对我查岗（本桌面查岗卡，现算自聊天，含已回答/待回答） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="ck" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">联系人对我查岗</div>
          <div id="home-ck"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- #1435：联系人跨桌面查岗（各联系人桌面 records-care 的 desk-checkin 聚合，含错过未回应） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="xck" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">联系人跨桌面查岗</div>
          <div id="home-xck"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- #1435：邀请贴贴（TA 发起的贴贴邀请，一条邀请一行，结果随回应更新） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="cuddle" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">邀请贴贴记录</div>
          <div id="home-cuddle"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.26.x：占卜记录（占卜页抽牌选了对象 → 存该联系人桌面 records-divine） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="divine" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">占卜记录</div>
          <div id="home-divine"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- #1493：情话存档列表 -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-hpanel="quotes" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">情话存档</div>
          <div id="home-quotes"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 游乐室全屏页（主页页入口卡进入，返回回主页页；src/js/arcade.js） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-arcade" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="arcade-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">游乐室 · 和 <b id="arcade-lg-partner">TA</b> 的战绩</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <div class="arc-wrap">
          <div id="arcade-body"></div>
          <div class="pong-foot">幸运游戏当日奖励 ×2 · 胜利有概率掉落限定摆件 · 战绩按联系人桌面分开记</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 信箱页（桌面点「信箱」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-mail" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="mail-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">信箱</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fav-tabs">
        <button class="fav-tab sel" data-mtab="in">收到的信</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-mtab="out">寄出的信</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-mtab="write">写封信</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-mtab="data">信件数据</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="in">
          <div id="mail-in-list"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="out" hidden>
          <div id="mail-out-list"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="write" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">写信</div>
          <div class="mail-write-hint">点击下方按钮进入写信页面</div>
          <button class="ta-add-btn" style="width:100%;margin-top:10px" id="mail-open-write">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:15px;height:15px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:4px"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>提笔写信
          </button>
        </div>
        <!-- 信件数据（第4个 tab：数据管理） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" data-mpanel="data" hidden>
          <div class="cal-card-title">信件数据</div>
          <div class="mail-data-actions">
            <button class="cc-tool" id="mail-export"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:3px"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 15V3"/></svg>导出信件数据</button>
            <button class="cc-tool" id="mail-import"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:3px"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><path d="M17 8l-5-5-5 5"/><path d="M12 3v12"/></svg>导入信件数据</button>
            <button class="cc-tool" id="mail-rescue-data"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:3px"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-3-6.7"/><path d="M21 3v6h-6"/></svg>从本地库找回信件</button>
            <button class="cc-tool cc-tool-danger" id="mail-clear"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:3px"><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2"/><path d="M19 6l-1 14a2 2 0 01-2 2H8a2 2 0 01-2-2L5 6"/><path d="M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg>清空所有信件</button>
          </div>
          <div class="mail-write-hint">信没显示全时点「从本地库找回信件」：直接读本机存储（IndexedDB）里的那一份，与屏上逐封合并后重画；只合并不覆盖、不删除，读不出来会如实告诉你。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 写信页（独立全屏页） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-mail-write" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="mail-write-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">写信 · 给 <b id="mail-write-to">TA</b></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <div class="mail-compose">
          <div class="mail-toolbar">
            <button class="mail-tb mail-tb-sticker" title="表情包"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><path d="M9 9.5l.01.01M15 9.5l.01.01"/></svg></button>
            <button class="mail-tb mail-tb-image" title="插入图片"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg></button>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0" id="mail-write-img-hint">选不了多张或点了没反应，是浏览器 / 所在 App 的限制：换 Chrome / Edge 再试（详见 使用说明第 13 节）</div>
          <div class="mail-paper">
            <div class="mail-paper-head"><span class="mail-paper-author">我</span><span class="mail-paper-date">正在写…</span></div>
            <textarea id="mail-input" class="mail-compose-input" rows="12" placeholder="亲爱的，&#10;&#10;今天想跟你说..."></textarea>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.19.x：寄出按钮从滚动区移到固定底部栏，键盘弹起/页面收缩时不再被顶出视口而消失 -->
      <div class="mail-send-bar">
        <button class="ta-add-btn" id="mail-send">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:15px;height:15px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:4px"><path d="M22 2L11 13"/><path d="M22 2L15 22 11 13 2 9l20-7z"/></svg>封 · 寄出
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 回信页（独立全屏页，保留原信上下文） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-mail-reply" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="mail-reply-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">回信 · 给 <b id="mail-reply-to">TA</b></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <div id="mail-reply-original"></div>
        <div class="mail-compose" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="mail-toolbar">
            <button class="mail-tb mail-tb-sticker" title="表情包"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><path d="M9 9.5l.01.01M15 9.5l.01.01"/></svg></button>
            <button class="mail-tb mail-tb-image" title="插入图片"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg></button>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0" id="mail-reply-img-hint">选不了多张或点了没反应，是浏览器 / 所在 App 的限制：换 Chrome / Edge 再试（详见 使用说明第 13 节）</div>
          <div class="mail-paper">
            <div class="mail-paper-head"><span class="mail-paper-author">我的回信</span><span class="mail-paper-date">正在写…</span></div>
            <textarea id="mail-reply-input" class="mail-compose-input" rows="10" placeholder="亲爱的，&#10;&#10;今天想跟你说..."></textarea>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.19.x：寄出按钮移到固定底部栏，避免键盘弹起时从滚动区消失（红米 K70 QQ 反馈） -->
      <div class="mail-send-bar">
        <button class="ta-add-btn" id="mail-reply-send">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:15px;height:15px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:4px"><path d="M22 2L11 13"/><path d="M22 2L15 22 11 13 2 9l20-7z"/></svg>封 · 寄出
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 表情包面板（聊天页 + 写信/回信页共用；写信/回信时点击表情插入信纸） -->
    <div class="poke-card emoji-card" id="emoji-panel" hidden>
      <div class="emoji-head">
        <div class="emoji-tabs">
          <button class="emoji-tab" data-etab="public">公用表情包</button>
          <button class="emoji-tab sel" data-etab="ta">TA 的表情包</button>
          <button class="emoji-tab" data-etab="mine">我的表情包</button>
        </div>
        <button class="poke-card-close" id="emoji-close">✕</button>
      </div>
      <!-- 我的表情包工具行（管理分组 / 批量管理 / 添加 / 链接导入；新建分组已并入管理分组） -->
      <div class="emoji-tools" id="emoji-tools" hidden>
        <button class="emoji-tool" id="mye-manage">管理分组</button>
        <button class="emoji-tool" id="mye-batch">批量管理</button>
        <button class="emoji-tool" id="mye-add">添加</button>
        <button class="emoji-tool" id="mye-add-link">链接导入</button>
        <div style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);flex:1 0 100%;margin:2px 0 0" id="myemoji-add-hint">选不了多张或点了没反应，是浏览器 / 所在 App 的限制：换 Chrome / Edge 再试（详见 使用说明第 13 节）</div>
      </div>
      <!-- 顶部分组切换栏（全部 / 各分组） -->
      <div class="emoji-groups" id="emoji-groups"></div>
      <div class="poke-card-scroll" id="emoji-list">
        <!-- 分组/表情包由 JS 渲染 -->
      </div>
      <!-- 批量管理工具条（我的表情包模式） -->
      <div class="emoji-batch" id="emoji-batch" hidden>
        <span class="emoji-batch-count" id="emoji-batch-count">已选 0 张</span>
        <button class="emoji-batch-btn" id="emoji-batch-all">全选</button>
        <button class="emoji-batch-btn del" id="emoji-batch-del">删除</button>
        <button class="emoji-batch-btn" id="emoji-batch-exit">退出</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- v3.11.x：批量发送面板（聊天输入栏「批量发送」按钮打开）。可插入文字/表情包/图片，
         每个项目作为一条消息，按顺序批量发送到聊天框 -->
    <div class="poke-card batch-card" id="batch-panel" hidden>
      <div class="poke-card-head">
        <span>批量发送<span class="batch-count" id="batch-count">0 条</span></span>
        <span class="poke-card-head-actions">
          <button class="poke-card-close" id="batch-close" title="关闭">✕</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="batch-tools">
        <div class="poke-input-row">
          <input class="poke-input" id="batch-text" placeholder="输入文字，添加为一条消息…" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
          <button class="poke-input-go" id="batch-text-add">添加</button>
        </div>
        <div class="batch-btns">
          <button class="batch-tool" id="batch-emoji">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><path d="M9 9.5l.01.01M15 9.5l.01.01"/></svg>插入表情包
          </button>
          <button class="batch-tool" id="batch-img">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg>插入图片
          </button>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 2px 0" id="batch-upload-hint">选不了多张或点了没反应，是浏览器 / 所在 App 的限制：换 Chrome / Edge 再试（详见 使用说明第 13 节）</div>
      </div>
      <div class="poke-card-scroll batch-list" id="batch-list"></div>
      <div class="batch-foot">
        <button class="batch-clear" id="batch-clear">清空</button>
        <button class="poke-big" id="batch-send-all" style="flex:1;margin-top:0">发送全部</button>
      </div>
    </div>

      <!-- v3.16.x：语音录制半框（聊天输入栏「麦克风」按钮打开）。录音（最长 60 秒）→ 试听 →
           以既有语音消息格式「名称|||dataURL」(type=voice) 发送进聊天，复用原渲染/播放链路 -->
      <div class="poke-card voice-card" id="voice-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>录制语音<span class="voice-status" id="voice-status"></span></span>
          <span class="poke-card-head-actions">
            <button class="poke-card-close" id="voice-close" title="关闭">✕</button>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="voice-stage">
          <div class="voice-wave" id="voice-wave"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="voice-time" id="voice-time">00:00</div>
        </div>
        <div class="voice-preview" id="voice-preview" hidden>
          <button class="msg-voice-play voice-play-btn" id="voice-play-btn" title="试听">
            <!-- 播放/暂停双图标：playing 时 CSS 切换显示（试听播放中有互动态，与聊天语音气泡同款） -->
            <svg class="voice-ico-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
            <svg class="voice-ico-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 19h4V5H6v14zm8-14v14h4V5h-4z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <span class="voice-preview-txt" id="voice-preview-txt"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="voice-foot">
          <button class="voice-rec-btn" id="voice-record-btn">开始录音</button>
          <button class="voice-send-big" id="voice-send-btn" disabled>发送到聊天</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 动态页（朋友圈，桌面点「动态」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-feed" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="feed-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">朋友圈</span>
        <span class="feed-head-actions">
          <button class="ch-settings feed-head-btn" id="feed-friends-btn" title="朋友圈好友列表">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:18px;height:18px"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3 20a6 6 0 0112 0"/><path d="M16 4.5a3 3 0 010 6"/><path d="M17 14a5 5 0 014 6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="ch-settings feed-head-btn" id="feed-notice-btn" title="通知提醒">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:18px;height:18px"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 10-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 01-3.46 0"/></svg>
            <span class="feed-badge" id="feed-badge" hidden></span>
          </button>
          <button class="ch-settings feed-head-btn" id="feed-publish-btn" title="发布朋友圈">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:18px;height:18px"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="ch-settings feed-head-btn feed-head-clear" id="feed-head-clear" title="删除朋友圈动态">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:18px;height:18px"><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2"/><path d="M19 6l-1 14a2 2 0 01-2 2H8a2 2 0 01-2-2L5 6"/><path d="M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg>
          </button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <!-- 通知提醒面板（TA 点赞/评论/发布动态的提醒，点击跳转对应动态） -->
      <div class="feed-notice-panel" id="feed-notice-panel" hidden>
        <div class="feed-notice-head">
          <span>通知提醒</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feed-notice-list" id="feed-notice-list"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <!-- 封面 + 我的头像（可设置背景） -->
        <div class="feed-cover" id="feed-cover">
          <div class="feed-cover-av" id="feed-my-av"></div>
          <div class="feed-cover-name" id="feed-my-name">我</div>
          <!-- FIX 2026-09-18 #755：原 #feed-cover-file 静态 input（hidden＝display:none，部分内核拒绝激活）
               已删除，改由 device.js 的 window.mochiFilePick 常驻 sr-only clip 提供 -->
        </div>
        <!-- 发布框（点顶部 + 图标才出现，v3.5.59） -->
        <div class="cal-card glass" id="feed-publish-card" hidden>
          <textarea id="feed-input" class="tc-input" rows="3" placeholder="分享这一刻的想法…"></textarea>
          <div class="feed-pick-row">
            <button class="feed-pick-img" id="feed-pick-img">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:5px"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5L5 21"/></svg>添加图片
            </button>
            <span class="feed-preview" id="feed-preview" hidden></span>
            <!-- FIX 2026-09-18 #755：原 #feed-pick-file 静态 input（hidden）已删除，改走统一入口 -->
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0" id="feed-pick-hint-note">选不了多张或点了没反应，是浏览器 / 所在 App 的限制：换 Chrome / Edge 再试（详见 使用说明第 13 节）</div>
          <button class="ta-add-btn" style="width:100%;margin-top:10px" id="feed-publish">发布</button>
        </div>
        <div id="feed-list"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- 评论表情/图片面板（紧贴评论条上方） -->
      <div class="feed-comment-panel" id="feed-comment-panel" hidden></div>
      <!-- 页面内评论条（点【评论】直接出现，不用独立弹窗） -->
      <div class="feed-comment-bar" id="feed-comment-bar" hidden>
        <div class="feed-comment-pv" id="feed-comment-pv" hidden></div>
        <div class="feed-comment-row">
          <button class="feed-comment-ico" id="feed-comment-sticker" title="表情包">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><path d="M9 9.5l.01.01M15 9.5l.01.01"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="feed-comment-ico" id="feed-comment-img" title="图片">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg>
          </button>
          <textarea class="feed-comment-input" id="feed-comment-input" placeholder="评论…" rows="1"></textarea>
          <button class="feed-comment-send" id="feed-comment-send">发送</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 全部朋友圈（点动态头像进入：我的全部朋友圈 / 联系人的全部朋友圈） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-feed-all" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="feed-all-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name" id="feed-all-title">朋友圈</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <!-- 全部朋友圈封面：背景/头像/昵称可点击修改 -->
        <div class="feed-cover" id="feed-all-cover">
          <div class="feed-cover-av" id="feed-all-av"></div>
          <div class="feed-cover-name" id="feed-all-name"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="feed-all-list"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 朋友圈好友列表（v3.8.x：每行显示桌面昵称/桌面头像，可独立设置该人的朋友圈昵称/头像） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-feed-friends" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="feed-friends-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">朋友圈好友列表</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <div class="ff-help">在这里设置每个人在朋友圈里展示的头像与昵称，不影响桌面和聊天里的头像昵称。未设置时默认沿用<b>桌面</b>的昵称 / 头像（不是聊天里的）。</div>
        <div id="feed-friends-list"></div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- 纪念页（桌面点「纪念」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-memory" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="mem-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">纪念</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mem-scroll">
        <!-- 主纪念日（影响桌面相伴时间/日期；可设爱情/亲情/友情向 + 关系称呼） -->
        <div class="mem-card glass">
          <div class="mem-card-label" id="mem-love-label">恋爱纪念日</div>
          <!-- 关系类型：爱情向 / 亲情向 / 友情向 -->
          <div class="mem-type-row" id="rel-type-row">
            <button type="button" class="mem-type-pill" data-rel="love">爱情向</button>
            <button type="button" class="mem-type-pill" data-rel="family">亲情向</button>
            <button type="button" class="mem-type-pill" data-rel="friend">友情向</button>
          </div>
          <input type="text" id="rel-role-input" class="mem-add-input" placeholder="关系称呼（选填）如：姐姐 / 女儿 / 妈妈 / 朋友" maxlength="12">
          <div class="mem-date-wrap">
            <button type="button" class="mem-date-btn" id="love-date-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog">
              <span class="mem-date-btn-ico" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="mem-date-btn-txt" id="love-date-btn-txt">点击设置日期</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="mem-days"><b id="mem-love-days">—</b> 天</div>
          <div class="mem-date-txt" id="mem-love-date"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- 下一个纪念日倒计时 -->
        <div class="mem-card glass">
          <div class="mem-card-label">下一个纪念日</div>
          <div class="mem-next" id="mem-next"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- 其他纪念日（可自由添加：纪念日 / 倒数日） -->
        <div class="mem-card glass">
          <div class="mem-card-label">其他纪念日</div>
          <div class="mem-tip glass" style="margin-bottom:10px">点击「添加」在日历上选日期：未来日期自动按倒数日显示，过去日期按纪念日显示</div>
          <div id="mem-extra-list">
            <!-- 自定义纪念日由 JS 渲染 -->
          </div>
          <button class="mem-add" id="mem-add">+ 添加纪念日</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 收藏页（桌面点「收藏」进入） -->
    <!-- v61：开屏界面（循环视频 / 图片 / 音乐 + 搭配 + 进度条，完成不跳桌面） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-opening" hidden>
      <div class="op-stage" id="op-stage">
        <div class="op-bgimg" id="op-bgimg"></div>
        <video class="op-media op-video" id="op-video" playsinline loop muted preload="auto"></video>
        <img class="op-media op-image" id="op-image" alt="">
        <div class="op-fallback" id="op-fallback"><div class="op-fb-in"><b>开屏</b><span>在「搭配」里添加视频或图片与音乐</span></div></div>
        <div class="op-shade"></div>
        <div class="op-top">
          <button id="op-back" title="返回桌面"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>桌面</button>
          <div class="op-tt">开屏</div>
          <button id="op-cfg" title="搭配设置"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="2" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="15" cy="12" r="2" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="8" cy="17" r="2" fill="currentColor"/></svg>搭配</button>
        </div>
        <div class="op-now" id="op-now">
          <span class="op-now-k" id="op-now-k">视频 ＋ 音乐</span>
          <span class="op-now-v" id="op-now-v">—</span>
          <span class="op-now-m" id="op-now-m">—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="op-tap-hint" id="op-tap-hint" hidden>点一下开始播放</div>
        <div class="op-enter-hint" id="op-enter-hint"><b>双击画面进入</b>轻点播放音乐 · 双击进入我们的世界<small>媒体每次随机搭配 · 点右上角「搭配」可自定义</small></div>
        <div class="op-ctrls">
          <div class="op-seg" id="op-mode-seg"><button data-mode="random">随机</button><button data-mode="order">顺序</button></div>
          <div class="op-seg" id="op-pair-seg"><button data-pair="video">视频＋音乐</button><button data-pair="image">图片＋音乐</button></div>
          <button class="op-act" id="op-replay">重新连接</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="op-load" id="op-load">
        <div class="op-tap-tip" id="op-tap-tip">齊陳家</div>
        <div class="op-load-top"><span class="op-load-label" id="op-load-label">正在链接…</span><span class="op-load-num" id="op-load-pct">0%</span></div>
        <div class="op-load-track"><i id="op-load-bar"></i></div>
      </div>
      <div class="op-panel" id="op-panel" hidden>
        <div class="op-panel-hd"><button id="op-panel-close" class="op-panel-back" aria-label="返回"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><b>开屏搭配</b><span class="op-panel-sp"></span></div>
        <div class="op-panel-scroll">
          <div class="op-tip">一次只会搭配「视频＋音乐」或「图片＋音乐」，视频和图片不会同时出现。三个分区标题都可以长按改名，媒体名称也能长按改；每一区右上角的「排序」里可以置顶 / 置底。</div>
          <div class="op-pseg">
            <div class="op-seg op-seg-mode"><button data-mode="random">随机</button><button data-mode="order">顺序</button></div>
            <div class="op-seg op-seg-pair"><button data-pair="video">视频＋音乐</button><button data-pair="image">图片＋音乐</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="op-zones" id="op-zones"></div>
          <div class="op-next">
            <div class="op-sec-t">下一次进页面的搭配</div>
            <div class="op-next-row"><label>画面</label><select id="op-next-visual"></select></div>
            <div class="op-next-row"><label>音乐</label><select id="op-next-music"></select></div>
            <div class="op-next-btns"><button id="op-next-save">保存为下一次</button><button id="op-next-clear">清除预设</button></div>
            <div class="op-next-tip" id="op-next-tip">未预设，进页面时按当前播放模式自动搭配。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="op-sec">
            <div class="op-sec-t">其他</div>
            <div class="op-next-tip">每次打开或刷新链接都会先显示开屏，轻点画面播放音乐、双击画面进入网站；桌面「开屏」图标可随时再次打开。</div>
            <label class="op-sw"><input type="checkbox" id="op-vsound"> 播放视频原声（关闭时只放音乐）</label>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page" id="page-fav" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="fav-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">收藏</span>
        <span class="ch-settings" id="fav-manage-btn" title="批量管理">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 5-5.5"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-settings" id="fav-settings-btn" title="收藏设置">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.7"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.7"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.7"/></svg>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="fav-tabs" id="fav-tabs">
        <button class="fav-tab sel" data-tab="mine" id="fav-tab-mine">我的收藏</button>
        <button class="fav-tab" data-tab="ta" id="fav-tab-ta">联系人的收藏</button>
        <button class="fav-sort-btn" id="fav-sort-btn" type="button" title="切换收藏排序">新在前</button>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-body fav-body" id="fav-list">
        <!-- 收藏的消息由 JS 渲染 -->
      </div>
      <!-- v3.31.x 批量管理：底部操作栏（点顶栏勾选图标进入，勾选后可批量删除） -->
      <div class="fav-batch-bar" id="fav-batch-bar" hidden>
        <button class="fb-btn" id="fav-batch-cancel">取消</button>
        <button class="fb-btn" id="fav-batch-all">全选</button>
        <button class="fb-btn fb-del" id="fav-batch-del" disabled>删除</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 收藏设置页（收藏夹右上角进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-fav-settings" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="fav-settings-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">收藏设置</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-scroll">
        <div class="gs-title">收藏统计</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="fs-stat-box" id="fav-stats-body"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="gs-title">联系人自动收藏概率</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="gs-row"><span>收藏聊天消息</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ta-msg" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fav-ta-msg-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          <div class="gs-row"><span>收藏互动卡片</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ta-card" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fav-ta-card-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          <div class="gs-row"><span>收藏我的回信</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ta-mail" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fav-ta-mail-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
          <div class="gs-row"><span>收藏朋友圈动态</span><div class="stepper" data-k="ta-feed" data-min="0" data-max="100" data-step="5"><button class="stp-min">−</button><input class="stp-val" id="fav-ta-feed-val" readonly><button class="stp-max">+</button></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="fs-tip">联系人在你发送内容后按概率自动收藏到「联系人的收藏」。概率 0% 表示永不收藏，100% 表示每次都收藏。</div>
        <div class="gs-title">聊天内标记</div>
        <div class="set-group glass">
          <div class="gs-row"><span>显示【已收藏】标记</span><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="fav-tag-show" checked><span class="tk"></span></label></div>
        </div>
        <div class="fs-tip">联系人收藏过的消息，会在聊天里原消息上标一个【已收藏】，点它能看对方为什么收藏。关掉后聊天里不再显示这个标记，收藏夹里的内容不受影响。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 聊天页（从桌面点「聊天」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-chat" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="chat-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-av" id="chat-partner-av" title="点击查看 TA 的日常"></span>
        <span class="ch-name" id="chat-partner-name" title="点击让对方继续说">TA</span>
        <!-- v45：深色模式开关（从 设置→通用 移来），开=深色、关=浅色 -->
        <span class="ch-theme" id="chat-theme-btn" role="switch" aria-checked="false" title="深色模式（关）">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1111.21 3 7 7 0 0021 12.79z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-settings" id="chat-settings-btn" title="聊天设置">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.7"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.7"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.7"/></svg>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-body" id="chat-body">
        <!-- 聊天记录由 JS 从本地恢复 -->
      </div>
      <!-- v3.26.x：聊天记录加载进度提示——切桌面后打开聊天，IDB 异步读库期间消息区为空，
           这里在消息区中央覆盖非阻塞进度条（pointer-events:none，不挡滚动/点击），
           chat.js 读库完成后自动隐藏 -->
      <div class="chat-loading" id="chat-loading" hidden>
        <div class="chat-loading-card">
          <!-- FIX 2026-09-23 #1057：三行幽灵气泡占位（左右错落＋呼吸动画）＋进度条＋文案，
               把「读库中的空白」画成一个有意的加载态；实际显隐与遮罩见 chat.js 的 setChatLoadingUI -->
          <div class="chat-loading-ghost" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="chat-loading-bar"><i></i></div>
          <span class="chat-loading-txt">正在加载聊天记录…</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 联系人正在输入：消息区与输入栏之间的内嵌占位行（v3.6.x 由悬浮改回——
           悬浮式固定在输入栏上方，消息滚动时被灰色小字盖住（用户反馈"灰色一行遮挡消息"）；
           内嵌占位后随消息区滚动、不遮挡，chat.js 在占位时保持最后消息可见） -->
      <div class="chat-typing" id="chat-typing" hidden>对方正在输入…</div>
      <div class="chat-draft" id="chat-draft" hidden>
        <!-- 引用预览条（v3.7.x：点消息操作「引用」后显示在输入栏上方，含引用内容 + ✕ 删除） -->
        <div class="chat-draft-quote" id="chat-draft-quote" hidden></div>
        <div class="chat-draft-items" id="chat-draft-items"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- 聊天消息多选（长按气泡 → 菜单「多选」进入）→ 勾选多条后批量收藏。
           与收藏页的 fav-batch-bar 同构：底部固定操作栏，勾选气泡由 chat.js 标 .msg-picked -->
      <div class="fav-batch-bar" id="chat-multisel-bar" hidden>
        <button class="fb-btn" id="chat-multisel-cancel">取消</button>
        <button class="fb-btn" id="chat-multisel-all">全选</button>
        <button class="fb-btn fb-primary" id="chat-multisel-fav" disabled>收藏</button>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.27.x #660：输入栏这一排按钮的左右顺序可在 聊天设置 → 功能 →「输入栏按钮」自定义。
           每项挂 data-io 令牌（mic/continue/more/emoji/input/img/batch），chat.js 按
           cs-input-order 给它们设 flex order——不动 DOM 结构，故切换顺序不影响任何按 id
           的绑定与 #page-chat > .chat-input-row 直系选择器。令牌同时也是排序列的稳定标识。
           「发送」是固定收尾的动作按钮，不参与排序，恒在最后（chat.js 给它 order 999）。 -->
      <div class="chat-input-row">
        <!-- v3.16.x：语音消息「麦克风」按钮（聊天设置「我可发送语音」开启后显示；点击打开录音半框） -->
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="chat-mic-btn" data-io="mic" title="录制语音" style="display:none">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0014 0M12 18v3"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="chat-continue-btn" data-io="continue" title="让对方继续说" style="display:none">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 01-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 01-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 01-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 01-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 014.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 013.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 018 8v.5z"/><path d="M9 11h6M9 14h4"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="chat-more-btn" data-io="more" title="更多功能">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.6"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="chat-emoji-btn" data-io="emoji" title="表情包">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><path d="M9 9.5l.01.01M15 9.5l.01.01"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="chat-input" id="chat-input" data-io="input" contenteditable="true" data-ph="说点什么…" spellcheck="false" role="textbox" aria-label="说点什么…"></div>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="chat-img-btn" data-io="img" title="插入图片">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <!-- v3.11.x：批量发送按钮（聊天设置「批量发送消息」开启后显示；默认关闭需手动开启） -->
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="chat-batch-btn" data-io="batch" title="批量发送" style="display:none">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13"/><path d="M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="chat-send" id="chat-send">发送</button>
      </div>
      <!-- 搜索聊天记录：聊天页底部半框（v3.5.53 露出聊天消息，星言式），可返回聊天/跳转最新 -->
      <div class="poke-card chat-search" id="chat-search" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>搜索聊天记录</span>
          <span class="poke-card-head-actions">
            <button class="chat-search-new" id="chat-search-new" title="跳转最新消息">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M12 4v16M6 14l6 6 6-6"/></svg>最新
            </button>
            <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-search-close">✕</button>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-search-bar">
          <input class="chat-search-input" id="chat-search-input" placeholder="输入关键词搜索聊天记录…" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
          <button class="chat-search-go" id="chat-search-go">搜索</button>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-search-date">
          <input type="date" class="chat-search-date-input" id="chat-search-date-from" title="开始日期">
          <span class="chat-search-date-sep">至</span>
          <input type="date" class="chat-search-date-input" id="chat-search-date-to" title="结束日期">
          <button class="chat-search-date-clear" id="chat-search-date-clear" title="清除日期">清除</button>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll chat-search-results" id="chat-search-results"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- 占卜：聊天页底部半框（v3.5.53 露出聊天消息） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-divine-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>占卜</span>
          <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-divine-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll" id="chat-divine-body">
          <div class="div-modes-wrap">
            <span class="div-mode sel" data-chatmode="tarot">塔罗</span>
            <span class="div-mode" data-chatmode="lenormand">雷诺曼</span>
          </div>
          <div class="div-counts-wrap">
            <span class="div-mode sel" data-chatcount="3">3 张</span>
            <span class="div-mode" data-chatcount="1">1 张</span>
            <span class="div-mode" data-chatcount="7">7 张</span>
          </div>
          <!-- v3.26.x：占卜对象（聊天页半框，可选全部桌面联系人，也可不选；选了对象结果存入该联系人主页「占卜记录」） -->
          <div class="div-modes-wrap div-chat-targets" id="div-chat-targets"></div>
          <div class="dec-inp-wrap"><input type="text" class="tc-input" id="div-chat-question" placeholder="心中默念的问题（可选）" style="margin:8px 0" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false"><button class="dec-inp-clear" data-clear="div-chat-question" aria-label="清空" title="清空">✕</button></div>
          <label class="div-switch-row div-chat-switch">
            <span class="div-switch-t">自动发送到聊天</span>
            <span class="div-switch"><input type="checkbox" id="div-chat-auto-send"><span class="div-switch-knob"></span></span>
          </label>
          <button class="div-draw" id="div-chat-draw">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg>
            抽牌
          </button>
          <div id="div-chat-result"><div class="div-result-empty">点击上方按钮开始抽牌</div></div>
          <div class="div-chat-hist">
            <div class="div-chat-hist-bar">
              <span class="div-chat-hist-toggle" id="div-chat-hist-toggle">📜 占卜记录 ▾</span>
              <button class="div-chat-hist-clear" id="div-chat-hist-clear">清空记录</button>
            </div>
            <div class="div-chat-hist-list" id="div-chat-history" hidden></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 通话：聊天页底部半框（v3.7.x 露出聊天消息，可开关「通话小框」） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-call-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>通话 · <b id="call-panel-name">TA</b></span>
          <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-call-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="call-panel-status" id="call-panel-status">空闲 · 点击拨打语音通话</div>
          <!-- v3.12.x：通话半框内直接修改联系人头像（点头像行）与通话卡片背景图片 -->
          <div class="call-panel-row" id="call-av-edit-row" title="修改联系人头像">
            <span class="cpr-txt">联系人头像</span><span class="cpr-val" id="call-av-edit-val">点击更换</span>
          </div>
          <div class="call-panel-row" id="call-bg-edit-row" title="设置通话背景图片">
            <span class="cpr-txt">通话背景图片</span><span class="cpr-val" id="call-bg-edit-val"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="call-panel-row call-panel-row-danger" id="call-bg-edit-remove" hidden title="移除通话背景图片">
            <span class="cpr-txt">移除通话背景</span><span class="cpr-val">恢复默认</span>
          </div>
          <!-- #651：通话功能页内直接上传/移除「通话半框背景」（与设置页同键 call-half-bg，实时回显本半框）；#987 起作用于来电/去电的方形通话弹窗 -->
          <div class="call-panel-row" id="call-half-bg-edit-row" title="设置来电 / 去电那个方形通话弹窗的背景图片（没设过时弹窗显示通话背景；通话小框不受影响）">
            <span class="cpr-txt">通话半框背景图片</span><span class="cpr-val" id="call-half-bg-edit-val"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="call-panel-row call-panel-row-danger" id="call-half-bg-edit-remove" hidden title="移除来电 / 去电弹窗背景图片">
            <span class="cpr-txt">移除通话半框背景</span><span class="cpr-val">恢复默认</span>
          </div>
          <!-- #651：打开来电弹窗预览——联系人来电时的大弹窗（非迷你小框），纯查看不产生真实通话，点任意处退出；#987 起通话中点击＝展开真实通话面板 -->
          <div class="call-panel-row" id="call-view-row" title="打开联系人打给你 / 你打给联系人时的方形通话弹窗（非通话小框）；空闲时是预览，点任意处退出，通话中点击＝展开通话面板">
            <span class="cpr-txt">打开来电弹窗</span><span class="cpr-val">预览</span>
          </div>
          <button class="call-panel-dial" id="call-panel-dial" type="button">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
            拨打语音通话
          </button>
          <button class="call-panel-hang" id="call-panel-hang" type="button" hidden>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
            挂断通话
          </button>

        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 猜拳：聊天页底部半框（露出聊天消息，和联系人猜拳，联系人随机出拳） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-rps-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>猜拳 · <b id="rps-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <div class="snake-head-actions">
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="rps-fs" title="全屏">⛶</button>
            <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-rps-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="rps-score" id="rps-score">胜 0 · 负 0 · 平 0</div>
          <div class="rps-hint" id="rps-hint">选择你要出的拳</div>
          <div class="rps-choices">
            <button class="rps-choice" data-rps="rock" type="button">
              <span class="rps-c-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="currentColor" d="M200 80h-16V64a32 32 0 0 0-56-21.13a32 32 0 0 0-55.79 17.55A32 32 0 0 0 24 88v40a104 104 0 0 0 208 0v-16a32 32 0 0 0-32-32m-48-32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16h-32V64a16 16 0 0 1 16-16M88 64a16 16 0 0 1 32 0v40a16 16 0 0 1-32 0ZM40 88a16 16 0 0 1 32 0v16a16 16 0 0 1-32 0Zm176 40a88 88 0 0 1-175.92 3.75A31.93 31.93 0 0 0 80 125.13a31.93 31.93 0 0 0 44.58 3.35a32.2 32.2 0 0 0 11.8 11.44A47.88 47.88 0 0 0 120 176a8 8 0 0 0 16 0a32 32 0 0 1 32-32a8 8 0 0 0 0-16h-16a16 16 0 0 1-16-16V96h64a16 16 0 0 1 16 16Z"/></svg></span>
              <span>石头</span>
            </button>
            <button class="rps-choice" data-rps="scissors" type="button">
              <span class="rps-c-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="currentColor" d="M212.24 30A28 28 0 0 0 161 36.77l-13 48.32l-12.95-48.32A28 28 0 1 0 81 51.26l9.38 35l-8.73-1.68a28 28 0 0 0-24.85 47.8a27.86 27.86 0 0 0-8.8 20.49V160a80 80 0 0 0 80 80h.61c43.78-.33 79.39-36.62 79.39-80.9v-3.34a55.88 55.88 0 0 0-11.77-34.27L215 51.26A27.8 27.8 0 0 0 212.24 30M97.61 38a12 12 0 0 1 22 2.9l14.77 55.15a28 28 0 0 0-14 4.77a2 2 0 0 0-.16-.26A27.65 27.65 0 0 0 108 90.35L96.42 47.12A11.94 11.94 0 0 1 97.61 38m-33.36 71.6a12 12 0 0 1 14.25-9.34l20.71 4a12 12 0 0 1 9.36 14.16a12 12 0 0 1-14.25 9.34l-20.75-4a12 12 0 0 1-9.32-14.15Zm0 40.72a12 12 0 0 1 14-9.37l10.11 2a12 12 0 0 1 9.36 14.15a12 12 0 0 1-14.2 9.35l-10-2a12 12 0 0 1-9.34-14.16ZM192 159.1c0 35.53-28.49 64.64-63.5 64.9a64.08 64.08 0 0 1-61.56-44.78a31 31 0 0 0 3.48.95l10 2a28.3 28.3 0 0 0 5.61.57a28 28 0 0 0 24.16-42.14c.79-.43 1.57-.89 2.32-1.4l.16.26a27.82 27.82 0 0 0 17.78 12l6.32 1.26a36 36 0 0 0 9.53 32.49A8 8 0 0 0 157.71 174a20 20 0 0 1-3.31-23.51a8 8 0 0 0-5.46-11.66l-15.34-3.07a12 12 0 0 1-9.35-14.15a12 12 0 0 1 14.18-9.35l21.41 4.28A40.1 40.1 0 0 1 192 155.76Zm7.59-112l-16.62 62a55.6 55.6 0 0 0-20-8.28l-2.5-.5l15.93-59.41a12 12 0 1 1 23.18 6.21Z"/></svg></span>
              <span>剪刀</span>
            </button>
            <button class="rps-choice" data-rps="paper" type="button">
              <span class="rps-c-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="currentColor" d="M188 88a27.75 27.75 0 0 0-12 2.71V60a28 28 0 0 0-41.36-24.6A28 28 0 0 0 80 44v6.71A27.75 27.75 0 0 0 68 48a28 28 0 0 0-28 28v76a88 88 0 0 0 176 0v-36a28 28 0 0 0-28-28m12 64a72 72 0 0 1-144 0V76a12 12 0 0 1 24 0v44a8 8 0 0 0 16 0V44a12 12 0 0 1 24 0v68a8 8 0 0 0 16 0V60a12 12 0 0 1 24 0v68.67A48.08 48.08 0 0 0 120 176a8 8 0 0 0 16 0a32 32 0 0 1 32-32a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-20a12 12 0 0 1 24 0Z"/></svg></span>
              <span>布</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 双人贪吃蛇：聊天页底部半框（我 vs TA，滑动/方向键控制，TA 带行为池 AI） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-snake-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>贪吃蛇 · <b id="snake-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <div class="snake-head-actions">
            <select class="snake-diff" id="snake-mode" title="模式：经典对战 / 双人同屏对战 / 双人组队 vs TA">
              <option value="duo" selected>我 vs TA</option>
              <option value="pvp">双人对战</option>
              <option value="coop">双人组队</option>
            </select>
            <select class="snake-diff" id="snake-food" title="同屏食物数量">
              <option value="2" selected>🍎×2</option>
              <option value="4">🍎×4</option>
              <option value="6">🍎×6</option>
              <option value="8">🍎×8</option>
            </select>
            <select class="snake-diff" id="snake-diff">
              <option value="easy">慢</option>
              <option value="normal" selected>普通</option>
              <option value="hard">快</option>
            </select>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn snake-toggle" id="snake-wall" title="穿墙：撞墙从对面出来">墙</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn snake-toggle" id="snake-safe" title="安全：碰自己身不死">安</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="snake-pause" title="暂停/继续">⏸</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="snake-fs" title="全屏">⛶</button>
            <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-snake-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="snake-score" id="snake-score">胜 0 · 负 0 · 平 0</div>
          <div class="snake-best" id="snake-best" hidden></div>
          <canvas class="snake-canvas" id="snake-canvas" width="300" height="300"></canvas>
          <div class="snake-hint" id="snake-hint">点开始 · 滑动控制方向</div>
          <div class="snake-result" id="snake-result" hidden></div>
          <div class="snake-controls">
            <button class="snake-btn" id="snake-start" type="button">开始</button>
            <button class="snake-btn" id="snake-restart" type="button" hidden>再来一局</button>
            <button class="snake-btn" id="snake-resume" type="button" hidden>继续上局</button>
          </div>
          <div class="snake-dpad" id="snake-dpad">
            <button class="snake-dp" data-dir="up" type="button">▲</button>
            <button class="snake-dp" data-dir="left" type="button">◀</button>
            <button class="snake-dp" data-dir="down" type="button">▼</button>
            <button class="snake-dp" data-dir="right" type="button">▶</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 双人 Pong 小游戏：聊天页底部半框（玩家左挡板 / TA 右挡板 AI） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-pong-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>Pong · <b id="pong-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <button class="poke-card-close" id="pong-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="pong-wrap">
            <div class="pong-bar">
              <div class="pong-bar-left">
                <select class="pong-diff" id="pong-diff">
                  <option value="casual" selected>休闲</option>
                  <option value="easy">简单</option>
                  <option value="normal">普通</option>
                  <option value="hard">困难</option>
                </select>
                <span id="pong-win-tip">先得 3 分获胜</span>
              </div>
              <div class="pong-bar-right">
                <button class="pong-icon-btn" id="pong-pause" title="暂停/继续">⏸</button>
                <button class="pong-icon-btn" id="pong-fs" title="全屏">⛶</button>
                <button class="pong-sound" id="pong-sound" title="音效开关">🔊</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pong-score" id="pong-score"><span class="pong-s-ta">0 TA</span><span class="pong-s-sep">:</span><span class="pong-s-you">你 0</span></div>
            <div class="pong-canvas-box">
              <canvas id="pong-canvas" width="400" height="240"></canvas>
              <div class="pong-hint" id="pong-hint"></div>
              <div class="pong-overlay" id="pong-overlay">
                <div class="pong-overlay-title" id="pong-overlay-title">双人 Pong</div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-body" id="pong-overlay-body"></div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-btns">
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="pong-overlay-btn" type="button">开始</button>
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="pong-overlay-btn2" type="button" hidden>继续上局</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pong-foot">你控制右侧挡板 · 手机：按住画面上下拖动 · 电脑：↑↓ 或 W S</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 双人打砖块：聊天页底部半框（合作清砖：玩家右挡板 / 梦角左挡板由代码控制，球数 1~3 可设） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-brick-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>双人打砖块 · <b id="brick-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <div class="snake-head-actions">
            <select class="snake-diff" id="brick-diff">
              <option value="easy" selected>轻松</option>
              <option value="normal">普通</option>
              <option value="hard">困难</option>
            </select>
            <select class="snake-diff" id="brick-balls" title="球数量（随时调整）">
              <option value="1" selected>1 球</option>
              <option value="2">2 球</option>
              <option value="3">3 球</option>
            </select>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="brick-pause" title="暂停/继续">⏸</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="brick-sound" title="音效开关">🔊</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="brick-fs" title="全屏">⛶</button>
            <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-brick-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="brick-wrap">
            <div class="brick-info">
              <span>得分 <b id="brick-score">0</b></span>
              <span class="brick-combo" id="brick-combo"></span>
              <span class="brick-lives" id="brick-lives"></span>
              <span>第 <b id="brick-level">1</b> 层</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pong-canvas-box">
              <canvas id="brick-canvas" width="400" height="340"></canvas>
              <div class="pong-hint" id="brick-hint"></div>
              <div class="pong-overlay" id="brick-overlay">
                <div class="pong-overlay-title" id="brick-overlay-title">双人打砖块</div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-body" id="brick-overlay-body"></div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-btns">
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="brick-overlay-btn" type="button">开始</button>
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="brick-overlay-close" type="button" hidden>返回小游戏</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pong-foot">你控制右挡板 · <span id="brick-foot-name">TA</span> 控制左挡板 · 按住拖动</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 双人钓鱼：聊天页底部半框（你与 TA 各一根鱼竿，时机收竿 → 今日收获 → 出售心意币 + 图鉴 + TA送礼+陪伴奖励） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-fish-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>钓鱼 · <b id="fish-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <div class="snake-head-actions">
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="fish-sound" title="音效开关">🔊</button>
                        <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="fish-fs" title="全屏">⛶</button>
<button class="poke-card-close fish-close" id="fish-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="fish-wrap">
            <div class="fish-scene" id="fish-scene" data-mine="idle" data-ta="idle">
              <div class="fish-sky"></div>
              <div class="fish-persons">
                <div class="fish-person fish-me">
                  <div class="fish-rod"></div>
                  <span class="fish-person-name">你</span>
                </div>
                <div class="fish-person fish-ta">
                  <span class="fish-ta-state" id="fish-ta-state">待着</span>
                  <div class="fish-rod"></div>
                  <span class="fish-person-name">TA</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="fish-water"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="fish-status" id="fish-status"></div>
            <div class="fish-timing-wrap" id="fish-timing-wrap" hidden>
              <div class="fish-timing-label">鱼漂变蓝晃动了 · 光标进蓝区收竿最佳</div>
              <div class="fish-timing-bar" id="fish-timing-bar"><span class="fish-timing-good"></span><span class="fish-timing-cursor" id="fish-timing-cursor"></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="fish-actions">
              <button class="fish-btn" id="fish-cast" type="button">抛竿</button>
              <button class="fish-btn fish-reel" id="fish-reel" type="button" hidden>收竿</button>
            </div>
            <div class="fish-tabs">
              <button class="fish-tab sel" data-ftab="today" type="button">今日收获</button>
              <button class="fish-tab" data-ftab="dex" type="button">鱼图鉴</button>
              <button class="fish-tab" data-ftab="gifts" type="button">TA送我的</button>
            </div>
            <div class="fish-page" id="fish-page"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 四子棋：聊天页底部半框（经典 7×6 落子棋盘，梦角由代码控制、每回合行为状态随机） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-c4-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>四子棋 · <b id="c4-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <div class="snake-head-actions">
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="c4-sound" title="音效开关">🔊</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="c4-fs" title="全屏">⛶</button>            <button class="poke-card-close" id="c4-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="c4-wrap">
            <div class="c4-players">
              <span class="c4-side">🔵 你</span>
              <span class="c4-vs">VS</span>
              <span class="c4-side">🟡 <span id="c4-side-name">TA</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="c4-stage" id="c4-stage">
              <div class="c4-board" id="c4-board"></div>
              <div class="pong-overlay c4-overlay" id="c4-overlay" hidden>
                <div class="pong-overlay-title" id="c4-ov-title">四子棋</div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-body" id="c4-ov-body"></div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-btns">
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="c4-btn-start" type="button">开始对局</button>
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="c4-btn-end" type="button" hidden>结束游戏</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="c4-status" id="c4-status">点击「开始对局」</div>
            <div class="pong-foot">轮流落子 · 先连成四子的一方获胜 · TA今天的状态是随机的</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 合作扫雷：聊天页底部半框（和 TA 轮流探索一张雷区，共用 ❤️❤️❤️，踩雷不即死） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-ms-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>合作扫雷 · <b id="ms-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <div class="snake-head-actions">
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="ms-mode" title="插旗模式开关">⛏️</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="ms-bag" title="小收藏">🎒</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="ms-sound" title="音效开关">🔊</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="ms-fs" title="全屏">⛶</button>            <button class="poke-card-close" id="ms-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="ms-wrap">
            <div class="ms-topbar"><span class="ms-hearts" id="ms-lives"></span><span class="ms-prog" id="ms-prog"></span></div>
            <div class="ms-stage" id="ms-stage">
              <div class="ms-board" id="ms-board"></div>
              <div class="pong-overlay ms-overlay" id="ms-overlay" hidden>
                <div class="pong-overlay-title" id="ms-ov-title">合作扫雷</div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-body" id="ms-ov-body"></div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-btns">
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="ms-btn-start" type="button">开始探索</button>
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="ms-btn-end" type="button" hidden>结束游戏</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ms-talk" id="ms-talk" hidden><div class="ms-talk-bubble"></div></div>
            <div class="ms-status" id="ms-status">选择难度开始探索</div>
            <div class="ms-foot">点击挖开 · 长按插旗 · 数字=周围雷数 · 🪙🎁🌸 藏在格子里</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 记忆翻牌：聊天页底部半框（双人合作记忆配对，TA 由代码控制、按难度概率记牌） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-memory-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>记忆翻牌 · <b id="memory-partner-name">TA</b></span>
