      <!-- 心意币拍卖会：聊天页底部半框（和 TA 轮番举牌竞拍，落槌价真扣心意币，拍品收进🎒） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-auction-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>心意币拍卖会 · <b id="au-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <div class="snake-head-actions">
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="au-help-btn" title="怎么玩（玩法说明）">❓</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="au-bag" title="拍品收藏">🎒</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="au-sound" title="音效开关">🔊</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="au-history" title="拍卖记录">📜</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="au-add" title="自制拍品">➕</button>
            <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="au-fs" title="全屏">⛶</button>            <button class="poke-card-close" id="au-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="au-wrap">
            <div class="au-topbar"><span id="au-lot">每场 3 件拍品</span><span class="au-balance" id="au-balance">心意币 —</span></div>
            <div class="au-stage" id="au-stage">
              <div class="au-item" id="au-item"></div>
              <div class="pong-overlay au-overlay" id="au-overlay" hidden>
                <div class="pong-overlay-title" id="au-ov-title">心意币拍卖会</div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-body" id="au-ov-body"></div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-btns">
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="au-btn-start" type="button">开场拍卖</button>
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="au-btn-end" type="button" hidden>收摊</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="pong-overlay au-overlay" id="au-help" hidden>
                <div class="pong-overlay-title">怎么玩 · 拍卖会</div>
                <div class="au-help-body">
                  <b>①&nbsp;看拍品</b>：每件都有起拍价，先看它值多少。<br>
                  <b>②&nbsp;出价</b>：点一个“出 ¥X”档位＝在当前价上加一档，压上你的价（按钮会直接显示你要出的钱）。<br>
                  <b>③&nbsp;轮替</b>：你出价后 TA 会掂量掂量——跟价或放弃，轮到你时按钮才亮起。<br>
                  <b>④&nbsp;成交</b>：谁最后是最高价，这件就归谁。<br>
                  <b>·</b> 你是最高价 → 点<b>「落槌」</b>＝按现价买下（真扣心意币，收进 🎒）。<br>
                  <b>·</b> TA 最高价 → 点<b>「放弃这件」</b>＝这件归 TA，不扣你的钱。<br>
                  <b>·</b> 双方都不要 → <b>流拍</b>，收回仓库。<br>
                  <b>⑤&nbsp;彩蛋</b>：TA 拍走的拍品过几天会寄回给你。<br>
                  <b>⑥&nbsp;暗价</b>：TA 每件的心理价位是暗的（志在必得/常规/抠门/虚张声势），猜不准才好玩。<br>
                  <b>⑦&nbsp;自制拍品</b>：点顶部 ➕ 打开编辑台——选一枚 emoji 或上传一张商品图，填名称/起拍价（还能留一句拍下彩蛋、勾「神秘拍品」蒙面上拍），你们的小宝贝就进奖池；编辑台底部的库条点一下即可改，删除要先确认。
                </div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-btns">
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="au-help-close" type="button">知道啦</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="au-fs-overlay" id="au-intro" hidden>
                <div class="au-intro-title">💎 心意币拍卖会</div>
                <div class="au-intro-steps" id="au-intro-steps"></div>
                <div class="au-intro-stat" id="au-intro-stat"></div>
                <div class="pong-overlay-btns">
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="au-intro-start" type="button">开始拍卖</button>
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="au-intro-help" type="button">详细玩法</button>
                  <!-- #341 教学浮层是全屏的、盖住头部 ✕，没有这个出口用户想走只能先开局 -->
                  <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="au-intro-exit" type="button">先不玩</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- #1041 自制拍品全屏编辑台（方案 A，用户选定）：所见即所得预览卡＋emoji 自选＋商品图片＋
                   名称/介绍/底价/彩蛋＋蒙面开关；库条＝已有自制拍品点选即改。静态锚点在此、内容由 auction.js 渲染。 -->
              <div class="au-fs-overlay au-editor" id="au-editor" hidden>
                <div class="au-ed-card">
                  <div class="au-ed-head">
                    <div class="au-ed-title" id="au-ed-title">✏️ 自制拍品</div>
                    <button class="snake-icon-btn" id="au-ed-close" type="button" title="关闭">✕</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="au-ed-preview" id="au-ed-preview"></div>
                  <div class="au-ed-body">
                    <div class="au-ed-label">图标 · 选一个 emoji</div>
                    <div class="au-ed-grid" id="au-ed-grid"></div>
                    <div class="au-ed-label">商品图片（可选，盖过 emoji）</div>
                    <div class="au-ed-imgrow">
                      <div class="au-ed-imgprev" id="au-ed-imgprev">🖼️</div>
                      <button class="au-ed-imgbtn" id="au-ed-imgbtn" type="button">上传图片</button>
                      <button class="au-ed-imgbtn" id="au-ed-imgclear" type="button" hidden>移除</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="au-ed-label">名称与底价</div>
                    <input class="au-ed-inp" id="au-ed-name" maxlength="24" placeholder="名称（如：我们的灯笼）">
                    <div class="au-ed-row2">
                      <input class="au-ed-inp" id="au-ed-desc" maxlength="40" placeholder="一句话介绍（可选）">
                      <input class="au-ed-inp au-ed-price" id="au-ed-base" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="¥20">
                    </div>
                    <div class="au-ed-label">拍下后的一句话彩蛋（可空）</div>
                    <input class="au-ed-inp" id="au-ed-wish" maxlength="30" placeholder="例：第一盏留给你点">
                    <label class="au-ed-switch"><span>神秘拍品（🎁 蒙面登场，落槌才揭晓）</span><input type="checkbox" id="au-ed-mystery"><i></i></label>
                    <div class="au-ed-hint" id="au-ed-hint" hidden></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="au-ed-lib" id="au-ed-lib"></div>
                  <div class="au-ed-foot">
                    <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2 au-ed-del" id="au-ed-del" type="button" hidden>删除</button>
                    <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="au-ed-cancel" type="button">取消</button>
                    <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="au-ed-save" type="button">保存</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="au-bids">
              <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="au-bid1" type="button">出 ¥</button>
              <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="au-bid5" type="button">出 ¥</button>
              <button class="pong-overlay-btn" id="au-bid13" type="button">出 ¥</button>
              <button class="pong-overlay-btn pong-overlay-btn2" id="au-pass" type="button">放弃这件</button>
            </div>
            <!-- #346 余额不足/账本未就绪提示行：出价键静默置灰时告诉用户为什么 -->
            <div class="au-wallet-hint" id="au-wallet-hint" hidden></div>
            <div class="au-status" id="au-status">点击「开场拍卖」</div>
            <div class="pong-foot">落槌价从心意币里真扣 · TA 的心理价位是暗的 · 拍到的收进 🎒</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 游乐室：聊天页底部半框（小游戏战绩聚合 + 徽章 + 幸运游戏 + 限定摆件图鉴，#301） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-arcade-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>游乐室 · 和 <b id="arc-partner-name">TA</b> 的战绩</span>
          <div class="snake-head-actions">
            <button class="poke-card-close" id="arc-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="arc-wrap">
            <div id="arc-body"></div>
            <div class="pong-foot">幸运游戏当日奖励 ×2 · 胜利有概率掉落限定摆件 · 战绩按联系人桌面分开记</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 红包：聊天页底部半框（我和 TA 互发红包，情侣特殊金额 / 随机 / 七夕特别） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-rp-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>红包 · <b id="rp-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <div class="poke-card-head-actions">
            <button class="rp-head-set" id="rp-settings-btn" type="button">设置</button>
            <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-rp-close">✕</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.29.x：TA 自动发红包 / 自动申请心意币设置（原聊天设置页「红包」组移入红包半框，入口=头部「设置」按钮）。
             每联系人独立：发红包概率默认 4%（0-100%）、每日上限默认 5（0=不限）；申请概率默认 4%、申请上限默认 0=不限，
             申请两项（cs-rp-ask-prob / cs-rp-ask-daily-max）由 chat.js trySystemAskMochi 读，未单独设过时回退旧的存钱罐全局根键；
             chat.js trySystemAutoSend 读 cs-rp-auto-prob / cs-rp-daily-max -->
        <div class="rp-settings" id="rp-settings" hidden>
          <div class="rp-settings-title">TA 自动发红包</div>
          <div class="set-row" id="cs-rp-auto-prob">
            <div class="txt">TA 自动发红包概率<span class="sub">联系人有概率主动发个红包给你，每个联系人可单独设置</span></div>
            <div class="val" id="cs-rp-auto-prob-val">4%</div>
          </div>
          <div class="set-row" id="cs-rp-daily-max">
            <div class="txt">TA 每日发红包上限<span class="sub">联系人每天最多主动发红包的次数，填 0 表示不限制</span></div>
            <div class="val" id="cs-rp-daily-max-val">5 次</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rp-settings-title">TA 申请心意币</div>
          <div class="set-row" id="cs-rp-ask-prob">
            <div class="txt">TA 申请心意币概率<span class="sub">联系人有概率向 Mochi 申请一笔心意币（记进聊天申请记录），每个联系人可单独设置</span></div>
            <div class="val" id="cs-rp-ask-prob-val">4%</div>
          </div>
          <div class="set-row" id="cs-rp-ask-daily-max">
            <div class="txt">TA 每日申请上限<span class="sub">联系人每天最多申请心意币的次数，填 0 表示不限制</span></div>
            <div class="val" id="cs-rp-ask-daily-max-val">不限</div>
          </div>
          <button class="rp-send rp-settings-done" id="rp-settings-done" type="button">完成</button>
        </div>
        <div class="rp-balance" id="rp-balance"></div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="rp-cover-row">
            <div class="rp-cover-preview" id="rp-cover-preview"><span>未设置封面</span></div>
            <div class="rp-cover-actions">
              <button class="rp-cover-btn" id="rp-cover-upload" type="button">上传封面</button>
              <button class="rp-cover-btn" id="rp-cover-del" type="button" hidden>删除封面</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rp-side-row">
            <button class="rp-side sel" data-rpside="out" type="button">我发红包</button>
            <button class="rp-side" data-rpside="in" type="button">TA发红包</button>
          </div>
          <div class="rp-section" id="rp-qixi-section">
            <div class="rp-section-title">七夕特别红包<span class="rp-qixi-tag" id="rp-qixi-tag">今天七夕</span></div>
            <div class="rp-amounts">
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="7.77" type="button">¥7.77</button>
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="77.77" type="button">¥77.77</button>
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="777.77" type="button">¥777.77</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rp-section">
            <div class="rp-section-title">情侣特殊金额</div>
            <div class="rp-amounts">
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="5.20" type="button">¥5.20</button>
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="13.14" type="button">¥13.14</button>
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="52.00" type="button">¥52.00</button>
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="99.99" type="button">¥99.99</button>
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="131.40" type="button">¥131.40</button>
              <button class="rp-amt" data-rpamt="520.00" type="button">¥520.00</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rp-section">
            <div class="rp-section-title">随机幸运金额</div>
            <div class="rp-amounts">
              <button class="rp-amt rp-rand" data-rpamt="rand" type="button">摇一个随机金额</button>
            </div>
            <div class="rp-rand-val" id="rp-rand-val"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="rp-section">

            <div class="rp-section-title">自定义金额</div>
            <input class="rp-input" id="rp-custom" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="输入金额（心意币），0 为心意红包">
          </div>
          <div class="rp-section">
            <div class="rp-section-title">留言</div>
            <input class="rp-input" id="rp-wish" type="text" placeholder="心意" maxlength="20">
          </div>
          <button class="rp-send" id="rp-send-btn" type="button">发送红包</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 心意集市：聊天页底部半框（心意市集商品快速选择） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-gift-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>心意集市 · <b id="gift-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-gift-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="gift-balance" id="gift-balance"></div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll">
          <div class="gift-cats" id="gift-cats"></div>
          <div class="gift-grid" id="gift-grid"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 聊天页输入半框（邀请TA / 问问TA，露出聊天消息，星言式）
           v3.26.x：邀请TA 模式内置「我的邀请」字卡库（仿我的拍一拍：分组 + 字卡 + 存入/发送），
           点字卡即可重复发送，无需每次手动输入 -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="chat-ask-panel" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span id="chat-ask-title">邀请TA</span>
          <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-ask-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-groups" id="invite-groups" hidden></div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll chat-ask-body">
          <!-- #1188：邀请记录（仅「邀请TA」模式显示）——今天直接列出，更早按自然日折叠、日期组分页加载 -->
          <div class="chat-ask-hist" id="chat-ask-hist" hidden>
            <div class="chat-ask-hist-bar">
              <span class="chat-ask-hist-toggle" id="chat-ask-hist-toggle">📜 邀请记录 ▾</span>
              <button type="button" class="chat-ask-hist-clear" id="chat-ask-hist-clear">清空记录</button>
            </div>
            <div class="chat-ask-hist-list" id="chat-ask-hist-list" hidden></div>
          </div>
          <div class="invite-list" id="invite-list" hidden></div>
          <div class="dec-inp-wrap chat-ask-inp-wrap"><input type="text" class="chat-ask-input" id="chat-ask-input" placeholder="想邀请TA做什么？" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false"><button type="button" class="dec-inp-clear" data-clear="chat-ask-input" aria-label="清空" title="清空">✕</button></div>
          <button type="button" class="chat-ask-bulk" id="chat-ask-bulk" hidden>批量设置问卷</button>
          <div class="chat-ask-actions">
            <button class="cc-tool" id="chat-ask-save" hidden>存入</button>
            <button class="cc-tool" id="chat-ask-cancel">取消</button>
            <button class="cc-tool" id="chat-ask-ok">发送</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
            <!-- FIX 2026-09-14 #474：本段（chat-ask-panel 收尾处）原有 3 个连续 div 闭合（关 chat-ask-actions / poke-card-scroll / chat-ask-panel）。
          108b918 误删 chat-ask-actions 三按钮时把第三个闭合一起删掉，#471 恢复按钮但漏恢复该闭合 →
          后续全部 .page（聊天设置/群聊/漂流瓶/梦角/心情/我的档案）被吞进 chat-ask-panel 内，
          父级 page-chat 一隐藏子级联动 display:none = 多个子页整页白屏（多机型必现）。缺失闭合必须保留。 -->
      <!-- 拍一拍浮层卡片（聊天页内） -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="poke-card" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>拍一拍 · <b id="poke-partner-name">TA</b></span>
          <button class="poke-card-close" id="poke-card-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll" id="poke-list">
          <!-- 分组/字卡由 JS 渲染 -->
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 消息气泡操作菜单 -->
      <div class="msg-actions" id="msg-actions" hidden>
        <button class="ma-btn" data-act="quote" title="引用">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 11H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v7a4 4 0 01-4 4"/><path d="M20 11h-4a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v7a4 4 0 01-4 4"/></svg>
          <span>引用</span>
        </button>
        <button class="ma-btn" data-act="copy" title="复制">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V4a2 2 0 012-2h9a2 2 0 012 2v1"/></svg>
          <span>复制</span>
        </button>
        <button class="ma-btn" data-act="fav" title="收藏">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6.5 3.5h11a1 1 0 011 1v16l-6.5-4-6.5 4v-16a1 1 0 011-1z"/></svg>
          <span>收藏</span>
        </button>
        <button class="ma-btn" data-act="multisel" title="多选">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h4M4 7l1.5-1.5M4 7l1.5 1.5M4 7V5"/><path d="M10 7h10"/><path d="M4 17h4M4 17l1.5-1.5M4 17l1.5 1.5M4 17v2"/><path d="M10 17h10"/></svg>
          <span>多选</span>
        </button>
        <button class="ma-btn ma-mine" data-act="retract" title="撤回" hidden>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v2"/><path d="M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg>
          <span>撤回</span>
        </button>
        <button class="ma-btn ma-mine" data-act="edit" title="编辑" hidden>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4z"/></svg>
          <span>编辑</span>
        </button>
        <button class="ma-btn ma-del-ta" data-act="del" title="删除" hidden>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v2"/><path d="M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg>
          <span>删除</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      
    </div>

    <!-- 头像和昵称互动（聊天页内底部半框，复用 poke-card 容器，露出聊天消息）
         2026-09-16：原「头像互动」并入昵称池——半框内两级切换：
         上排 = 换什么（头像 / 昵称），下排页签 = 换谁的（TA / 我的），对应 pane-a/b/c/d -->
    <div class="poke-card" id="avlib-card" hidden>
      <div class="poke-card-head">
        <span>头像和昵称互动 · <b id="avlib-name">TA</b></span>
        <button class="poke-card-close" id="avlib-close">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div class="poke-card-scroll" id="avlib-scroll">
        <div class="avlib-kinds">
          <div class="avlib-kind active" id="avlib-kind-avatar">头像</div>
          <div class="avlib-kind" id="avlib-kind-name">昵称</div>
        </div>
        <div class="avlib-tabs">
          <div class="avlib-tab active" id="avlib-tab-a"><span id="avlib-pool-name">TA 的头像库</span><span class="avlib-tab-cnt">（<span id="avlib-count">0</span>）</span></div>
          <div class="avlib-tab" id="avlib-tab-b"><span id="avlib-me-tab-name">我的头像库</span><span class="avlib-tab-cnt">（<span id="avlib-me-count">0</span>）</span></div>
        </div>
        <div id="avlib-pane-a">
          <div class="avlib-toggle">
            <div class="avlib-toggle-txt">
              <div class="avlib-toggle-name">开启随机更换</div>
              <div class="avlib-toggle-sub">TA 会每隔 1-8 小时随机更换一次头像</div>
            </div>
            <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="avlib-enabled"><span class="tk"></span></label>
          </div>
          <div class="avlib-grid" id="avlib-grid"></div>
          <div class="div-result-empty" id="avlib-empty" hidden>还没有头像，点击下方按钮添加</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 8px" id="avlib-upload-hint">选不了多张或点了没反应，是浏览器 / 所在 App 的限制：换 Chrome / Edge 再试（详见 使用说明第 13 节）</div>
          <button class="div-draw" id="avlib-upload">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><path d="M17 8l-5-5-5 5"/><path d="M12 3v12"/></svg>
            添加头像
          </button>
          <button class="div-draw" id="avlib-clear" style="background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);color:var(--ink)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v2"/><path d="M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg>
            清空头像池
          </button>
        </div>
        <div id="avlib-pane-b" hidden>
          <div class="avlib-toggle">
            <div class="avlib-toggle-txt">
              <div class="avlib-toggle-name">TA 主动给我换头像</div>
              <div class="avlib-toggle-sub">TA 会每隔 1-8 小时主动给你换头像，直接换或弹窗征求你同意</div>
            </div>
            <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="avlib-me-enabled"><span class="tk"></span></label>
          </div>
          <div class="avlib-grid" id="avlib-me-grid"></div>
          <div class="div-result-empty" id="avlib-me-empty" hidden>还没有头像，点击下方按钮添加</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 8px" id="avlib-me-upload-hint">选不了多张或点了没反应，是浏览器 / 所在 App 的限制：换 Chrome / Edge 再试（详见 使用说明第 13 节）</div>
          <button class="div-draw" id="avlib-me-upload">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><path d="M17 8l-5-5-5 5"/><path d="M12 3v12"/></svg>
            添加我的头像
          </button>
          <button class="div-draw" id="avlib-me-clear" style="background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);color:var(--ink)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v2"/><path d="M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg>
            清空我的头像池
          </button>
        </div>
        <div id="avlib-pane-c" hidden>
          <div class="avlib-toggle">
            <div class="avlib-toggle-txt">
              <div class="avlib-toggle-name">开启随机更换</div>
              <div class="avlib-toggle-sub">TA 会每隔 1-8 小时随机更换一次昵称</div>
            </div>
            <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="avlib-nick-enabled"><span class="tk"></span></label>
          </div>
          <div class="avlib-note">只改<b>聊天里</b>显示的联系人名字。通话、游戏、占卜等<b>其他功能</b>显示的都是桌面昵称——在 设置 → 通用 → 联系人 / 桌面（或点桌面顶部的头像 / 昵称）里改。</div>
          <div class="avlib-names" id="avlib-nick-list"></div>
          <div class="div-result-empty" id="avlib-nick-empty" hidden>还没有昵称，点击下方按钮添加</div>
          <button class="div-draw" id="avlib-nick-add">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
            添加昵称（一行一个，可批量）
          </button>
          <button class="div-draw" id="avlib-nick-clear" style="background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);color:var(--ink)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v2"/><path d="M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg>
            清空昵称池
          </button>
        </div>
        <div id="avlib-pane-d" hidden>
          <div class="avlib-toggle">
            <div class="avlib-toggle-txt">
              <div class="avlib-toggle-name">TA 主动给我换昵称</div>
              <div class="avlib-toggle-sub">TA 会每隔 1-8 小时主动给你换昵称，直接换或弹窗征求你同意</div>
            </div>
            <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="avlib-me-nick-enabled"><span class="tk"></span></label>
          </div>
          <div class="avlib-note">只改<b>聊天里</b>显示的我的名字。通话、游戏、占卜等<b>其他功能</b>显示的都是桌面昵称——在 设置 → 通用 → 联系人 / 桌面（或点桌面顶部的头像 / 昵称）里改。</div>
          <div class="avlib-names" id="avlib-me-nick-list"></div>
          <div class="div-result-empty" id="avlib-me-nick-empty" hidden>还没有昵称，点击下方按钮添加</div>
          <button class="div-draw" id="avlib-me-nick-add">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
            添加我的昵称（一行一个，可批量）
          </button>
          <button class="div-draw" id="avlib-me-nick-clear" style="background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);color:var(--ink)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v2"/><path d="M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg>
            清空我的昵称池
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>



    <!-- 漂流瓶：两个世界之间的海（聊天更多功能【互动】进入；src/js/drift-bottle.js） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-drift" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="drift-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">漂流瓶</span>
        <span class="ch-settings" id="drift-info-btn" title="关于漂流瓶">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 11v5"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="drift-scroll">
        <div class="drift-sea" id="drift-sea">
          <span class="ds-moon">🌙</span>
          <span class="ds-sun">☀️</span>
          <span class="ds-cloud c1">☁️</span>
          <span class="ds-cloud c2">☁️</span>
          <div class="ds-wave w1"></div>
          <div class="ds-wave w2"></div>
          <div class="ds-bob" id="drift-bob">🫙</div>
          <div class="ds-cap" id="drift-sea-cap">两个世界之间的海</div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-actions">
          <button class="d-pick" id="drift-pick" type="button">捡一个</button>
          <button class="d-put" id="d-put" type="button">🌊 我也放一个</button>
        </div>
        <div class="d-open glass" id="d-open" hidden></div>
        <div class="d-stats" id="d-stats"></div>
        <div class="d-tabs">
          <button class="d-tab sel" data-t="mine" type="button">我的瓶子</button>
          <button class="d-tab" data-t="got" type="button">捡到的</button>
          <button class="d-tab" data-t="theirs" id="d-tab-theirs" type="button"></button>
          <button class="d-tab" data-t="fav" type="button">收藏</button>
        </div>
        <div class="d-list" id="d-list"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 梦角档案：每个梦角一份，记录「我后来才慢慢了解到的TA」（桌面第三页「梦角档案」进入） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-memo-arc" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="narc-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name" id="narc-title">梦角档案</span>
        <span class="ch-settings" id="narc-manage" title="管理梦角">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="19" r="1.6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="narc-scroll" id="narc-root"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="page" id="page-mood" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="mood-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">心情日记</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cal-scroll">
        <div class="cal-card glass">
          <div class="cal-card-title" id="mood-today-title">今天的心情</div>
          <div class="mood-emoji-grid" id="mood-emoji-grid"></div>
          <input type="text" id="mood-note" class="mood-note-input" placeholder="补充一句话（可选）…" maxlength="60">
          <button type="button" class="mood-save-btn" id="mood-save">记下今天</button>
          <div class="mood-ta-line" id="mood-ta-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-card glass">
          <div class="cal-card-title">月度心情曲线 <span id="mood-month-label"></span></div>
          <div class="mood-month-nav">
            <button type="button" id="mood-prev-m" title="上个月">‹</button>
            <button type="button" id="mood-next-m" title="下个月">›</button>
          </div>
          <div class="mood-curve" id="mood-curve"></div>
          <div class="mood-month-grid" id="mood-month-grid"></div>
          <div class="mood-month-stats" id="mood-month-stats"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 我的档案：认识自己——「我是谁，以及我希望怎样被理解」（桌面第三页，与梦角档案互为镜像） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-my-arc" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="myarc-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name" id="myarc-title">我的档案</span>
      </div>
      <div class="narc-scroll" id="myarc-root"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 帮我决定：.phone 级底部半框（v3.5.53 露出聊天消息；聊天页/群聊页共用，群聊里结果发到群聊） -->
    <div class="poke-card" id="chat-decision-panel" hidden>
      <div class="poke-card-head">
        <span>帮我决定</span>
        <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-decision-close">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div class="poke-card-scroll" id="chat-decision-body"></div>
    </div>
    <!-- 多人决定：.phone 级底部半框（同帮我决定，群成员各自出结果；群聊里结果发到群聊） -->
    <div class="poke-card" id="chat-gdecision-panel" hidden>
      <div class="poke-card-head">
        <span>多人决定</span>
        <button class="poke-card-close" id="chat-gdecision-close">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div class="poke-card-scroll" id="chat-gdecision-body"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 群聊页（桌面点「群聊」进入；所有桌面成员在一个窗口里聊天） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-group-chat" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head gc-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="gc-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name gc-name" id="gc-name" title="点击切换群聊">群聊</span>
        <!-- v3.9.x：右上角三点菜单（群成员 / 切换群聊 / 群聊设置） -->
        <span class="ch-settings gc-more-btn" id="gc-more-btn" title="更多">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="19" r="1.6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </div>
      <!-- 三点下拉菜单 -->
      <div class="gc-more-menu" id="gc-more-menu" hidden>
        <div class="gc-more-item" id="gc-more-members">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><circle cx="17" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3 19c0-3 2.7-5 6-5s6 2 6 5"/><path d="M14 19c0-3 2.7-5 6-5"/></svg>
          <span>群成员</span>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.26.x：多群聊分组——切换 / 新建 / 删除群聊 -->
        <div class="gc-more-item" id="gc-more-groups">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 4v16M15 4v16"/></svg>
          <span>切换群聊</span>
        </div>
        <!-- FIX 2026-09-22 #1016（用户直派「添加群聊…没有放在点击群聊右上角 群聊设置 tag 的并列」）：
             #816 曾把三点菜单精简到只剩「群聊设置」，本批把「新建群聊」按**并列位**补回、且排在
             「群聊设置」之上（用户口径：位置不对、在最底下、不在最上面）。菜单节点保留给 JS 接线，
             不在这里写死行为。 -->
        <div class="gc-more-item" id="gc-more-newgroup">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3 19c0-3 2.7-5 6-5s6 2 6 5"/><path d="M18 8v6M15 11h6"/></svg>
          <span>新建群聊</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gc-more-item" id="gc-more-settings">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 00.33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 11-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 00-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1-1.51 1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 11-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00.33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 110-4h.09a1.65 1.65 0 001.51-1 1.65 1.65 0 00-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 112.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 001.82.33h.01a1.65 1.65 0 001-1.51V3a2 2 0 114 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 001 1.51h.01a1.65 1.65 0 001.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33 1.82v.01a1.65 1.65 0 001.51 1H21a2 2 0 110 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51 1z"/></svg>
          <span>群聊设置</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-body gc-body" id="gc-body"></div>
      <!-- #710：群聊记录加载进度提示——群消息大键 IDB 异步读库期间在消息区中央覆盖非阻塞
           进度条（与单聊 #chat-loading 同款样式类，pointer-events:none 不挡滚动/点击），
           group-chat.js 读库落定后自动隐藏 -->
      <div class="chat-loading" id="gc-loading" hidden>
        <div class="chat-loading-card">
          <div class="chat-loading-bar"><i></i></div>
          <span class="chat-loading-txt">正在加载群聊记录…</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-typing gc-typing" id="gc-typing" hidden></div>
      <!-- v3.16.x：待引用预览条（点气泡→引用 后出现，与聊天页 #chat-draft-quote 同款样式） -->
      <div class="chat-draft-quote" id="gc-quote-bar" hidden></div>
      <!-- 待发送草稿条（插入的图片缩略图，与聊天页 .chat-draft 同款样式） -->
      <div class="chat-draft" id="gc-draft" hidden>
        <div class="chat-draft-items" id="gc-draft-items"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- 输入栏与聊天页完全对齐（语音/继续说/更多/表情/输入框/图片/批量发送/发送）；
           语音/继续说/批量发送三个按钮的显隐跟随当前桌面的聊天设置（同 chat-mic-btn/chat-continue-btn/chat-batch-btn）
           v3.27.x #660：这一排的顺序也跟随当前桌面——chat.js 按 cs-input-order 给两处输入栏
           （本行与聊天页 #page-chat 那行）的同名 data-io 令牌设同一个 flex order，两页一致。 -->
      <div class="chat-input-row gc-input-row">
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="gc-mic-btn" data-io="mic" title="录制语音" style="display:none">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0014 0M12 18v3"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="gc-continue-btn" data-io="continue" title="让对方继续说" style="display:none">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 01-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 01-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 01-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 01-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 014.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 013.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 018 8v.5z"/><path d="M9 11h6M9 14h4"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="gc-input-more-btn" data-io="more" title="更多功能">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.6"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="gc-emoji-btn" data-io="emoji" title="表情包">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><path d="M9 9.5l.01.01M15 9.5l.01.01"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="chat-input gc-input" id="gc-input" data-io="input" contenteditable="true" data-ph="说点什么…" spellcheck="false" role="textbox" aria-label="说点什么…"></div>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="gc-img-btn" data-io="img" title="插入图片">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ch-input-btn" id="gc-batch-btn" data-io="batch" title="批量发送" style="display:none">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13"/><path d="M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="chat-send gc-send" id="gc-send">发送</button>
      </div>
      <!-- 群成员列表面板 -->
      <div class="gc-members-panel" id="gc-members-panel" hidden>
        <div class="gc-mp-head">
          <span>群成员</span>
          <button class="gc-mp-close" id="gc-mp-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="gc-mp-body" id="gc-mp-body"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.26.x：群聊列表面板（切换 / 新建 / 删除群聊，复用群成员面板样式） -->
      <div class="gc-members-panel" id="gc-groups-panel" hidden>
        <div class="gc-mp-head">
          <span>切换群聊</span>
          <button class="gc-mp-close" id="gc-gp-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="gc-mp-body" id="gc-gp-body"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- #698c：头像互动/昵称互动半框（池子管理，对齐单聊 avatar-lib 交互） -->
      <div class="gc-members-panel" id="gc-inter-panel" hidden>
        <div class="gc-mp-head">
          <span id="gc-inter-title">头像互动</span>
          <button class="gc-mp-close" id="gc-inter-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="gc-mp-body" id="gc-inter-body"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.26.x：成员选择面板（新建群聊 / 给当前群加人，复用群成员面板样式） -->
      <div class="gc-members-panel" id="gc-gpick-panel" hidden>
        <div class="gc-mp-head">
          <span id="gc-gpick-title">选择成员</span>
          <button class="gc-mp-close" id="gc-gpick-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="gc-gpick-sub">勾选联系人，点底部按钮完成</div>
        <div class="gc-mp-body" id="gc-gpick-body"></div>
        <div class="gc-gpick-ops">
          <button class="gc-set-btn" id="gc-gpick-cancel">取消</button>
          <button class="gc-set-btn gc-gpick-ok" id="gc-gpick-ok">确定</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- @提及成员选择面板 -->
      <div class="gc-at-panel" id="gc-at-panel" hidden>
        <div class="gc-at-head">选择要@的成员</div>
        <div class="gc-at-body" id="gc-at-body"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.16.x：消息气泡操作菜单（点气泡弹出「引用」，复用聊天页 .msg-actions/.ma-btn 样式） -->
      <div class="msg-actions" id="gc-msg-actions" hidden>
        <button class="ma-btn" data-act="quote" title="引用">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 11H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v7a4 4 0 01-4 4"/><path d="M20 11h-4a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v7a4 4 0 01-4 4"/></svg>
          <span>引用</span>
        </button>
        <!-- 对齐聊天设置「允许删除联系人消息」：开启后成员消息可从菜单真删除（默认隐藏，group-chat.js 按 gc-del-msg 开关显隐） -->
        <button class="ma-btn ma-del-gc" data-act="del" title="删除" hidden>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v2"/><path d="M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg>
          <span>删除</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <!-- #287：拍一拍面板（点成员消息头像拍 TA）——复用聊天页 .poke-card 壳样式，列表 group-chat.js 渲染 -->
      <div class="poke-card" id="gc-poke-card" hidden>
        <div class="poke-card-head">
          <span>拍一拍 · <b id="gc-poke-name">成员</b></span>
          <button class="poke-card-close" id="gc-poke-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="poke-card-scroll" id="gc-poke-list"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- 群聊设置面板（v3.9.x：我的群聊形象 + 成员群聊形象，内容 JS 渲染） -->
      <div class="gc-settings-panel" id="gc-settings-panel" hidden>
        <div class="gc-set-head">
          <span>群聊设置</span>
          <button class="gc-mp-close" id="gc-set-close">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="gc-set-body" id="gc-set-body"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

<div class="more-panel" id="chat-more-panel" hidden>
        <!-- v3.15.x：功能增多后改为顶部分类 chips 切换（互动/小游戏/工具/TA的提问）。
             功能按钮元素与 ID 全部保留（各功能模块按 ID 接线），仅加 data-mcat 由 JS 过滤显示；
             每个功能只归属一个分类、分类间互不重复（v3.16.x 起移除「常用」页签，原常用默认项并入所属分类） -->
        <!-- v3.16.x：群聊页打开更多面板时，@群成员 显示在分类 tabs 行最右（仅群聊有，聊天页隐藏） -->
        <div class="more-tabs" id="more-tabs">
          <button class="more-tab sel" type="button" data-mcat="chat">互动</button>
          <button class="more-tab" type="button" data-mcat="tool">工具</button>
          <button class="more-tab" type="button" data-mcat="game">小游戏</button>
          <button class="more-tab" type="button" data-mcat="ask">TA的提问</button>
          <button class="gc-more-at-top" id="gc-more-at" title="@群成员" hidden>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M16 8v5a3 3 0 006 0v-1a10 10 0 10-20 0v1a10 10 0 0010 10"/></svg>@群成员
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="more-grid" id="more-grid-fun">
          <button class="more-item" id="more-chatshot" data-mcat="chat" title="把聊天记录存成长图">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h3l2-2h6l2 2h3v12H4z"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="3.5"/></svg></span>
            <span>存成长图</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-decide" data-mcat="tool" title="帮我决定">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8"/></svg></span>
            <span>帮我决定</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-gdecide" data-mcat="tool" title="多人决定">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="8.6" cy="8.8" r="2.4"/><path d="M3.4 19c.6-3.3 2.8-5 5.2-5s4.6 1.7 5.2 5"/><circle cx="15.4" cy="8.8" r="2.4"/><path d="M10.2 19c.6-3.3 2.8-5 5.2-5s4.6 1.7 5.2 5"/></svg></span>
            <span>多人决定</span>
          </button>

          <button class="more-item" id="more-ask" data-mcat="tool" title="问问TA">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9.6 9.6a2.4 2.4 0 114.8.4c0 1.7-2.4 2.1-2.4 3.3"/><path d="M12 16.7h.01"/></svg></span>
            <span>问问TA</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-search" data-mcat="tool" title="搜索聊天记录">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg></span>
            <span>搜索记录</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-call" data-mcat="chat" title="通话">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg></span>
            <span>通话</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-poke" data-mcat="chat" title="打开拍一拍页面">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 14.5V7.2a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0v7.3"/><path d="M11 14.5V6.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0v8"/><path d="M14 14.5V7.8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0v6.7"/><path d="M6.5 14.5h12c0 3.5-2.7 6-6 6s-6-2.5-6-6"/><path d="M6 5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 12 0"/></svg></span>
            <span>拍一拍</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-rps" data-mcat="game" title="猜拳">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="currentColor" d="M200 80h-16V64a32 32 0 0 0-56-21.13a32 32 0 0 0-55.79 17.55A32 32 0 0 0 24 88v40a104 104 0 0 0 208 0v-16a32 32 0 0 0-32-32m-48-32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16h-32V64a16 16 0 0 1 16-16M88 64a16 16 0 0 1 32 0v40a16 16 0 0 1-32 0ZM40 88a16 16 0 0 1 32 0v16a16 16 0 0 1-32 0Zm176 40a88 88 0 0 1-175.92 3.75A31.93 31.93 0 0 0 80 125.13a31.93 31.93 0 0 0 44.58 3.35a32.2 32.2 0 0 0 11.8 11.44A47.88 47.88 0 0 0 120 176a8 8 0 0 0 16 0a32 32 0 0 1 32-32a8 8 0 0 0 0-16h-16a16 16 0 0 1-16-16V96h64a16 16 0 0 1 16 16Z"/></svg></span>
            <span>猜拳</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-rp" data-mcat="chat" title="发红包">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9c3 2 6 3 9 3s6-1 9-3"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="1.4"/></svg></span>
            <span>红包</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-invite" data-mcat="chat" title="邀请TA">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H6a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M19 8v6M22 11h-6"/></svg></span>
            <span>邀请TA</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-gift" data-mcat="chat" title="心意集市">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M5 12v8a1 1 0 001 1h12a1 1 0 001-1v-8"/><path d="M12 8v13"/>            <path d="M12 8S10.5 4 8 4 5 6 5 8"/><path d="M12 8s1.5-4 4-4 3 2 3 4"/></svg></span>
            <span>心意集市</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-giftbox" data-mcat="chat" title="心意柜">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 8V5"/><path d="M9 5h6"/></svg></span>
            <span>心意柜</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-avatar" data-mcat="chat" title="头像和昵称互动">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.5-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg></span>
            <span>头像和昵称互动</span>
          </button>
          <!-- v18（用户直派）：漂流瓶删除；「抽一张」从输入栏移入本工具栏（互动类）；「语音」也放进互动类 -->
          <button class="more-item" id="more-draw" data-mcat="chat" title="抽一张（让 TA 抽 / 我来抽）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="9" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M6 9h3M6 12h3"/><rect x="12" y="4" width="9" height="15" rx="2" opacity=".55"/><path d="M15 8l2 2-2 2"/></svg></span>
            <span>抽一张</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-mic" data-mcat="tool" title="发语音（需先在聊天设置打开「我可发送语音」）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="2.5" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5.5 11.5a6.5 6.5 0 0013 0"/><path d="M12 18v3.5"/><path d="M8.5 21.5h7"/></svg></span>
            <span>语音</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-divine" data-mcat="tool" title="占卜">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="1.5"/><path d="M12 8.5l1.15 2.4 2.4 1.15-2.4 1.15L12 15.6l-1.15-2.4-2.4-1.15 2.4-1.15z"/></svg></span>
            <span>占卜</span>
          </button>
          <!-- #982：聊天侧入口从「更多 → 工具」移到「聊天设置 → 美化」（用户直派「屏幕适配不该放在
               聊天的更多功能的工具里，要放在聊天的聊天设置里」）——入口行见 #cs-screen-adj，勿在此重建 -->
          <button class="more-item" id="more-pong" data-mcat="game" title="双人Pong">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="18" rx="2"/><rect x="4" y="8" width="2" height="8" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="18" y="8" width="2" height="8" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
            <span>Pong</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-snake" data-mcat="game" title="双人贪吃蛇">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M7 7h3v3H7zM14 14h3v3h-3z"/></svg></span>
            <span>贪吃蛇</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-brick" data-mcat="game" title="双人打砖块（合作）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="1.5"/><path d="M3 9.3h18M3 14.6h18"/><path d="M12 4v5.3M7.5 9.3v5.3M16.5 9.3v5.3M12 14.6V20"/></svg></span>
            <span>打砖块</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-fish" data-mcat="game" title="双人钓鱼">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.8 8.8l4.2-3.3"/><path d="M17.8 16.2l4.2 3.3"/><ellipse cx="10.6" cy="12.5" rx="7.2" ry="4.3"/><circle cx="7.2" cy="11.3" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><path d="M3 5.2q1.7-1.1 3.4 0q1.7-1.1 3.4 0q1.7-1.1 3.4 0"/></svg></span>
            <span>钓鱼</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-c4" data-mcat="game" title="四子棋">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3.2"/><circle cx="16" cy="8" r="3.2"/><circle cx="8" cy="16" r="3.2"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3.2"/></svg></span>
            <span>四子棋</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-ms" data-mcat="game" title="合作扫雷（和TA一起探索雷区）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M9 3v18M15 3v18M3 9h18M3 15h18"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.3"/></svg></span>
            <span>扫雷</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-memory" data-mcat="game" title="记忆翻牌（和TA合作）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8.6 3.4l8.8-2 3.4 3.2-8.8 2z"/><rect x="3.4" y="7" width="15.6" height="13.4" rx="1.8"/><path d="M11.2 11.8l.9 1.9 1.9.9-1.9.9-.9 1.9-.9-1.9-1.9-.9 1.9-.9z"/></svg></span>
            <span>记忆翻牌</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-gomoku" data-mcat="game" title="五子棋">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M3.5 9.2h17M3.5 14.8h17M9.2 3.5v17M14.8 3.5v17"/><circle cx="9.2" cy="9.2" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="14.8" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="9.2" cy="14.8" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span>
            <span>五子棋</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-linkup" data-mcat="game" title="连连看（和TA合作）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="6.5" width="8" height="8" rx="1.8"/><rect x="13" y="10.5" width="8" height="8" rx="1.8"/><path d="M11 12.5h2" stroke-dasharray="1.4 1.8"/></svg></span>
            <span>连连看</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-match3" data-mcat="game" title="消消乐（和TA轮流消除）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="7.2" cy="15" r="2.7"/><circle cx="12" cy="8.2" r="2.7"/><circle cx="16.8" cy="15" r="2.7"/></svg></span>
            <span>消消乐</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-auction" data-mcat="game" title="心意币拍卖会（和TA竞拍）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12.4 5.4l6.2 6.2M14.6 3.2l6.2 6.2-2.2 2.2-6.2-6.2z"/><path d="M13.6 9.8l-8.4 8.4"/><path d="M4.2 21h7"/></svg></span>
            <span>拍卖会</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="more-grid" id="more-grid-ask" hidden>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-ask-now" title="让TA现在问一次（TA的询问）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 015.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg></span>
            <span>询问</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-choose-now" title="让TA现在问一次（TA的小问题）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></span>
            <span>小问题</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-curious-now" title="让TA现在好奇一次（TA的好奇）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 000 18"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></span>
            <span>好奇</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-roast-now" title="让TA现在吐槽一次（TA的吐槽）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l1.8 5.4 5.7.3-4.4 3.6 1.5 5.5-4.6-3.3-4.6 3.3 1.5-5.5-4.4-3.6 5.7-.3z"/></svg></span>
            <span>吐槽</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-invite-now" title="让TA现在邀请一次（猜拳/Pong/贪吃蛇/贴贴，话术来自字卡库「TA的邀请」）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="11" rx="5"/><path d="M7 10.5v3M5.5 12h3"/><path d="M15.5 11h.01M18.5 13h.01"/></svg></span>
            <span>邀请</span>
          </button>
          <!-- v8.29 #1003：以下三枚是「回复设置里只按概率发生」的主动行为的手动触发口（用户直派
               「点击之后让联系人立即触发」）——贴贴邀请＝回复设置→其他「主动邀请贴贴」、
               查岗＝回复设置→查岗「TA 主动查岗」、跨桌面查岗＝回复设置→其他「联系人跨桌面查岗」 -->
          <button class="more-item" id="more-cuddle-now" title="让TA现在发来一次贴贴邀请（贴贴/抱抱/牵手/靠着，话术来自字卡库「TA的邀请」的贴贴分类）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20.2s-7.4-4.8-7.4-9.9A4.6 4.6 0 0112 7.2a4.6 4.6 0 017.4 3.1c0 5.1-7.4 9.9-7.4 9.9z"/><path d="M8.4 11.6c0-1.6 1.3-2.4 2.6-2.4"/></svg></span>
            <span>贴贴</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-ck-now" title="让TA现在来查一次岗（TA的查岗问题卡，题库在 字卡库 →「TA的查岗」）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 000 18"/></svg></span>
            <span>查岗</span>
          </button>
          <button class="more-item" id="more-xck-now" title="让其他桌面的联系人现在来查一次岗（跨桌面查岗，会弹出「XX 来查岗了」）">
            <span class="mi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2.5" y="4.5" width="12" height="9" rx="1.6"/><rect x="9.5" y="10.5" width="12" height="9" rx="1.6"/></svg></span>
            <span>跨桌面查岗</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    <!-- TA在身边·位置面板（字卡库「TA在身边位置卡」入口使用，必须放在所有 .page 之外——
         position:fixed 弹层若嵌在 .page 内，页面切换时会被父级 hidden 隐藏，桌面寻踪页点开就会"跑到聊天页"；
         v3.26.x：两入口统一 .loc-full 全屏打开） -->
    <div class="loc-panel" id="loc-panel" hidden>
      <div class="loc-head">
        <button class="loc-back" id="loc-back" aria-label="返回">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <span class="loc-title">TA在身边 · <b id="loc-name">TA</b> 的位置</span>
      </div>
      <div class="loc-scroll">
        <!-- 方位感知（v3.13.x：模糊感知，不是精确定位） -->
        <div class="fw-sense" id="fw-sense">
          <div class="fw-title">
            <span class="fw-title-t">方位感知</span>
            <span class="fw-title-s">不是精确定位 · 是你对 TA 的模糊感觉</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fw-circle" id="fw-circle"></div>
          <div class="fw-detail" id="fw-detail"></div>
          <button class="fw-perceive" id="fw-perceive" type="button">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg>
            感知一下
          </button>
          <div class="fw-result" id="fw-result" hidden></div>
        </div>
        <div class="loc-body" id="loc-body"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 位置卡光点动效层（全局，同样须在 .page 外） -->
    <div class="loc-fx" id="loc-fx" hidden></div>

    <!-- 聊天设置（独立页面） -->
    <div class="page" id="page-chat-settings" hidden>
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="ch-back" id="cs-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="ch-name">聊天设置</span>
      </div>
      <!-- 聊天设置页顶部标签切换：美化 / 功能 / 数据（复用 .them-tabs/.them-sec，交互在 chat-settings.js） -->
      <div class="them-tabs" id="cs-tabs">
        <div class="them-tab active" data-tab="beautify">美化</div>
        <div class="them-tab" data-tab="function">功能</div>
        <div class="them-tab" data-tab="data">数据</div>
      </div>
      <div class="them-sec" data-sec="beautify">
      <div class="gs-title" style="padding-top:2px">聊天美化方案</div>
      <div class="set-group glass">
        <div class="set-row" id="row-chat-beauty-save">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 17V9M9 11l3-3 3 3"/><path d="M5 4h11l3 3v13a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V5a1 1 0 011-1z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">保存当前为聊天美化方案<span class="sub">含气泡颜色/CSS、壁纸、字体、时间轴等，全桌面通用</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="row-chat-beauty-schemes">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">我的聊天美化方案<span class="sub">保存的方案一键切换，跨桌面通用</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-title" style="padding-top:2px">壁纸</div>
      <div class="set-group glass">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bg-upload">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">上传聊天壁纸<span class="sub">壁纸图库：可存多张，点缩略图随时切换</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-bg-val"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bg-remove" hidden>
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M10 11v6M14 11v6"/><path d="M6 7l1 12a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-12"/><path d="M9 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">移除聊天壁纸</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bg-fit">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6v6H9z"/><path d="M3 9h2M19 9h2M3 15h2M19 15h2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">壁纸铺满方式<span class="sub">铺满裁剪（填满、可能被裁）/ 完整显示（全图不裁、可能留边）/ 平铺 / 拉伸填满</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-bg-fit-val">铺满裁剪</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bg-fullbars">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 8h18M3 16h18" opacity=".55"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">壁纸延伸到顶栏 / 输入栏<span class="sub">默认关：顶栏与输入栏有自己的底色会盖住壁纸；打开后让开底色，壁纸一直铺到屏幕上下边缘</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-bg-fullbars-val">关 · 栏位盖住</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-title">顶栏 / 底栏与气泡透明</div>
      <div class="set-group glass">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bar-op">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="18" height="6" rx="3"/><path d="M12 11v3" opacity=".5"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">顶栏 / 输入栏透明度<span class="sub">不透明度 0% 全透明、100% 不透明，文字按钮不变淡</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-bar-op-val">默认</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bubble-op">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 01-9 8.4 8.6 8.6 0 01-3.3-.7L4 21l1.2-4.1a8.4 8.4 0 1115.8-5.4z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">聊天气泡透明度<span class="sub">只调气泡底色；自定义气泡 CSS 的背景可覆盖此设置</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-bubble-op-val">不透明</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-typing-ink">
          <div class="txt">对方正在输入文字颜色<span class="sub">调整聊天中「对方正在输入…」提示的颜色</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-typing-ink-val">#8a8a8a</div>
        </div>
        <!-- v8.35 #1026：输入框提示文字（「说点什么…」）颜色与显隐，每联系人独立；单聊与群聊两排输入栏共用 -->
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-ph-ink">
          <div class="txt">输入框提示文字颜色<span class="sub">输入栏空着时那行灰色的「说点什么…」；默认跟随主题（浅色浅灰、深色深灰）</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-ph-ink-val">默认（跟随主题）</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-ph-show-row">
          <div class="txt">隐藏输入框提示文字<span class="sub">打开后输入栏空着时不再显示「说点什么…」，输入框位置与大小不变</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-ph-show"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bar-pos">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18M8 7l4-4 4 4M8 17l4 4 4-4"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">顶栏 / 底栏位置微调<span class="sub">上下各 ±80px（顶栏正=下移、底栏正=上移，负值反向）；设为 0 恢复默认</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-bar-pos-val">默认</div>
        </div>
        <!-- v8.29 #982：聊天侧「屏幕适配微调」入口（用户直派「这个要放在聊天的聊天设置里」）——
             #962 的「更多 → 工具 → 屏幕适配」按钮已撤除，聊天侧只留本行；点开即开同一面板
             （接线在 personalize.js），展开态默认停在输入栏之上，点面板里的「看聊天」就地回现场调。 -->
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-screen-adj">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 8h6M9 12h6M9 16h3"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">屏幕适配微调<span class="sub">正文太小 / 顶栏底栏错位 / 底部裁切 / 页面留白？面板边拖边看、当场见效；面板顶部写着「正在调：聊天」且「聊天」那枚页签反色高亮，不会看错在调哪一页；展开态停在输入栏与底部导航之上，不挡说话与切页；桌面长按空白→装修模式、设置→工具 也各有一个入口；本机永久保存（换设备各自调）</span></div>
          <div class="arrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-title">气泡样式</div>
      <div class="set-group glass">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-font-size">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h10"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">聊天气泡字体大小</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-font-size-val">14px</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bubble-size">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="3"/><path d="M7 10h.01M10 10h.01M13 10h.01"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">聊天气泡框大小</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-bubble-size-val">标准</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-bubble-radius">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="8"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">聊天气泡边缘圆角<span class="sub">气泡四角圆润程度，小圆角更利落 / 特圆更可爱</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-bubble-radius-val">标准</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-av-shape">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.5-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">聊天头像形状</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-av-shape-val">圆形</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-time-style">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">时间轴样式</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-time-style-val">头像下方</div>
        </div>
        <!-- FIX 2026-09-18 #728：标识 / 时间轴位置微调——上传自定义气泡 CSS 后气泡尺寸与内边距
             变了，标识（气泡左上角）与时间轴的默认位置会跟着偏，甚至被气泡边缘裁掉或压住文字。
             两行各自点开是「左右 / 上下」两个方向的偏移（±40px，0=默认）；也可在
             聊天设置→美化→「边看边调」抽屉的「微调」分区里拖着调、即时看效果。 -->
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-mark-pos">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">主动发送标识位置<span class="sub">气泡 CSS 改了气泡大小后标识偏移时，在这里校准</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-mark-pos-val">默认</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-time-pos">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v4l2.5 1.5M4 4l2 2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">时间轴位置<span class="sub">改过气泡大小/内边距后时间轴偏移时，在这里校准</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-time-pos-val">默认</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-title">气泡颜色 / CSS</div>
      <div class="set-group glass">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-out-bg">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21a9 9 0 110-18"/><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 019 9"/><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">我的气泡颜色</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-out-bg-val">默认 #111111</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-out-ink">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 20L10 6h4l5 14"/><path d="M7.5 14.5h9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">我的消息文字颜色</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-out-ink-val">默认 #ffffff</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-in-bg">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21a9 9 0 110-18"/><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 019 9"/><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">联系人气泡颜色</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-in-bg-val">默认 #ffffff</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-in-ink">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 20L10 6h4l5 14"/><path d="M7.5 14.5h9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">联系人消息文字颜色</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-in-ink-val">默认 #111111</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-css">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">气泡 CSS</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-css-val">默认</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-title">字体</div>
      <div class="set-group glass">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-font">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h10"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">全局字体</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-font-val">默认</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="them-sec" data-sec="function" hidden>
      <!-- FIX 2026-09-20 #927：「全屏模式」开关提到功能页顶部常显（原埋在二级标签「显示」里，切进去才看得见）——
           本组不带 data-tag，故不参与 #cs-func-tags 分类过滤（chat-settings.js 只过滤 [data-tag] 成对元素），五个入口一律可见。
           与设置页通用段 #sf-fullscreen 同一状态双向同步（接线在 chat-settings.js）。 -->
      <div class="gs-title">全屏</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" id="cs-fs-group">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-fullscreen-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v3M16 3h3a2 2 0 012 2v3M8 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-3M16 21h3a2 2 0 002-2v-3"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">全屏模式（隐藏手机状态栏）<span class="sub">手机端切到后台（锁屏 / 切去别的应用）会自动退出全屏，这是设备限制、不是 bug，切回来再开一次即可</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-fullscreen"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.29.x：功能页二级 tag 分类（形象/消息/显示），点击只显示对应分组；
           交互在 chat-settings.js（#cs-func-tags），分组按 gs-title/set-group 成对 data-tag 过滤。
           v3.34.x 分类改名（用户反馈「分类名字还是有问题，不太合适」）：
           ①去掉「全部」（进页默认选中「形象」并即时过滤，三分类互斥）；
           ②「消息输入」→「消息」——「允许删除联系人消息」已移入本分类，旧名（只管输入）
             盖不住「删除消息」这类操作项；
           ③「界面」→「显示」——本组 5 项（隐藏联系人表情包/全屏/全屏防误触/隐藏音乐悬浮小窗/
             隐藏通话小框）全是显隐开关，叫「界面」名不副实 -->
      <div class="them-tabs sub" id="cs-func-tags">
        <div class="them-tab active" data-ft="profile">形象</div>
        <div class="them-tab" data-ft="msg">消息</div>
        <div class="them-tab" data-ft="ui">显示</div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.8.x：聊天专用昵称/头像（与桌面 deco-widget 的 lbl-*/avatar-* 完全独立，
           桌面只能在桌面改，聊天只能在聊天设置改；未设时聊天页显示默认占位 TA/我 + 人形图标） -->
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="profile">昵称与头像（聊天专用 · 与桌面各自独立，互不同步）</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="profile">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-lbl-partner">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.5-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">联系人昵称</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-lbl-partner-val"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-lbl-user">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.5-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">我的昵称</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-lbl-user-val"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-avatar-partner">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">联系人头像<span class="sub">「头像和昵称互动」里也能换 TA 的头像；开了随机更换后，TA 换头像会覆盖这里设置的</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-avatar-partner-val"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-avatar-partner-remove" hidden>
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M10 11v6M14 11v6"/><path d="M6 7l1 12a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-12"/><path d="M9 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">清空联系人头像</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-avatar-user">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">我的头像<span class="sub">「头像和昵称互动」里也能换我的头像；「TA 主动给我换头像」触发时会覆盖这里设置的</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-avatar-user-val"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-avatar-user-remove" hidden>
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M10 11v6M14 11v6"/><path d="M6 7l1 12a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-12"/><path d="M9 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">清空我的头像</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.41：消息气泡——保留「允许随机引用」「显示已读/未读」两项；
           随机附加颜文字 / 允许随机贴反应 / 贴反应 已按需求移除，接线在 msg-status-yz.js；
           连接检测（梦角主动 / 系统噪音 / 双方影响）在 v32 重新加回，接线在 conn-check-yz.js -->
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="msg">消息气泡</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="msg">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-quote-en-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 11H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v7a4 4 0 01-4 4"/><path d="M20 11h-4a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v7a4 4 0 01-4 4"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">允许随机引用<span class="sub">TA 偶尔引用你上面的某一句再回；关掉后只回文字、不引用</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-quote-en"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-read-en-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l5 5L13 8"/><path d="M12 17l1.5 1.5L22 9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">显示已读 / 未读<span class="sub">你发的每条气泡旁边显示「已读」或「未读」，TA 看过之后自动变已读</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-read-en"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-conn-en-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l7 7-7 11L5 10z"/><path d="M5 10h14"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">连接检测<span class="sub">点 TA 的某条消息，气泡下才出现这句的连接状态与检测卡（梦角主动 / 系统噪音 / 双方影响）</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-conn-en"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" style="display:block">
          <div style="font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted)">长按气泡可引用或多选。自动引用约 10%，引用后至少间隔三条文字回复；同一句话不重复引用。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="msg">发送按钮</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="msg">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-send-show-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">隐藏发送按钮<span class="sub">回车键可发送消息，隐藏这个按钮不影响使用</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-send-show"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-enter-send-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M6 10h.01M10 10h.01M14 10h.01M18 10h.01M6 14h.01M18 14h.01M9 14h6"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">回车键发送消息<span class="sub">关闭后按回车键换行，不再直接发送</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-enter-send"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-send-bg">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="6" rx="3"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">发送按钮颜色</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-send-bg-val">默认 #111111</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-send-ink">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 20L10 6h4l5 14"/><path d="M7.5 14.5h9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">发送文字颜色</div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-send-ink-val">默认 #ffffff</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.11.x：批量发送消息开关（默认关闭，每联系人独立）。开启后聊天输入栏右侧显示
           「批量发送」按钮：可插入表情包/图片/文字，每个项目一条消息，多条按顺序批量发送 -->
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="msg">批量发送</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="msg">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-batch-send-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13"/><path d="M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">批量发送消息<span class="sub">聊天输入栏右侧显示「批量发送」按钮：可插入表情包、图片、文字，每条消息单独一条，多条按顺序一次性发送</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-batch-send"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.16.x：我可发送语音开关（默认关闭，每联系人独立）。开启后聊天输入栏左侧显示
           「麦克风」按钮：点击打开录音半框，录完可试听，一键把语音发进聊天 -->
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="msg">语音消息</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="msg">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-voice-send-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0014 0M12 18v3"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">我可发送语音<span class="sub">聊天输入栏左侧出现「麦克风」按钮：点击打开录音窗口，最长录 60 秒，可先试听再发送为语音消息</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-voice-send"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.27.x #660：输入栏按钮位置（统一管理）——底部输入栏这一排按钮（含「开关型」的
           麦克风/继续说/批量发送与输入框本身）的左右顺序可自定义；点行开排序面板（chat-settings.js
           openInputOrderPanel），顺序存 cs-input-order（每联系人独立，与 cs-voice-send/cs-batch-send
           同域），聊天页与群聊输入栏共用。开关只管显隐、本项只管位置，两者互不覆盖。
           「发送」是固定收尾的动作按钮，不参与排序。 -->
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="msg">输入栏按钮</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="msg">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-input-order">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 8h11M4 16h11"/><path d="M18 6l3 2-3 2M18 14l3 2-3 2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">输入栏按钮位置<span class="sub">自定义底部输入栏这一排图标的左右顺序，输入框本身也能移动；录音、继续说、批量发送等开关按钮按这里的顺序就位，与开关各自独立、互不影响</span></div>
          <div class="val" id="cs-input-order-val">默认排列</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.10.x：允许删除联系人消息（默认关闭，每联系人独立）。开启后点击 TA 消息弹出的操作菜单里多出「删除」按钮，可永久移除该条 TA 消息。
           v3.34.x：由「数据」分区搬入「消息」分类（用户反馈：这是消息操作项，不该只在数据页） -->
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="msg">消息管理</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="msg">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-del-ta-msg-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v2"/><path d="M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">允许删除联系人消息<span class="sub">点击消息气泡可弹出删除按钮，消息是真的会删除无法回复</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-del-ta-msg"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.12.x：隐藏联系人的表情包开关（默认关闭，全局生效）。开启后聊天与朋友圈的
           表情包面板只显示「我的表情包」，不再显示 TA 的/公用表情包 -->
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="ui">表情包</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="ui">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-hide-ta-sticker-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 10h.01M15 10h.01"/><path d="M8.5 14a4.5 4.5 0 007 0"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">隐藏联系人的表情包<span class="sub">隐藏后，聊天和朋友圈的表情包面板里只显示「我的表情包」，不再显示TA的和公用表情包</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-hide-ta-sticker"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- v3.29.x：全屏模式行已提到功能页顶部常显（#927），本组留「显示」类显隐开关 -->
      <div class="gs-title" data-tag="ui">边缘防误触 / 悬浮窗</div>
      <div class="set-group glass" data-tag="ui">
        <!-- v3.9.x：全屏边缘防误触（镜像设置页 #sf-edge-guard，同一状态双向同步） -->
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-edge-guard-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">全屏边缘防误触</div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-edge-guard"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.10.x：「隐藏音乐悬浮小窗」开关（同源 music-global.floatEn，每桌面独立；语义反转：勾选=隐藏，与下方「隐藏通话小框」一致。音乐页 #music-float-en / 音乐设置 #sm-set-float 仍保持勾选=开启） -->
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-music-float-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18V5l12-2v13"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="16" r="3"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">隐藏音乐悬浮小窗</div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-music-float"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.7.x：隐藏通话小框开关（同源 call-mini-enabled，每桌面独立；勾选=接通后不弹出悬浮小框，保持通话大面板常驻） -->
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-call-mini-hide-row">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">隐藏通话小框</div>
          <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="cs-call-mini-hide"><span class="tk"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="them-sec" data-sec="data" hidden>
      <div class="gs-title">数据</div>
      <div class="set-group glass">
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-export-msgs">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5-5 5 5"/><path d="M12 5v12"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">导出聊天记录</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-import-msgs">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 5v12"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">导入聊天记录</div>
        </div>
        <!-- v3.36.x：#471 设置页「导出全部桌面聊天记录」/「导入全部桌面聊天记录」——导出与顶部备份提醒条「备份聊天」同入口（CHAT_KEY_RE 匹配全部桌面命名空间），导入支持标准备份文件（按桌面 key 分路写回各桌面）与单桌文件（归入当前桌面） -->
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-export-all">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5-5 5 5"/><path d="M12 5v12"/><path d="M3 19h18"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">导出全部桌面聊天记录</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row" id="cs-import-all">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 5v12"/><path d="M3 19h18"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">导入全部桌面聊天记录</div>
        </div>
        <div class="set-row danger" id="cs-clear-msgs">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2"/><path d="M19 6l-1 14a2 2 0 01-2 2H8a2 2 0 01-2-2L5 6"/><path d="M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt">删除全部聊天记录</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>

<!-- TA的小问题弹层（选择题 / 收藏 / 历史） -->
<div class="tc-mask" id="tc-mask" hidden>
  <div class="tc-panel">
    <div class="mg-head"><span id="tc-panel-title">TA的小问题</span><span class="tc-head-x" id="tc-head-x"></span><button class="mg-close" id="tc-mask-close">✕</button></div>
    <div class="tc-body" id="tc-body"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 导出字卡数据选择弹层（v3.7.x：分类 + 分组多选后导出 json） -->
<div class="tc-mask" id="cc-export-mask" hidden>
  <div class="tc-panel">
    <div class="mg-head"><span>导出字卡数据</span><button class="mg-close" id="ce-close">✕</button></div>
    <div class="tc-body">
      <div class="gs-title">选择分类</div>
      <div class="cc-export-row" id="ce-cats"></div>
      <div class="gs-title">选择分组</div>
      <div class="cc-export-grps" id="ce-grps"></div>
      <div class="ce-summary" id="ce-summary"></div>
    </div>
    <button class="cc-tool ce-btn" id="ce-do">导出选中字卡</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- v3.11.x：字卡库 公用/专属 双分类变动一次性提醒（引导先导出字卡 json 备份再使用新版） -->
<div class="tc-mask" id="cc-scope-mask" hidden>
  <div class="tc-panel">
    <div class="mg-head"><span>字卡库更新提醒</span><button class="mg-close" id="csn-close">✕</button></div>
    <div class="tc-body">
      <div class="gs-title">本次更新后，聊天字卡库分为两个大分类：</div>
      <div class="ce-grp-cat">· 公用字卡 —— 以后每个桌面的联系人都能使用</div>
      <div class="ce-grp-cat">· 专属字卡 —— 只有当前桌面绑定的联系人才能使用</div>
      <div class="gs-title" style="margin-top:10px">你原有的自定义聊天字卡已自动迁移，不会丢失。为防万一，建议先导出一份字卡 json 备份，再刷新使用新版。</div>
      <div class="ce-summary" id="csn-summary"></div>
    </div>
    <button class="cc-tool ce-btn" id="csn-export">导出字卡 json 备份</button>
    <button class="cc-tool ce-btn" id="csn-ok" style="margin-top:8px">我已知晓，进入新版</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- v3.5.102：桌面新消息横幅（TA 主动发消息时，在桌面/其他页面顶部弹出，点击进聊天） -->
<div class="desk-msg" id="desk-msg" hidden>
  <div class="desk-msg-av" id="desk-msg-av"></div>
  <div class="desk-msg-body">
    <div class="desk-msg-name" id="desk-msg-name">TA</div>
    <div class="desk-msg-text" id="desk-msg-text"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 悬浮音乐播放小框（播放时显示，可拖动；两行布局：上行歌名/歌手，下行控制按钮；右上角可收起为最初版最小单行小框） -->
<div class="sm-float" id="sm-float" hidden>
  <button class="sm-f-collapse" id="sm-f-collapse" title="关闭悬浮小框（长按收成单行小框）">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>
  </button>
  <div class="sm-f-info">
    <div class="sm-f-name" id="sm-f-name">正在播放</div>
    <div class="sm-f-artist" id="sm-f-artist">音乐</div>
    <div class="sm-f-progress"><div class="sm-f-fill" id="sm-f-fill"></div></div>
    <div class="sm-f-times"><span id="sm-f-cur">0:00</span><span id="sm-f-dur">0:00</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="sm-f-ctrl">
    <button class="sm-f-btn" id="sm-f-mode" title="播放模式"><svg id="sm-f-mode-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13"/><path d="M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg></button>
    <button class="sm-f-btn" id="sm-f-queue" title="播放队列"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h9"/></svg></button>
    <button class="sm-f-btn" id="sm-f-prev" title="上一首"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 6h2v12H6zm3.5 6l8.5 6V6z"/></svg></button>
    <button class="sm-f-btn sm-f-play" id="sm-f-play" title="播放/暂停"><svg id="sm-f-play-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></button>
    <button class="sm-f-btn" id="sm-f-next" title="下一首"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 18l8.5-6L6 6v12zM16 6v12h2V6h-2z"/></svg></button>
    <button class="sm-f-btn sm-f-heart" id="sm-f-heart" title="收藏">
      <svg id="sm-f-heart-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20.5S4.5 15.2 4.5 9.9A4.9 4.9 0 0112 7.1a4.9 4.9 0 017.5 2.8c0 5.3-7.5 10.6-7.5 10.6z"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
  <!-- 最小态：最初版最小单行小框（收起后显示，点播放/展开按钮恢复互动） -->
  <div class="sm-f-mini" id="sm-f-mini">
    <button class="sm-f-mini-play" id="sm-f-mini-play" title="播放/暂停"><svg id="sm-f-mini-play-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></button>
    <div class="sm-f-mini-name" id="sm-f-mini-name">正在播放</div>
    <button class="sm-f-mini-close" id="sm-f-mini-close" title="关闭悬浮小框">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div><!-- v92d-fix：此闭合属于 .sm-float（v92d 误删导致 tabbar 被包进 hidden 的悬浮小框，底部导航消失、无法切页） -->
  <!-- v92d：删除了此处多余的 </div>——它把 .phone 提前闭合，tabbar 与全部 .page 变成 body 直子，
       body 是 flex 横排居中，tabbar(≈119px) 与手机壳并排导致整壳在窄视口被推左（Edge 手机版排版错位的根因，
       即 #477 回归）。.phone 的闭合由下方 tabbar 之后的 </div> 承担。 -->
  <!-- 底部 tab（必须在 .phone 内、所有 .page 之外；嵌在 page-chat 内时 hidden 联动消失） -->
  <!-- FIX 2026-09-14 #477：位置不变量——本块必须整体保持在下方 .phone 闭合（2 空格缩进的 </div>）之前。
       810ab22 补 #474 第 3 个闭合后本块被留在 .phone 闭合之外＝body 直子；body 是 flex 横排居中
      （#301 同机理），tabbar 作为 .phone 的下一个 flex 项被排到手机壳右侧＝红米 K80 Chrome 等
       多机型「桌面底部导航跑到右侧」（无头 390 宽实测 w=118/left=331/底缘 459，整壳同时被推左）。
      #467 旧哨兵只锚注释文字＝位置哑哨兵，已换 #467/#477 位置锚（build.mjs）；
       tools/verify-page-nesting.mjs S3/S5/B5b/B5c 同步锚定，改本块位置/缩进必须同批同步。 -->
  <div class="tabbar">
    <div class="tab active" data-page="page-phone">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="3" width="12" height="18" rx="3.5"/><path d="M10 17.5h4"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="tab" data-page="page-chatcard">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4"/><path d="M7.5 9h9M7.5 13h9M7.5 17h5"/></svg>
